      "explanation": "This is a Second Conditional sentence. The 'if' clause uses the Past Simple tense."
    },
    {
      "question": "They would be happy if you ___ them.",
      "options": ["visited", "visit", "would visit", "had visited"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "This is a Second Conditional sentence. The 'if' clause uses the Past Simple tense."
    },
    {
      "question": "If it weren't raining, we ___ have a picnic outside.",
      "options": ["would", "will", "can", "could"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "This is a Second Conditional sentence. The main clause uses 'would + base verb' to describe the hypothetical result. 'If it weren't raining' is a common way to express the past simple in a hypothetical context."
    },
    {
      "question": "If I ___ fly, I would go to America today.",
      "options": ["could", "can", "would", "will"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "This is a Second Conditional sentence. 'Could' is the past simple form of 'can' and is used here to express a hypothetical ability."
    },
    {
      "question": "Where ___ you live if you could choose any country?",
      "options": ["would", "will", "can", "could"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "This is a Second Conditional question. The main clause uses 'would' to ask about a hypothetical situation."
    },
    {
      "question": "How ___ water do you drink every day?",
      "options": ["much", "many", "a lot of", "few"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Water' is an uncountable noun, so 'much' is used with 'how' to ask about quantity."
    },
    {
      "question": "There are ___ students in the classroom today.",
      "options": ["many", "much", "little", "a little"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Students' is a countable plural noun, so 'many' is used."
    },
    {
      "question": "I have ___ friends, so I am never lonely.",
      "options": ["many", "much", "a little", "few"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Friends' is a countable plural noun. 'Many' indicates a large number, fitting the context of not being lonely."
    },
    {
      "question": "We have very ___ time left. Hurry up!",
      "options": ["little", "few", "many", "a lot of"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Time' is an uncountable noun. 'Very little' means a small amount, which fits the context of 'Hurry up!'."
    },
    {
      "question": "He only has a ___ mistakes in his test.",
      "options": ["few", "little", "much", "many"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Mistakes' is a countable plural noun. 'A few' means a small, but positive, number. 'Only a few' emphasizes the small number."
    },
    {
      "question": "How ___ books did you buy yesterday?",
      "options": ["many", "much", "little", "a little"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Books' is a countable plural noun, so 'many' is used with 'how' to ask about quantity."
    },
    {
      "question": "Do you put ___ sugar in your tea?",
      "options": ["much", "many", "few", "a few"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Sugar' is an uncountable noun, so 'much' is used."
    },
    {
      "question": "There are a ___ apples in the fridge, enough for a cake.",
      "options": ["few", "little", "much", "a lot of"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Apples' is a countable plural noun. 'A few' means a small, but sufficient, number, which fits 'enough for a cake'."
    },
    {
      "question": "I don't have ___ money with me today.",
      "options": ["much", "many", "few", "a few"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'Money' is an uncountable noun, so 'much' is used in negative sentences."
    },
    {
      "question": "She speaks a ___ English, so she can order food.",
      "options": ["little", "few", "many", "a lot of"],
      "correct_index": 0,
      "explanation": "'English' (as a language proficiency) is treated as an uncountable noun. 'A little' means a small, but   Б6."}, {"question": "BFS va DFS ikkala algoritm uchun ham umumiy bo'lgan xususiyat qaysi?", "options": ["Grafdagi barcha tugunlarni ziyorat qilish", "Har doim eng qisqa yo'lni topish", "Faqat yo'naltirilgan graflarda ishlash", "Xotira murakkabligi O(1) bo'lishi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "BFS va DFS ikkalasi ham grafdagi barcha tugunlarni (agar ular bog'langan bo'lsa) ziyorat qilish (traversal) uchun ishlatiladi."}, {"question": "Nuqta (Point) tekislikda qanday ifodalanadi?", "options": ["Uchta koordinata (x, y, z) bilan", "Vektor bilan", "Ikkita koordinata (x, y) bilan", "Faqat bitta koordinata bilan"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Nuqta (Point) tekislikda ikkita koordinata (x, y) bilan ifodalanadi."}, {"question": "Agar daraxtda 8 ta tugun mavjud bo'lsa uning Pryufer kodi uzunligi nechchiga teng boвЂladi?", "options": ["9", "6", "8", "7"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Pryufer kodi uzunligi n-2 formulasi bo'yicha, 8 ta tugun bo'lsa, 8-2 = 6 ga teng bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Birlashtirib saralash (Merge Sort)ning eng yomon holatdagi (Worst case) vaqt murakkabligi qanday?", "options": ["O(n)", "O(n^2)", "O(log n)", "O(n log n)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Merge Sortning eng yomon holatdagi vaqt murakkabligi ham O(n log n) ga teng, chunki u har doim massivni teng ikkiga bo'ladi va birlashtirish operatsiyasi chiziqli vaqtda bajariladi, bu uni boshqa saralash algoritmlaridan farqli o'laroq, holatga bog'liq emas qiladi."}, {"question": "SHA-256 algoritmi keng qoвЂllaniladigan soha qaysi?", "options": ["Ma'lumotlarni saralash", "Kriptovalyutalar (masalan, Bitcoin) va raqamli imzolarda", "Grafik dizayn", "Ma'lumotlar bazasini boshqarish"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "SHA-256 (Secure Hash Algorithm 256-bit) kriptovalyutalar (masalan, Bitcoin) va raqamli imzolarda ma'lumotlar yaxlitligini va xavfsizligini ta'minlash uchun keng qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "Primitiv (sodda) qidiruv algoritmining eng yomon holatdagi vaqt murakkabligi qanday?", "options": ["O(n)", "O(m)", "O(m*n)", "O(m+n)"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Primitiv (sodda) qidiruv algoritmining eng yomon holatdagi vaqt murakkabligi O(m*n) ga teng, bu yerda n - matn uzunligi, m - qidirilayotgan qismiy satr uzunligi."}, {"question": "Daraxt tuzilmasida o'lcham nima?", "options": ["Daraxtdagi qirralar soni", "Daraxtdagi tugunlar soni", "Daraxtning balandligi", "Daraxtning maksimal sathi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Daraxt tuzilmasida 'o'lcham' (size) odatda daraxtdagi tugunlar sonini anglatadi."}, {"question": "Agar daraxt left-right (chap-o'ng) og'ish holatida bo'lsa bunday daraxtni muvozanatga keltirishda uni qaysi tomonga aylantiriladi?", "options": ["Chapga, keyin o'ngga", "Faqat o'ngga", "Faqat chapga", "O'ngga, keyin chapga"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Left-Right (LR) og'ish holatida daraxtni muvozanatga keltirish uchun avval chap farzandni o'ngga, so'ngra ota tugunni chapga aylantirish kerak (ya'ni, o'ngga, keyin chapga aylantirish)."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq graf nima?", "options": ["Yo'naltirilgan graf", "Hech qanday qirrasi bo'lmagan graf", "Faqat bitta tuguni bo'lgan graf", "Barcha tugunlar bir-biriga bog'langan graf"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "To'liq graf (Complete Graph) - bu har bir tugun boshqa barcha tugunlar bilan bevosita qirra orqali bog'langan graf."}, {"question": "Model nima?", "options": ["Dasturlash tili", "Real dunyo ob'ektining soddalashtirilgan tasviri", "Kompyuter dasturi", "Ma'lumotlar bazasi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Model - bu real dunyo ob'ektining, tizimining yoki jarayonining soddalashtirilgan, abstrakt tasviri bo'lib, uning asosiy xususiyatlarini aks ettiradi."}, {"question": "Algoritm ishlashi uchun talab qilinadigan qo'shimcha xotira (Space Complexity) qancha?", "options": ["O(n)", "O(1)", "O(log n)", "O(n^2)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Merge Sort algoritmi birlashtirish operatsiyasi uchun qo'shimcha massiv talab qiladi, shuning uchun uning xotira murakkabligi O(n) ga teng."}, {"question": "Agar daraxtda n ta tugun boвЂlsa,    Вunda nechta qirra boвЂladi?", "options": ["n", "2n", "n-1", "n+1"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Daraxtda n ta tugun bo'lsa, unda har doim n-1 ta qirra bo'ladi."}, {"question": "B-daraxtda qidiruv (search) amali qanday vaqt murakkabligiga ega?", "options": ["O(t * log_t n)", "O(n)", "O(log_t n)", "O(log n)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "B-daraxtda qidiruv amali O(t * log_t n) vaqt murakkabligiga ega, bu yerda t - daraxtning tartibi. Amalda, bu O(log n) ga juda yaqin, chunki t odatda kichik doimiy qiymatdir."}, {"question": "Orientation (yoвЂnalish) nima aniqlaydi?", "options": ["Uchta nuqtaning bir to'g'ri chiziqda joylashganligini yoki soat yo'nalishi bo'yicha/teskari yo'nalishda ekanligini", "To'rt nuqtaning shaklini", "Ikki nuqta orasidagi masofani", "Ikki chiziqning kesishish nuqtasini"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Orientation (yo'nalish) uchta nuqtaning bir to'g'ri chiziqda joylashganligini (kollinear), soat yo'nalishi bo'yicha (clockwise) yoki soat yo'nalishiga teskari (counter-clockwise) yo'nalishda ekanligini aniqlaydi."}, {"question": "Qismiy satr nima?", "options": ["Asosiy satrning barcha belgilarini o'z ichiga olgan satr", "Bitta belgidan iborat satr", "Asosiy satrning teskari tartibdagi versiyasi", "Asosiy satrning bir qismi bo'lgan ketma-ket belgilar to'plami"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Qismiy satr (Substring) - bu asosiy satrning bir qismi bo'lgan ketma-ket belgilar to'plami."}, {"question": "Agar B daraxtdagi tugunda n ta kalit bo'lsa, shu tugunning farzandlari soni nechta bo'ladi?", "options": ["n", "n+1", "2n", "n-1"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "B-daraxtda agar tugunda n ta kalit bo'lsa, u n+1 ta farzandga ega bo'ladi."}, {"question": "AVL daraxtda tugun muvozanatlangan hisoblanishi uchun uning Balance Factor (BF) qiymati qanday bo'lishi kerak?", "options": ["Faqat 0", "Har qanday butun son", "-1, 0 yoki 1", "Faqat 1 yoki -1"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "AVL daraxtida tugun muvozanatlangan hisoblanishi uchun uning Balance Factor (BF) qiymati -1, 0 yoki 1 bo'lishi kerak."}, {"question": "Insertion Sortning eng yaxshi holat murakkabligi qanday?", "options": ["O(n^2)", "O(1)", "O(n log n)", "O(n)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Insertion Sortning eng yaxshi holati (massiv allaqachon saralangan bo'lsa) O(n) chiziqli murakkablikka ega, chunki har bir element faqat bir marta tekshiriladi."}, {"question": "B daraxtda tugun kalit(qiymat) lar bilan to'lib qolganda (2t-1 ta kalit) qanday amal bajariladi?", "options": ["Yangi tugun qo'shiladi", "Tugun o'chiriladi", "Tugun bo'linadi (split)", "Daraxt qayta quriladi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "B-daraxtda tugun maksimal kalitlar soniga (2t-1) yetganda, u bo'linadi (split) va o'rtadagi kalit ota tugunga ko'tariladi."}, {"question": "Algoritmning qaysi xossasi u chekli qadamlardan iboratligini bildiradi?", "options": ["Diskretlik", "Aniqlovchanlik", "Ommaviylik", "Cheklilik"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Algoritmning cheklilik (finiteness) xossasi uning chekli sondagi qadamlardan iborat bo'lishini va ma'lum vaqt ichida yakunlanishini bildiradi."}, {"question": "Heap-Sort algoritmining o'rtacha va eng yomon holatdagi vaqt murakkabligi qanday?", "options": ["O(n log n)", "O(log n)", "O(n^2)", "O(n)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Heap-Sort algoritmining o'rtacha va eng yomon holatdagi vaqt murakkabligi O(n log n) ga teng."}, {"question": "for(int i=0; i<n; i++) { for(int j=0; j<n; j++) { cout << i+j; } } Ushbu ichma-ich joylashgan takrorlash operatoridan iborat boвЂlgan kodning murakkabligini toping.", "options": ["O(log n)", "O(n^2)", "O(n^3)", "O(n)"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ichma-ich joylashgan ikkita tsikl mavjud bo'lib, har biri 'n' marta takrorlanadi, shuning uchun umumiy murakkablik O(n*n) = O(n^2) (kvadratik) bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Heap-Sort algoritmi ishlashi uchun qancha qo'shimcha xotira talab qilinadi (Space Complexity)?", "options": ["O(1)", "O(log n)", "O(n)", "O(n^2)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Heap-Sort algoritmi joyida (in-place) sarala   Гsh algoritmi hisoblanadi, shuning uchun uning qo'shimcha xotira murakkabligi O(1) ga teng."}, {"question": "MaвЂ™lumotlarning abstrakt turlarida maвЂ™lumotning xotirada qanday saqlanishi muhimmi?", "options": ["Ha, har doim muhim", "Faqat ba'zi hollarda", "Faqat dasturlash tiliga bog'liq", "Yo'q, muhim emas"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Abstrakt ma'lumotlar turlarida (ADT) ma'lumotlarning xotirada qanday saqlanishi muhim emas, balki ularga qanday amallar bajarilishi va ularning xulq-atvori muhimdir. Implementatsiya tafsilotlari yashiriladi."}, {"question": "Birlashtirib saralash (Merge Sort)ning eng yaxshi holatdagi (Best case) vaqt murakkabligi qanday?", "options": ["O(n log n)", "O(n^2)", "O(n)", "O(log n)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Merge Sortning eng yaxshi holatdagi vaqt murakkabligi O(n log n) ga teng, chunki u har doim massivni teng ikkiga bo'ladi va birlashtirish operatsiyasi chiziqli vaqtda bajariladi."}, {"question": "Ikkilik qidiruv daraxtida (Binary Search Tree) qidirish murakkabligi eng yomon holatda qanday?", "options": ["O(1)", "O(n log n)", "O(n)", "O(log n)"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Ikkilik qidiruv daraxtida (BST) eng yomon holatda (daraxt chiziqli bo'lib qolsa) qidirish murakkabligi O(n) ga teng bo'ladi."}, {"question": "MaвЂ™lumotlar tuzilmalari tuzilishiga koвЂra qanday turlarga boвЂlinadi?", "options": ["Abstrakt va konkret", "Oddiy va murakkab", "Statik va dinamik", "Chiziqli va chiziqli bo'lmagan"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ma'lumotlar tuzilmalari tuzilishiga ko'ra asosan chiziqli (massiv, bog'lamli ro'yxat, stek, navbat) va chiziqli bo'lmagan (daraxt, graf) turlarga bo'linadi."}, {"question": "DFS algoritmi rekursiv tarzda bajarilganda qaysi maвЂ™lumot tuzilmasi bilvosita ishlatiladi?", "options": ["Xesh jadval", "Stek", "Navbat", "Massiv"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "DFS (Depth-First Search) algoritmi rekursiv tarzda bajarilganda, funksiya chaqiruvlari steki (Call Stack) bilvosita stek ma'lumotlar tuzilmasi sifatida ishlatiladi."}, {"question": "Tugunni bo'lish paytida qaysi kalit yuqoriga (ota tugunga) ko'tariladi?", "options": ["O'rtadagi kalit", "Eng kichik kalit", "Tasodifiy kalit", "Eng katta kalit"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Tugunni bo'lish (split) paytida, tugundagi kalitlarning o'rtadagi kaliti yuqoriga (ota tugunga) ko'tariladi."}, {"question": "Navbat qaysi tamoyil asosida ishlaydi?", "options": ["Random Access", "Priority Based", "FIFO (First-In, First-Out)", "LIFO (Last-In, First-Out)"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Navbat FIFO (First-In, First-Out) tamoyili asosida ishlaydi, ya'ni birinchi qo'shilgan element birinchi bo'lib olinadi."}, {"question": "Avalanche Effect tushunchasi nimani anglatadi?", "options": ["Xesh funksiyaning tez ishlashini", "Xesh funksiyaning kolliziyalarni bartaraf etishini", "Xesh funksiyaning doimiy uzunlikdagi xesh qaytarishini", "Kirish ma'lumotlaridagi kichik o'zgarish xesh qiymatida katta o'zgarishlarga olib kelishini"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Avalanche Effect (Qor ko'chkisi effekti) - bu kriptografik xesh funksiyaning muhim xususiyati bo'lib, kirish ma'lumotlaridagi hatto bir bitlik kichik o'zgarish ham natijaviy xesh qiymatida sezilarli (taxminan yarmi) o'zgarishlarga olib kelishini anglatadi."}, {"question": "Stekdan elementni olib tashlash amali qanday ataladi?", "options": ["Push", "Enqueue", "Pop", "Dequeue"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Stekdan elementni olib tashlash amali 'Pop' deb ataladi."}, {"question": "Xesh jadvaldagi oвЂrtacha qidiruv murakkabligi qanday?", "options": ["O(n)", "O(n^2)", "O(log n)", "O(1)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Yaxshi xesh funksiya va kolliziyani samarali hal qilish usullari bilan xesh jadvaldagi o'rtacha qidiruv murakkabligi O(1) (doimiy) ga teng."}, {"question": "Qaysi javobda satrdan qismiy satrni qidirishga toвЂgвЂri misol keltirilgan?", "options": ["Daraxtdan tugunni qidirish", "Ikkita sonni qo'shish", "Matndan 'salom' so'zini topish", "Massivdan elementni topish"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Matn   Дdan 'salom' so'zini topish - bu katta satr (matn) ichidan kichik satr (qismiy satr) ni qidirishga to'g'ri misol."}, {"question": "AVL daraxtida qidirish operatsiyasining vaqt murakkabligi (Time Complexity) qancha?", "options": ["O(n)", "O(1)", "O(log n)", "O(n log n)"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "AVL daraxti muvozanatlangan bo'lganligi sababli, qidirish operatsiyasining vaqt murakkabligi har doim O(log n) ga teng."}, {"question": "Quyidagi algoritmlardan qaysi biri kriptografik xesh algoritm hisoblanadi?", "options": ["Fowler-Noll-Vo (FNV)", "Adler-32", "MD5", "CRC32"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "MD5 (Message-Digest Algorithm 5) kriptografik xesh algoritm hisoblanadi, garchi u hozirgi kunda xavfsizlik maqsadlarida tavsiya etilmasa ham, u kriptografik xesh funksiya sifatida yaratilgan."}, {"question": "Binar uyumni massivda saqlashda i-indeksdagi tugunning chap bolasi qaysi formuladan topiladi?", "options": ["i / 2", "2 * i + 1", "2 * i + 2", "(i - 1) / 2"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Binar uyumni massivda saqlashda (0-indeksdan boshlab), i-indeksdagi tugunning chap bolasi 2 * i + 1 formulasi bilan topiladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri eng yomon (eng tez oвЂsuvchi) murakkablik hisoblanadi?", "options": ["O(n)", "O(n!)", "O(n^2)", "O(log n)"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "O(n!) (faktorial murakkablik) eng tez o'suvchi murakkablikdir, chunki n qiymati oshgani sari u juda tez o'sadi."}, {"question": "Quyidagi holatlardan qaysi biri hash tableda kolliziya yuz berganini bildiradi?", "options": ["Ikki xil kalit uchun xesh funksiya bir xil indeksni qaytarsa", "Xesh jadval to'la bo'lsa", "Xesh jadval bo'sh bo'lsa", "Ikki xil kalit uchun xesh funksiya turli indekslarni qaytarsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Hash tableda kolliziya (collision) ikki xil kalit uchun xesh funksiya bir xil indeksni qaytarganda yuz beradi."}, {"question": "QoвЂshnichilik roвЂyxati (adjacency list) nimani bildiradi?", "options": ["Har bir tugun uchun unga qo'shni bo'lgan tugunlar ro'yxati", "Grafdagi barcha qirralar ro'yxati", "Grafning og'irliklari ro'yxati", "Grafdagi barcha tugunlar ro'yxati"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qo'shnichilik ro'yxati (Adjacency List) - bu har bir tugun uchun unga bevosita qo'shni bo'lgan tugunlar ro'yxatini saqlovchi ma'lumotlar tuzilmasi."}, {"question": "Agar daraxt left-left (chap-chap) og'ish holatida bo'lsa bunday daraxtni muvozanatga keltirishda uni qaysi tomonga aylantiriladi?", "options": ["Chapga, keyin o'ngga", "Faqat chapga", "Faqat o'ngga", "O'ngga, keyin chapga"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Left-Left (LL) og'ish holatida daraxtni muvozanatga keltirish uchun bitta o'ng aylantirish (Right Rotation) bajariladi."}, {"question": "Daraxtda ajdod (ancestor) deb qaysi tugunlarga aytiladi?", "options": ["Tugunning farzandlari", "Tugunning barglari", "Tugunning aka-ukalari", "Tugunning ota-onasi va undan yuqoridagi barcha tugunlar"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Daraxtda ajdod (ancestor) - bu tanlangan tugunning ota-onasi va undan yuqoridagi ildizgacha bo'lgan barcha tugunlar."}, {"question": "OвЂsish tartibida saralash qanday nomlanadi?", "options": ["Mixed Sort", "Random Sort", "Ascending Sort", "Descending Sort"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "O'sish tartibida saralash (kichikdan kattaga) Ascending Sort deb nomlanadi."}, {"question": "C++ STL da tayyor xesh jadval konteyneri qaysi?", "options": ["std::unordered_map", "std::map", "std::set", "std::vector"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "C++ STL (Standard Template Library) da `std::unordered_map` va `std::unordered_set` xesh jadvalga asoslangan konteynerlardir."}, {"question": "Tez saralash (Quick sort) algoritmi kim tomonidan yaratilgan?", "options": ["Donald Knuth", "Edsger Dijkstra", "Alan Turing", "Tony Hoare"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Tez saralash (Quick Sort) algoritmi 1960 yilda Tony Hoare tomonidan yaratilgan."}, {"question": "Qaysi javobda Logarifmik murakkablik keltirilgan?", "options": ["O(log n)", "O(n!)", "O(n^2)", "O(n)"], "correct_index": 0, "e   јxplanation": "O(log n) logarifmik murakkablikni ifodalaydi, bu juda samarali hisoblash murakkabligi hisoblanadi."}, {"question": "Binar uyumda i-indeksdagi tugunning ota tuguni (parent) qaysi formula bilan topiladi?", "options": ["2 * i + 2", "2 * i + 1", "(i - 1) / 2", "i / 2"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Binar uyumda (0-indeksdan boshlab) i-indeksdagi tugunning ota tuguni (parent) (i - 1) / 2 formulasi bilan topiladi (butun sonli bo'linish)."}, {"question": "Open Addressing usulining mohiyati nimada?", "options": ["Kolliziya yuz berganda bog'lamli ro'yxatdan foydalanish", "Kolliziya yuz berganda yangi xesh jadval yaratish", "Kolliziya yuz berganda elementni o'chirish", "Kolliziya yuz berganda boshqa bo'sh joyni topish uchun jadvalning o'zida izlash"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Open Addressing (Ochiq adreslash) usulining mohiyati shundaki, kolliziya yuz berganda, elementni saqlash uchun boshqa bo'sh joyni topish maqsadida xesh jadvalning o'zida (turli tekshirish strategiyalari yordamida) izlash amalga oshiriladi."}, {"question": "Agar daraxt right-left (o'ng-chap) og'ish holatida bo'lsa bunday daraxtni muvozanatga keltirishda uni qaysi tomonga aylantiriladi?", "options": ["Faqat chapga", "Chapga, keyin o'ngga", "O'ngga, keyin chapga", "Faqat o'ngga"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Right-Left (RL) og'ish holatida daraxtni muvozanatga keltirish uchun avval o'ng farzandni chapga, so'ngra ota tugunni o'ngga aylantirish kerak (ya'ni, chapga, keyin o'ngga aylantirish)."}, {"question": "Quyidagi usullardan qaysi biri kolliziyani bartaraf etish uchun qoвЂllaniladi?", "options": ["Linear Probing (Chiziqli tekshirish)", "Binary Search", "Quick Sort", "Merge Sort"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Linear Probing (Chiziqli tekshirish) - bu ochiq adreslash (Open Addressing) usulining bir turi bo'lib, kolliziya yuz berganda keyingi bo'sh joyni topish uchun ketma-ket indekslarni tekshiradi."}, {"question": "B-daraxtning tartibi t bo'lsa, tugundagi maksimal kalitlar soni qanday formula bilan aniqlanadi?", "options": ["2t", "t", "t-1", "2t-1"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "B-daraxtning tartibi t bo'lsa, tugundagi maksimal kalitlar soni 2t-1 ga teng."}, {"question": "Satr (ing. String) nima?", "options": ["Faqat raqamlardan iborat ketma-ketlik", "Faqat harflardan iborat ketma-ketlik", "Bitta belgi", "Belgilar (char) ketma-ketligi"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Satr (String) - bu belgilar (char) ketma-ketligi bo'lib, odatda matnni ifodalash uchun ishlatiladi."}, {"question": "Kamayish tartibida saralash qanday nomlanadi?", "options": ["Ascending Sort", "Unstable Sort", "Descending Sort", "Stable Sort"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Kamayish tartibida saralash (kattadan kichikka) Descending Sort deb nomlanadi."}, {"question": "Agar algoritm doimiy vaqt ichida bajarilsa, uning murakkabligi qanday boвЂladi?", "options": ["O(n)", "O(log n)", "O(n^2)", "O(1)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Agar algoritm doimiy vaqt ichida bajarilsa, uning murakkabligi O(1) (doimiy murakkablik) deb belgilanadi, ya'ni kirish ma'lumotlari hajmiga bog'liq emas."}, {"question": "External Sorting (Tashqi saralash) uchun nega Birlashtirib saralash (Merge Sort) tanlanadi?", "options": ["U katta ma'lumotlar to'plamini diskdan o'qib, saralash va yozish uchun samarali bo'lgani uchun", "Uning eng yomon holatdagi murakkabligi O(n^2) bo'lgani uchun", "Uning xotira murakkabligi O(1) bo'lgani uchun", "Uning implementatsiyasi juda oddiy bo'lgani uchun"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Merge Sort tashqi saralash uchun juda mos keladi, chunki u katta ma'lumotlar to'plamini kichik qismlarga bo'lib, ularni diskdan o'qib, saralash va qayta yozish jarayonini samarali boshqara oladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri eng yaxshi (eng sekin oвЂsuvchi) murakkablik hisoblanadi?", "options": ["O(log n)", "O(1)", "O(n)", "O(n^2)"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "O(1) (doimiy murakkablik) eng sekin o'suvchi murakkablikdir, chunki u kirish ma'lumotlari hajmiga bog'liq emas."}, {"question": "Graf G = (V, E) da   ы    —ы                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      