ma'lum bo'lishi lozim."}, {"question": "Agar masalada xarajatlarni kamaytirish soвЂralsa, maqsad funksiyasi nimaga intiladi?", "options": ["Minimumga (min)", "Maksimumga (max)", "Birga", "O'zgarmasga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xarajatlarni minimallashtirish uchun maqsad funksiyasi min ga intiladi."}, {"question": "z = x^2 boвЂlsa, ikkinchi tartibli z_xx'' hosilani toping:", "options": ["0", "2x", "x", "2"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Birinchi hosila z_x' = 2x, ikkinchi hosila z_xx'' = (2x)' = 2."}, {"question": "Р¤(x, y, О») = x + y + О»(x^2 + y^2 - 1) Lagranj funksiyasidan x boвЂyicha hosila oling:", "options": ["2О»x", "1 + 2О»x", "1 + О»", "1 + 2О»y"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "x bo'yicha xususiy hosila: (x)' + (y)' + О»(x^2)' + О»(y^2)' - О»(1)' = 1 + 2О»x."}, {"question": "Ikki karrali integralda D sohaning diametr tushunchasi qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Soha markazidan masofa", "Soha chegarasining uzunligi", "Sohadagi ixtiyoriy ikki nuqta orasidagi eng katta masofa", "Soha yuzining kvadrati"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Sohaning diametri shu sohada yotuvchi barcha juft nuqtalar orasidagi masofalarning eng kattasiga teng."}, {"question": "в€‚^2 z / в€‚x^2 koвЂrinishidagi hosila nima deyiladi?", "options": ["y bo'yicha birinchi tartibli hosila", "Aralash hosila", "To'liq differensial", "x bo'yicha ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosila"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ushbu belgilash x o'zgaruvchisi bo'yicha olingan ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosiladir."}, {"question": "Bitta mahsulotdan 5000 soвЂm foyda qolsa, x ta mahsulotdan qancha foyda qoladi?", "options": ["x - 5000", "5000 + x", "5000x", "5000 / x"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "x ta mahsulotdan olinadigan umumiy foyda 5000 * x so'm bo'ladi."}, {"question": "вЂњMaqsad funksiyasiвЂќ deganda nimani tushunasiz?", "options": ["Cheklovlar tenglamasi", "Maksimallashtirilishi yoki minimallashtirilishi kerak bo'lgan matematik ifoda", "O'zgaruvchilarning nom