lgilanadi?", "options": ["z_y' yoki в€‚z/в€‚y", "в€†z", "dz", "z_x' yoki в€‚z/в€‚x"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "x bo'yicha xususiy hosila z_x' yoki в€‚z/в€‚x ko'rinishida belgilanadi."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq differensial qaysi harf bilan belgilanadi?", "options": ["dz", "в€†z", "z_x'", "d^2z"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "To'liq differensial dz belgisi bilan ifodalanadi."}, {"question": "Ikki karrali integralda D sohaning diametr tushunchasi qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Soha yuzining kvadrati", "Sohadagi ixtiyoriy ikki nuqta orasidagi eng katta masofa", "Soha markazidan masofa", "Soha chegarasining uzunligi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Sohaning diametri shu sohada yotuvchi barcha juft nuqtalar orasidagi masofalarning eng kattasiga teng."}, {"question": "OвЂyin industriyasida 3D modellarning yoritilishini hisoblashda nima qoвЂllaniladi?", "options": ["Faqat chiziqli integrallar", "Sirt integrallari va ikki karrali integrallar", "Algebraik tenglamalar", "Noma'lum ko'paytuvchilar"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "3D modellarda nur va soyaning tarqalishini hisoblashda sirt va ikki karrali integrallar ishlatiladi."}, {"question": "вЂњMaqsad funksiyasiвЂќ deganda nimani tushunasiz?", "options": ["Maksimallashtirilishi yoki minimallashtirilishi kerak bo'lgan matematik ifoda", "Cheklovlar tenglamasi", "Faqat nolga teng bo'lgan ifoda", "O'zgaruvchilarning nomanfiylik sharti"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Maqsad funksiyasi optimallashtirish masalasida erishilmoqchi bo'lgan asosiy mezonni ifodalaydi."}, {"question": "Ikki karrali integral qanday soha ustida hisoblanadi?", "options": ["Cheksiz to'g'ri chiziq ustida", "Faqat bir o'lchovli kesma ustida", "Faqat fazodagi shar ustida", "Tekislikdagi cheklangan D soha ustida"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ikki karrali integral 2D tekislikdagi cheklangan va yopiq D sohada hisoblanadi."}, {"question": "Modellashtirishning birinchi bosqichi nima?", "options": ["Masalaning qo'yilishi va maqsadni aniqlash", "Natijalarni tahlil qilish", "Dastur kodini yozish", "Matematik tenglamani yechish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Modellashtirish masalaning qo'yilishi va maqsadlarni belgilashdan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Funksiyada faqat x oвЂzgarganda olingan в€†_x z = f(x + в€†x, y) - f(x, y) ayirma nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Xususiy orttirma", "Xususiy hosila", "To'liq orttirma", "To'liq differensial"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Faqat bitta o'zgaruvchi x o'zgargandagi orttirma x bo'yicha xususiy orttirma deyiladi."}, {"question": "z = x^2 + y^2 funksiyaning statsionar nuqtasini toping:", "options": ["(0, 0)", "   Ш(1, 1)", "(0, 1)", "(1, 0)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z_x' = 2x = 0 va z_y' = 2y = 0 tenglamalardan x=0, y=0 kelib chiqadi. Statsionar nuqta (0,0)."}, {"question": "Maqsad funksiyasi вЂњmaxвЂќ boвЂlsa, nima izlanadi?", "options": ["Nol qiymat", "Minimal (eng kichik) qiymat", "Maksimal (eng katta) qiymat", "O'rtacha qiymat"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'max' belgisi maksimum (eng katta foyda yoki natija) izlanayotganini bildiradi."}, {"question": "Fermerning 10 ga yeri bor. BugвЂdoy x1 va sholi x2 uchun yer cheklovi qanday yoziladi?", "options": ["x1 * x2 в‰¤ 10", "x1 - x2 = 10", "x1 + x2 в‰¤ 10", "x1 + x2 в‰Ґ 10"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Ekin maydonlari yig'indisi umumiy yer maydoni 10 ga dan oshmasligi kerak: x1 + x2 в‰¤ 10."}, {"question": "Axborot xavfsizligida barmoq izi matematik modelini nima orqali qurish mumkin?", "options": ["Faqat oddiy qo'shish usuli bilan", "Chiziqli tenglamalar sistemasi bilan", "Ikki karrali integrallar va sirt tenglamalari orqali", "Tasodifiy sonlar generatori orqali"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Barmoq izi tasviridagi zichlik va sirt relyefini ikki karrali integrallar va sirt tenglamalari yordamida modellashtirish mumkin."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning yopiq sohadagi eng katta va eng kichik qiymatlari qayerda qidiriladi?", "options": ["Faqat soha chegarasida", "Faqat koordinata boshida", "Faqat soha markazida", "Soha ichidagi kritik nuqtalarda va soha chegarasida"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Yopiq sohada eng katta va eng kichik qiymatlar soha ichki kritik nuqtalarida hamda soha chegarasida qidiriladi."}, {"question": "Tikuvchilik korxonasi: 12 metr matodan koвЂylak (x1) uchun 3 metr, shim (x2) uchun 2 metr sarflansa, mato cheklovi qaysi javobda toвЂgвЂri?", "options": ["x1 + x2 в‰¤ 12", "2x1 + 3x2 в‰¤ 12", "3x1 + 2x2 в‰Ґ 12", "3x1 + 2x2 в‰¤ 12"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ko'ylakka 3x1, shimga 2x2 metr mato ketadi, jami sarf 12 metrdan oshmasligi kerak: 3x1 + 2x2 в‰¤ 12."}, {"question": "Agar ikki karrali integralda integral ostidagi funksiya 1 ga teng boвЂlsa, u nimani hisoblaydi?", "options": ["Sohaning hajmini", "Integrallash sohasi D ning yuzasini", "Perimetrni", "Og'irlik markazini"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "в€¬_D 1 dx dy integral D sohaning yuzasiga teng bo'ladi."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq differensialni hisoblash formulasini koвЂrsating:", "options": ["dz = z_x' dx + z_y' dy", "dz = z_x' + z_y'", "dz = dx + dy", "dz = z_x' dx - z_y' dy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiyaning to'liq differensiali dz = z_x' dx + z_y' dy formula bilan hisoblanadi."}, {"question": "Ikki karrali integralda oвЂzgarmas sonni integral belgisidan tashqariga chiqarish mumkinmi?", "options": ["Ha, mumkin", "Faqat nolga teng bo'lganda mumkin", "Yo'q, mumkin emas", "Faqat musbat bo'lsa mumkin"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Integral xossasiga ko'ra, o'zgarmas ko'paytuvchini integral belgisidan tashqariga chiqarish mumkin."}, {"question": "Muzqaymoq 20 soвЂm, pulingiz 100 soвЂm. Muzqaymoq soni x bo'lsa, toвЂgвЂri tengsizlikni toping:", "options": ["20x в‰Ґ 100", "20x = 100", "x в‰¤ 20", "20x в‰¤ 100"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Xarajat (20x) mavjud puldan (100) oshib ketmasligi kerak, ya'ni 20x в‰¤ 100."}, {"question": "z = 10x funksiyan