a (Ibodathona/Shtupa)", "Cherkov"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Buddistlarning diniy majmualari ibodathona, pagoda yoki shtupa deb ataladi."}, {"question": "Haj ibodati qayerda bajariladi?", "options": ["Qohira shahrida", "Makka shahrida", "Quddus shahrida", "Madina shahrida"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Haj ibodati Makkai Mukarramadagi Ka'ba va uning atrofidagi muqaddas joylarda bajariladi."}, {"question": "Muhammad (s.a.v.) qayerda tugвЂilganlar?", "options": ["Makka shahrida", "Quddus shahrida", "Madina shahrida", "Toif shahrida"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Muhammad (s.a.v.) milodiy 570-yilda Makka shahrida tug'ilganlar."}, {"question": "Buddizmning asosiy maqsadi nima?", "options": ["Azob-uqubatlardan xalos bo'lish va Nirvanaga erishish", "Urushlarda g'alaba qozonish", "Boylik orttirish", "Dunyo hukmronligiga erishish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Buddizm insonni azob-uqubatlardan va qayta tug'ilish zanjiridan qutqarib Nirvanaga olib borishni maqsad qiladi."}, {"question": "Hadislarni toвЂplagan mashhur kitoblardan biri?", "options": ["Al-Jome' as-Sahih (Imom Buxoriy)", "Katta Fiqh", "Tavrot", "Avesto"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Imom al-Buxoriyning \"Al-Jome' as-Sahih\" kitobi eng ishonchli hadislar to'plamidir."}, {"question": "Xristianlikning eng koвЂp tarqalgan yoвЂnalishi qaysi?", "options": ["Monofizitlik", "Protestantizm", "Pravoslavie", "Katolik"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Katolitsizm xristianlikning eng ko'p ketma-ket ergashuvchilariga ega bo'lgan yo'nalishidir."}, {"question": "Islomda kuniga necha mahal namoz oвЂqiladi?", "options": ["7 mahal", "5 mahal", "3 mahal", "1 mahal"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Islomda har bir balog'atga etgan musulmonga kuniga 5 mahal namoz farz qilingan."}, {"question": "Qiyos nimaga asoslanadi?", "options": ["Tush ko'rishga", "Boshqa dinlar tajribasiga", "Insonning shaxsiy xohishiga", "Qur'on va Sunnatdagi oxshash hukmlarni yangi masalaga solishtirish va tatbiq etishga"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Qiyos вЂ“ manbalarda hukmi bo'lmagan masalani sababi bir xil bo'lgan hukmli masalaga solishtirishdir."}, {"question": "Musulmonlarning haftalik jamoat namozi kuni qaysi?", "options": ["Yakshanba", "Dushanba", "Juma", "Shanba"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Juma kuni musulmonlar uchun haftalik jamoat namozi va bayram kuni hisoblanadi."}, {"question": "Buddizmning muqaddas kitoblari qaysi nom bilan yuritiladi?", "options": ["Tripitaka (Uch savat)", "Veda", "Bibliya", "Avesto"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Buddizmning muqaddas matnlari to'plami Tripitaka deb ataladi."}, {"question": "Hinduizm qaysi mamlakatda shakllangan?", "options": ["Hindiston", "Yaponiya", "Eron", "Xitoy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Hinduizm dini Hindiston yarimorolida shakllangan va rivojlangan."}, {"question": "Buddizmda axloqiy qonun yoki taвЂ™limot qanday ataladi?", "options": ["Sutra", "Sangxa", "Karma", "Dxarma"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Dxarma buddizmda borliq qonuniyati, burch va ta'limot ma'nolarini bildiradi."}, {"question": "Dinshunoslikda ilmiy yondashuv qanday boвЂladi?", "options": ["Xolis, ob'ektiv va neytral", "Faqat his-tuyg'ularga asoslangan", "Biryoqlama va tarafkash", "Mintaqaviy chegaralangan"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ilmiy yondashuv xolislik va betaraflik tamoyillariga tayangan holda olib boriladi."}, {"question": "Xristianlikning eng muhim bayramlaridan biri?", "options": ["Qurbon hayiti", "Navro'z", "Xanuka", "Pasha (Tirilish bayrami)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Pasha (Easter) Xristianlikdagi eng asosiy bayramlardan biri hisoblanadi."}, {"question": "Yahudiylarning asosiy ibodat joyi?", "options": ["Masiqit", "Sinagoga", "Ibodathona (Xram)", "Shtupa"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Yahudiylarning jamoat ibodatini bajaradigan joyi Sinagoga deyiladi."}   ч, {"question": "Tafsirning asosiy vazifasi nima?", "options": ["Qur'on oyatlarining ma'nolarini izohlash va tushuntirish", "Hadislarni yodlash", "Kitoblarni chop etish", "Namaz vaqtlarini belgilash"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Tafsir вЂ“ Qur'oni Karim oyatlarining ma'nosi, mazmuni va nozil bo'lish sabablarini sharhlaydigan fandir."}, {"question": "Buddizmning asoschisi kim?", "options": ["Konfutsiy", "Siddxartxa Gautama (Budda)", "Zardusht", "Lao-Tzi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Buddizm ta'limotiga miloddan avvalgi VI-V asrlarda Siddxartxa Gautama asos solgan."}, {"question": "Dinshunoslik qaysi soha bilan chambarchas bogвЂliq?", "options": ["Matematika va kibernetika", "Astronomiya va geografiya", "Tarix, falsafa va sotsiologiya", "Fizika va kimyo"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Dinshunoslik gumanitar va ijtimoiy fanlar, jumladan tarix, falsafa va sotsiologiya bilan yaqin bog'liq."}, {"question": "Dinshunoslikning jamiyatdagi roli nimada?", "options": ["Jamiyatda diniy ma'rifat va bag'rikenglikni oshirish", "Ijtimoiy nizolarni keltirib chiqarish", "Insonlarni faqat bitta e'tiqodga majburlash", "Texnik innovatsiyalarni yaratish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dinshunoslik jamiyatda to'g'ri diniy ma'rifatni tarqatish va dinlararo totuvlikni ta'minlashda muhim rol o'ynaydi."}, {"question": "Dinshunoslikning vazifalaridan biri qaysi?", "options": ["Moddiy ishlab chiqarishni oshirish", "Diniy hodisalarni ilmiy va tahliliy o'rganish", "Faqat diniy bayramlarni tashkillashtirish", "Aholini muayyan dinga o'tkazish"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Diniy hodisalarni ob'ektiv hamda xolis yondashuv asosida tahlil qilish dinshunoslikning asosiy vazifalaridan biridir."}, {"question": "Milliy dinlarning asosiy xususiyati?", "options": ["Kitoblari yo'qligi", "Ibodat tili yo'qligi", "Faqat ma'lum bir etnik guruh yoki xalq orasida tarqalganligi", "Butun dunyo bo'ylab keng yoyilishi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Milliy dinlar asosan bitta etnos yoki xalq doirasida saqlanib qoladi."}, {"question": "Xristianlik qaysi asrda vujudga kelgan?", "options": ["Milodiy XV asrda", "Milodiy VII asrda", "Miloddan avvalgi V asrda", "Milodiy I asrda"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Xristianlik milodiy I asrda Rim imperiyasining sharqiy qismida paydo bo'lgan."}, {"question": "Dinshunoslikning asosiy metodlaridan biri?", "options": ["Fizik tajriba", "Tarixiy-qiyosiy metod", "Kimyoviy analiz", "Matematik modellashtirish"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Tarixiy-qiyosiy metod dinlar rivojlanishi va o'xshashliklarini tahlil qilishda keng qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "Islomda sadaqa nima?", "options": ["Farz bo'lgan majburiy soliq", "Diniy bayram", "Ko'ngilli ravishda beriladigan ehson", "Ibodat turi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Sadaqa вЂ“ insonning o'z xohishi bilan savob umidida qiladigan moddiy yoki ma'naviy ehsonidir."}, {"question": "Milliy dinlarda marosim va urf-odatlar qanday ahamiyatga ega?", "options": ["Ikkinchi darajali", "Faqat sayyohlar uchun mo'ljallangan", "Hech qanday ahamiyatga ega emas", "Juda yuqori, etnik madaniyat bilan uzviy bog'liq"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Milliy dinlarda marosimlar va urf-odatlar milliylik hamda urf-odatlarni saqlashda muhim o'rin tutadi."}, {"question": "Xristianlikning muqaddas kitobi qaysi?", "options": ["Qur'on", "Avesto", "Tavrot", "Injil (Bibliya)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Xristianlikning muqaddas kitobi Injil (Bibliya) hisoblanadi."}, {"question": "Islomning birinchi farz amali?", "options": ["Iymon keltirish (Shahodat)", "Ro'za tutish", "Zakot berish", "Namoz o'qish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Islomdagi birinchi va eng muhim farz amal Allohga va Unining elchisiga iymon keltirishdir."}, {"question": "Musulmonlarning ibodat joyi?", "options": ["Cherkov", "Masjid", "Sinagoga", "Pagoda"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Musulmonlar jamoat bo'lib ibodat qiladigan muqaddas joy Masjid deyiladi."}, {"question": "Qaysi din milliy dinlarga misol boвЂla oladi?", "options": ["Islom", "Buddizm", "Xristianli    k", "Iudaizm (Yahudiylik)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Iudaizm muayyan bir millat (yahudiy xalqi) bilan bog'liq bo'lgan milliy dindir."}, {"question": "QurвЂ™ondan keyingi ikkinchi asosiy manba qaysi?", "options": ["Tafsir", "Ijmo'", "Sunnat (Hadislar)", "Qiyos"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Sunnat va Hadislar Islom shariatining ikkinchi asosiy manbasi sanaladi."}, {"question": "IjmoвЂ™ nima?", "options": ["Bir kishining shaxsiy qarori", "Islom olimlarining biror diniy masala bo'yicha bir ovozdan kelishuvi", "Qur'on o'qish qoidasi", "Davlat rahbari buyrug'i"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ijmo' вЂ“ bir davrdagi Islom mujtahid olimlarining diniy hukm borasidagi ittifoqidir."}, {"question": "Islom nechta asosiy ruknga ega?", "options": ["3 ta", "5 ta", "10 ta", "7 ta"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Islom dini 5 ta asosiy rukndan iborat: Iymon, Namoz, Ro'za, Zakot, Haj."}, {"question": "Milliy dinlar qaysi din turidan farq qiladi?", "options": ["Jahon dinlaridan", "Iptidoiy e'tiqodlardan", "An'anaviy e'tiqodlardan", "Qabila dinlaridan"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Milliy dinlar baynalminal bo'lmagani bilan barcha xalqlarni qamrab oladigan Jahon dinlaridan farq qiladi."}, {"question": "Hadislar nima?", "options": ["Faqat duolar to'plami", "Qadimiy shaqar qonunlari", "Sahobalarning o'z fikrlari", "Muhammad (s.a.v.)ning so'zlari va amallari haqidagi rivoyatlar"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Hadis вЂ“ Payg'ambarimiz (s.a.v.) so'zlari, amallari va sifatlari haqida yetib kelgan xabardir."}, {"question": "RoвЂza qaysi oyda tutiladi?", "options": ["Ramazon oyida", "Muharram oyida", "Sha'bon oyida", "Rujab oyida"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Farz bo'lgan ro'za Islom taqvimining Ramazon oyida tutiladi."}, {"question": "Dinshunoslikning predmeti nima?", "options": ["Dinning mohiyati, rivojlanishi va ijtimoiy funksiyalari", "Iqtisodiy jarayonlar", "Faqat ibodathonalarning me'morchiligi", "O'simliklar dunyosi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dinshunoslikning predmeti din va uning jamiyatdagi namoyon bo'lish qonuniyatlaridir."}, {"question": "Islom dini asoschisi kim?", "options": ["Muso (a.s.)", "Ibrohim (a.s.)", "Iso (a.s.)", "Muhammad (s.a.v.)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Islom dini Payg'ambari va uni yetkazuvchi asosiy shaxs Muhammad (s.a.v.) hisoblanadilar."}, {"question": "Xristianlikning markaziy gвЂoyasi?", "options": ["Etnik ustunlik", "Iso Masih orqali insoniyatni qutqarish va ilohiy sevgiga tayanish", "Olovga sig'inish", "Dunyo azob-uqubatdan iboratligi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Xristianlik Iso Masihning qurbonligi orqali insoniyatning najot topishi g'oyasiga asoslanadi."}, {"question": "Buddizmning asosiy amaliyotlaridan biri?", "options": ["Ro'za tutish", "Meditatsiya", "Qurbonlik qilish", "Olovga sig'inish"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Meditatsiya ongni tozalash va ruhiy yuksalish uchun buddizmda asosiy amaliyotdir."}, {"question": "Yahudiylikning asosiy muqaddas kitobi?", "options": ["Qur'on", "Tavrot (Tora)", "Tripitaka", "Zend-Avesto"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Tavrot (Tora) yahudiylikning eng asosiy va muqaddas manbasi hisoblanadi."}, {"question": "Dinshunoslikning yana bir vazifasi nima?", "options": ["Bag'rikenglik va diniy bag'rikenglik madaniyatini rivojlantirish", "Siyosiy qarorlarni qabul qilish", "Tadbirkorlikni rivojlantirish", "Sog'liqni saqlash tizimini nazorat qilish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dinlararo bag'rikenglik va tinch-totuvlikni ta'minlashga ko'maklashish uning muhim vazifasidir."}, {"question": "Buddizmda qayta tugвЂilish eвЂ™tiqodi qanday ataladi?", "options": ["Sutrabitaka", "Dxarma", "Samsara", "Nirvana"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Qayta tug'ilish zanjiri buddizmda ham Samsara deyiladi."}, {"question": "Zakot kimlarga beriladi?", "options": ["Boy insonlarga", "Ehtiyojmand va kambag'allarga", "Faqat davlat arboblariga", "Barcha qarindoshlarga"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Zakot jamiyatdagi muhtoj, kambag'al va belgilangan toifa insonlarga beriladi."}]}j†Ў6   щlar orasida potensiallar farqi hosil boвЂlishi qanday nomlanadi?", "options": ["Peltiye effekti", "Zeyebek effekti", "Tomsom effekti", "Kontakt potensiallar farqi"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Chiqish ishi har xil metallar tekkanda elektronlar diffuziyasi natijasida kontakt potensiallar farqi yuzaga keladi."}, {"question": "Taqiqlangan soha kengligi (Eg) ortishi bilan zaryad tashuvchilar konsentratsiyasi qanday oвЂ™zgaradi?", "options": ["Nolga tenglashib keyin ortadi", "Ortadi", "Kamayadi", "O'zgarmaydi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Taqiqlangan soha qanchalik keng bo'lsa, elektronlarning u yoqqa o'tish ehtimoli shuncha kam bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kontakt potensiallar farqi tashqi zanjirdagi tokka qanday taвЂ™sir qiladi?", "options": ["O'zgaruvchan tok hosil qiladi", "Zanjirni kuydiradi", "Doimiy tok hosil qiladi", "U tashqi berk zanjirda tok hosil qila olmaydi"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Termodinamik muvozanat holatida berk zanjirdagi kontakt potensiallar yig'indisi nolga teng bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Valent sohadagi elektron oвЂ™tkazuvchanlik sohasiga oвЂ™tganda, u yerda qolgan boвЂ™sh oвЂ™rin nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Foton", "Kovak", "Iton", "Phonon"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Elektron ketgan joyda musbat zaryadli zarracha kabi o'zini tutuvchi kovak hosil bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Chiqish ishi turlicha boвЂlgan ikki metall tekkizilganda, elektronlar qaysi metalldan qaysinisiga oвЂtadi?", "options": ["O'tish sodir bo'lmaydi", "Haroratga bog'liq ravishda ixtiyoriy yo'nalishda", "Chiqish ishi katta metalldan chiqish ishi kichik metallga", "Chiqish ishi kichik metalldan chiqish ishi katta metallga"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Chiqish ishi kichik bo'lgan metalldan elektronlar osonroq ajralib, ikkinchi metallga o'tadi."}, {"question": "Neytron erkin holatda parchalanganda qanday zarrachalar hosil boвЂladi?", "options": ["Faqat gamma kvantlar", "Proton, elektron va antineytrino", "Alfa zarracha va elektron", "Proton va pozitron"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Erkin neytron beqaror bo'lib, beta-yemirilish natijasida proton, elektron va elektron antineytrinosiga parchalanadi."}, {"question": "Zaryadlar soni (Z) bir xil, neytronlar soni (N) har xil boвЂlgan yadrolar nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Izotoplar", "Izomerlar", "Izobarlar", "Izotonlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bir xil kimyoviy elementning yadro zaryadi Z bir xil bo'lib, massa soni A har xil bo'lgan turlari izotoplar deyiladi."}, {"question": "Taqiqlangan sohasining kengligi (О”E) juda katta (bir necha eV) boвЂlgan moddalar nima deb ataladi?", "options": ["Yarim o'tkazgichlar", "O'tkazgichlar", "Dielektriklar", "O'ta o'tkazgichlar"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Dielektriklarda taqiqlangan soha keng bo'lgani uchun elektronlar o'tkazuvchanlik sohasiga o'ta olmaydi."}, {"question": "Alfa (О±) yemirilishda yadroning massa soni (A) va zaryadi (Z) qanday oвЂzgaradi?", "options": ["A 1 ga kamayadi, Z o'zgarmaydi", "A 2 ga, Z 4 ga kamayadi", "A 4 ga, Z 2 ga kamayadi", "A o'zgarmaydi, Z 1 ga ortadi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Alfa zarracha Geliy yadrosi (4/2 He) bo'lgani uchun yadro massasi 4 ga, zaryadi 2 ga kamayadi."}, {"question": "Qattiq jismlarda elektronlarning energetik sohalarga boвЂlinishiga sabab boвЂladigan asosiy prinsip qaysi?", "options": ["Arximed prinsipi", "Pauli prinsipi", "Geyzenberg prinsipi", "Larmor prinsipi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Pauli taqiq prinsipi bo'yicha bir xil kvant holatida ikkita bir xil fermion bo'la olmaydi."}, {"question": "p-n oвЂtishda muvozanat holatida nima sodir boвЂladi?", "options": ["Diffuzion va dreyf toklari tenglashadi", "Faqat diffuziya toki oqadi", "Faqat dreyf toki oqadi", "Tok nolga teng va zaryadlar harakati to'xtaydi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Muvozanat holatida diffuziya toki va ichki elektr maydoni keltirib chiqargan dreyf toki bir-birini kompensatsiyalaydi."}, {"question": "Pauli prinsipiga koвЂ™ra, bitta energetik sathda koвЂ™pi bilan nechta elektron boвЂ™lishi mumkin?", "options": ["1   ъ ta", "2 ta", "Cheksiz", "8 ta"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Spinlari qarama-qarshi yo'nalgan maksimum 2 ta elektron bitta energetik sathda joylashishi mumkin."}, {"question": "Aralashmalarsiz, sof holdagi yarim oвЂ™tkazgichlar nima deb ataladi?", "options": ["n-tipli yarim o'tkazgichlar", "p-tipli yarim o'tkazgichlar", "Xususiy yarim oвЂ™tkazgichlar", "Kirishmali yarim oвЂ™tkazgichlar"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Egalik qiluvchi hech qanday begona aralashmaga ega bo'lmagan yarim o'tkazgichlar xususiy deyiladi."}, {"question": "Yarim oвЂtkazgichga elektron beradigan (beruvchi) kirishma atomlari nima deb ataladi?", "options": ["Akseptorlar", "Nuklonlar", "Donorlar", "Izotoplar"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "O'z elektronini erkin ravishda beruvchi aralashma atomlari donorlar deyiladi."}, {"question": "Donor sathlar taqiqlangan sohaning qaysi qismida joylashadi?", "options": ["Valentlik sohasi shiftiga yaqin", "Valentlik sohasi tubida", "O'tkazuvchanlik sohasi tubiga yaqin", "Taqiqlangan sohaning qoq o'rtasida"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Donor atomlarning ionlashish energiyasi kichik bo'lgani uchun ularning energetik sathi o'tkazuvchanlik sohasi ostida joylashadi."}, {"question": "Kirishmali yarim oвЂtkazgichlarda juda past temperaturalarda qaysi turdagi oвЂtkazuvchanlik ustunlik qiladi?", "options": ["Kirishmali o'tkazuvchanlik", "Xususiy o'tkazuvchanlik", "Ionnli o'tkazuvchanlik", "Sirtiy o'tkazuvchanlik"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Past haroratlarda faqat kirishma atomlarining ionlashish energiyasi yetarli bo'ladi."}, {"question": "n-tipli yarim oвЂtkazgichda \"ozchilik\" zaryad tashuvchilar qaysilar?", "options": ["Kovaklar", "Protonlar", "Iyonlar", "Elektronlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n-turda asosiy tashuvchilar elektronlar, ozchilik tashuvchilar esa kovaklardir."}, {"question": "Harorat juda yuqori boвЂlganda kirishmali yarim oвЂtkazgich oвЂzini qanday tutadi?", "options": ["Dielektrik kabi", "Supero'tkazgich kabi", "Xususiy yarim o'tkazgich kabi", "O'zgarmaydi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Yuqori haroratda xususiy zaryad tashuvchilar soni kirishmalarnikidan keskin ortib ketadi."}, {"question": "oвЂzaro taвЂ™sir turlari ichida eng kichik taвЂ™sir doimiysiga (~10вЃ»ВівЃ№) egasi qaysi?", "options": ["Gravitatsion o'zaro ta'sir", "Elektromagnetik o'zaro ta'sir", "Kuchsiz o'zaro ta'sir", "Kuchli (yadroviy) o'zaro ta'sir"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Gravitatsion ta'sir tabiatdagi to'rtta fundamental ta'sirning eng kuchsizidir."}, {"question": "Yarim oвЂtkazgich panjarasidan bitta elektronni oвЂziga olib, musbat zaryadlangan kovak hosil qiladigan kirishmalar nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Akseptorlar", "Kationlar", "Donorlar", "Positronlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Elektronni qabul qilib oluvchi va kovak hosil qiluvchi aralashmalar akseptorlar deyiladi."}, {"question": "Yarim oвЂtkazgichlarda harorat koвЂtarilishi bilan ularning elektr oвЂtkazuvchanligi qanday oвЂzgaradi?", "options": ["Ortadi", "O'zgarmaydi", "Kamayadi", "Nolga tenglashadi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Harorat ortishi bilan termik generatsiya kuchayib, erkin zaryad tashuvchilar soni ortadi."}, {"question": "Yarim oвЂ™tkazgichlarda harorat (T) ortishi bilan zaryad tashuvchilar konsentratsiyasi qanday oвЂ™zgaradi?", "options": ["Chiziqli kamayadi", "Kvadratik kamayadi", "Eksponentsial ortadi", "O'zgarmaydi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Issiqlik energiyasi ta'sirida elektronlarning sohalararo o'tishi eksponentsial qonuniyatga bo'ysunadi."}, {"question": "p-tipli yarim oвЂtkazgichda Fermi sathi (Вµ) qayerda joylashgan boвЂladi?", "options": ["Valentlik sohasi shiftiga yaqin", "Taqiqlangan soha o'rtasida", "O'tkazuvchanlik sohasi tubiga yaqin", "O'tkazuvchanlik sohasi ichida"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "p-turida kovaklar ko'pligi uchun Fermi sathi valentlik sohasiga yaqinlashadi."}, {"question": "Taqiqlangan sohasi mavjud boвЂlmagan yoki valentlik sohasi bilan oвЂtkazuvchanlik sohasi ustma-ust tushgan moddalar qaysi?",    ы"options": ["Metallar", "Yarim o'tkazgichlar", "Dielektriklar", "Izolatorlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Metallarda taqiqlangan soha bo'lmagani uchun ular elektr tokini juda yaxshi o'tkazadi."}, {"question": "n-sohadan p-sohaga elektronlar diffuziyasi natijasida n-soha qanday zaryadlanadi?", "options": ["Manfiy", "Dastlab manfiy keyin musbat", "Neytral", "Musbat"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "n-sohadan elektronlar ketishi natijasida u yerda kompensatsiyalanmagan musbat donor ionlari qoladi va soha musbat zaryadlanadi."}, {"question": "Atom yadrosi qanday zarrachalardan tashkil topgan?", "options": ["Protonlar va neytronlar", "Elektronlar va protonlar", "Kovaklar va elektronlar", "Neytronlar va elektronlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Atom yadrosi nuklonlar, ya'ni proton va neytronlardan tashkil topgan."}, {"question": "Betta (ОІвЃ») yemirilishda yadrodan qanday zarracha uchib chiqadi?", "options": ["Alfa zarracha", "Elektron (va antineytrino)", "Proton", "Neytron"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Beta-minus yemirilishda yadrodagi neytron proton kabi qayta tuzilib, elektron va antineytrino ajralib chiqadi."}, {"question": "p va n turdagi yarim oвЂtkazgichlar kontaktida hosil boвЂlgan oвЂtish sohasi nima deb ataladi?", "options": ["p-n o'tish", "Shottki o'tishi", "Ionnli o'tish", "Getero-o'tish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Har xil turdagi yarim o'tkazgichlar tutashgan joyda p-n o'tish (elektron-kovak o'tishi) hosil bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kristall panjaraning ichki maydoni taвЂ™sirini hisobga olgan holda kiritilgan massa nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Effektiv massa", "Olingan massa", "Tinchlikdagi massa", "Nisbiy massa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Kristall ichidagi davriy maydon ta'sirida elektron massasi o'zgargandek tuyuladi va bu effektiv massa deyiladi."}, {"question": "Yarim oвЂtkazgichli diodning asosiy xossasi nima?", "options": ["Yuqori qarshilikka egalik", "Bir tomonlama o'tkazuvchanlik", "To'liq izolyatsiyalash", "Ikki tomonlama bir xil o'tkazuvchanlik"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Diod to'g'ri yo'nalishda tokni yaxshi o'tkazadi, teskari yo'nalishda esa deyarli o'tkazmaydi."}, {"question": "Valentlik sohasi bilan oвЂtkazuvchanlik sohasi orasidagi elektronlar boвЂlishi mumkin boвЂlmagan oraliq nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Kovalent soha", "Taqiqlangan soha", "Ruxsat etilgan soha", "Fermi sohasi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Kvant mexanikasiga ko'ra elektronlar ushbu energetik oralikda joylasha olmaydi."}, {"question": "Massalar soni (A) bir xil boвЂlib, zaryadi (Z) har xil boвЂlgan yadrolar nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Izobarlar", "Izotonlar", "Izotoplar", "Izomerlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Massa sonlari bir xil bo'lgan har xil element yadrolari izobarlar deyiladi."}, {"question": "Elektronni metalldan vakuumga chiqarish uchun sarflanadigan minimal energiya nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Ionlashish energiyasi", "Aktivlanish energiyasi", "Boshlang'ich energiya", "Chiqish ishi"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Elektron sirt potensial to'sig'ini yengib o'tishi uchun kerak bo'lgan eng kichik energiya chiqish ishi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Yadrodagi protonlar va neytronlar umumiy nom bilan nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Pozitronlar", "Nuklonlar", "Kvarclar", "Mezonlar"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Proton va neytronlar yadro tarkibiy qismi sifatida nuklonlar deb ataladi."}, {"question": "n-tipli yarim oвЂtkazgichlarda Fermi sathi (Вµ) taqiqlangan sohaning qaysi qismida joylashgan boвЂladi?", "options": ["Valentlik sohasi yaqinida", "O'tkazuvchanlik sohasi yaqinida", "Taqiqlangan soha o'rtasida", "Valentlik sohasi ichida"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Erkin elektronlar ko'pligi sababli Fermi sathi o'tkazuvchanlik sohasiga yaqin joylashadi."}, {"question": "Massa defekti deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Yadroning yemirilish tezligiga", "Yadroni tashkil etgan nuklonlar massalari yig'indisi bilan yadro massasi o'rtasidagi farqga", "Yadro massasining elektronlar massasiga nisbatiga", "Proton va ney    tron massalari tengligiga"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Yadro hosil bo'lishida energiya ajralishi sababli yadro massasi uni tashkil etuvchi zarrachalar massalari yig'indisidan kichik bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kremniyga (IV-gruppa) Beshinchi gruppa elementi (masalan, Fosfor) qoвЂshilganda qanday turdagi yarim oвЂtkazgich hosil boвЂladi?", "options": ["n-tipli", "Xususiy", "Izotropik", "p-tipli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "5-valentli element qo'shilganda ortiqcha erkin elektronlar hosil bo'ladi va n-turli yarim o'tkazgich olinadi."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq elektronlar bilan toвЂlgan eng yuqori energetik soha qanday ataladi?", "options": ["OвЂtkazuvchanlik sohasi", "Valentlik sohasi", "Donorlik sohasi", "Taqiqlangan soha"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Absolyut nol haroratda elektronlar egallagan eng yuqori soha valentlik sohasi deyiladi."}, {"question": "p-tipli yarim oвЂtkazgichda asosiy zaryad tashuvchilar qaysilar?", "options": ["Protonlar", "Kovaklar", "Elektronlar", "Neytronlar"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "p-turli yarim o'tkazgichda akseptorlar hisobiga kovaklar konsentratsiyasi elektronlarnikidan ko'p bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Mikrozarrachalarning energetik sathlar boвЂ™ylab taqsimlanish ehtimolligi qaysi statistika bilan aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Klassik Maksvell statistikasi", "Bose-Eynshteyn statistikasi", "Fermi-Dirak statistikasi", "Boltsman statistikasi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Yarim spinga ega bo'lgan elektronlar Fermi-Dirak statistikasiga bo'ysunadi."}, {"question": "Metall va yarim oвЂtkazgich kontaktida tokni bir yoвЂnalishda oвЂtkazuvchi qatlam nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Neytral qatlam", "To'suvchi qatlam (Shottki to'sig'i)", "Ochiq qatlam", "Kovakli qatlam"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Metall va yarim o'tkazgich chegarasida bir tomonlama o'tkazuvchanlikka ega Shottki to'sig'i paydo bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Xususiy yarim oвЂ™tkazgichlarda Fermi sathi (Вµ) qayerda joylashgan boвЂ™ladi?", "options": ["Taqiqlangan sohaning o'rtasida", "O'tkazuvchanlik sohasining yuqorisida", "Valentlik sohasining tubida", "Donor sathida"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Elektron va kovaklar konsentratsiyasi teng bo'lgani uchun Fermi sathi taqiqlangan soha o'rtasida bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Qattiq jism hosil boвЂlishida zarrachalar orasidagi qaysi kuchlar ularning bir-biriga qoвЂshilishiga qarshilik qiladi?", "options": ["Yadro kuchlari", "Gravitatsion kuchlar", "Itarishish kuchlari", "Tortishish kuchlari"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Zarrachalar bir-biriga juda yaqinlashganda uning elektron qatlamlari o'zaro itarishish kuchini hosil qiladi."}, {"question": "Yadro kuchlarining asosiy xususiyati nima?", "options": ["Qisqa ta'sir doirasiga egaligi va to'yinish xususiyati", "Faqat elektr zaryadiga bog'liqligi", "Uzoq masofaga ta'sir qilishi", "Gravitatsion xarakterga egaligi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Yadro kuchlari juda qisqa masofalarda (10^-15 m) ta'sir qiladi va to'yinuvchandir."}, {"question": "Elektronlar boвЂlmagan yoki qisman toвЂlgan, elektr oвЂtkazuvchanlikni taвЂ™minlovchi soha qaysi?", "options": ["Akseptorlik sohasi", "OвЂtkazuvchanlik sohasi", "Valentlik sohasi", "Taqiqlangan soha"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Elektr toki hosil bo'lishida erkin harakatlana oladigan elektronlar o'tkazuvchanlik sohasida joylashadi."}, {"question": "Kristall panjarada zarrachalarning muvozanat holati atrofida tartibli joylashishi nima deb ataladi?", "options": ["Suyuq kristall", "Kristall panjara", "Gazsimon holat", "Amorf holat"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Kristall panjara вЂ“ zarrachalarning fozoda davriy va tartibli joylashish tuzilishidir."}, {"question": "Kristallarda elektronlarning alohida atomlarga tegishli boвЂlmay, butun kristall boвЂylab harakatlanishi nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Lokallashuv", "Ionlashuv", "Rekombinatsiya", "Elektronlarning kollektivlashuvi"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Atomlar birlashib kristall hosil qilganda valent elektronlar umumiy bo'lib kollektivlashadi."}]}j†ў
    ±                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               У QЃҐ=q_a33498bf4d9945d19e2e3cb521574e85A{"variant": "A", "quizzes": [{"question": "What is data?", "options": ["A monitor cable", "Computer hardware", "Raw facts and statistics collected for reference", "A type of virus"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Data consists of raw quantitative or qualitative values."}, {"question": "Why use antivirus?", "options": ["To increase screen resolution", "To edit photos", "To play video games faster", "To detect and remove malicious software"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Antivirus software scans, detects, and quarantines malicious code."}, {"question": "What is a strong password?", "options": ["A complex combination of letters, numbers, and symbols", "The word 'password'", "123456", "Your birthday"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Complexity prevents dictionary and brute-force attacks."}, {"question": "What does cybersecurity protect?", "options": ["Computer screens from dust", "Systems, networks, and data from digital attacks", "Office furniture", "Physical buildings from rain"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Cybersecurity focuses on defending digital infrastructure and data."}, {"question": "You ___ visit the museum while you are in Paris. It's fantastic!", "options": ["can't", "don't have to", "mustn't", "should"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'Should' is used to give a strong positive recommendation."}, {"question": "What is a 'Summary'?", "options": ["A detailed line-by-line code listing", "A brief statement of the main points of something", "A list of financial debts", "A full transcript of a meeting"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Summaries condense longer texts into key essential takeaways."}, {"question": "AI can recognize:", "options": ["Speech and images", "Physical touch only", "Only text files", "Only numbers"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Computer vision and NLP allow AI to recognize speech and visual imagery."}, {"question": "You ___ pay to enter the park. It is completely free.", "options": ["should", "don't have to", "mustn't", "have to"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'Don't have to' indicates a lack of obligation."}, {"question": "Software is a computer ___.", "options": ["physical monitor", "program or set of instructions", "hardware component", "power supply"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Software refers to programs and instructions executed by computers."}, {"question": "What can hac   эЃ€7 Q‚ђq_2c3196a5253f4e3c9cf11de180797054B{"variant": "B", "quizzes": [{"question": "p-n oвЂtishga \"toвЂgвЂri kuchlanish\" berilganda toвЂsuvchi qatlam qalinligi qanday oвЂzgaradi?", "options": ["Ortadi", "Kamayadi", "O'zgarmaydi", "Nolga teng bo'lib qoladi va qayta tiklanmaydi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "To'g'ri kuchlanish ichki potetsial to'sig'ini kamaytiradi va to'suvchi qatlam torayadi."}, {"question": "Absolyut nol haroratda (T=0K) xususiy yarim oвЂ™tkazgich oвЂ™zini qanday tutadi?", "options": ["O'tkazgich kabi", "Plazma kabi", "O'ta o'tkazgich kabi", "Dielektrik kabi"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "T=0K da barcha elektronlar valentlik sohada bo'ladi va erkin zaryad tashuvchilar bo'lmaydi."}, {"question": "Xususiy yarim oвЂ™tkazgichlarda elektronlar (n) va kovaklar (p) konsentratsiyasi oвЂ™rtasidagi munosabat qanday?", "options": ["n < p", "n = 0", "n = p", "n > p"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Har bir hosil bo'lgan erkin elektron valent sohada bitta bo'sh o'rin (kovak) qoldiradi."}, {"question": "Ikki xil metall kontaktga keltirilganda, u   ш   юkers do?", "options": ["Repair physical monitors", "Gain unauthorized access to systems", "Install physical memory cards", "Clean computer fans"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Hackers breach security controls to access systems without authorization."}, {"question": "Do we ___ wear a uniform at your school?", "options": ["must", "have to", "should", "ought"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'Have to' is used with auxiliary verb 'Do' in question form."}, {"question": "What is a Technical Demo?", "options": ["A written contract", "A demonstration showing how a product or feature works", "A sales invoice", "A job interview"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Technical demos showcase actual software or product functionality live."}, {"question": "What is telemedicine?", "options": ["Robotic surgery only", "Selling medicines online only", "Remote delivery of healthcare services using technology", "A medical TV channel"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Telemedicine facilitates medical consultations remotely via digital technology."}, {"question": "What is phishing?", "options": ["Catching fish online", "A social engineering attack to steal user data", "Cleaning a keyboard", "Updating an operating system"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Phishing tricks users into revealing confidential information like credentials."}, {"question": "In the UK, drivers ___ drive on the left side of the road.", "options": ["might", "don't have to", "shouldn't", "must"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'Must' is used to express mandatory legal rules and obligations."}, {"question": "What is a Progress Report for?", "options": ["To inform stakeholders about project status and updates", "To report a crime to police", "To apply for a holiday", "To request a refund"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Progress reports track project milestones, completed tasks, and current status."}, {"question": "Microsoft Word is ___ software.", "options": ["hardware", "system", "utility", "application"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Microsoft Word is designed for end-users, making it application software."}, {"question": "You ___ eat so much fast food. It's not healthy.", "options": ["have to", "shouldn't", "must", "can"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'Shouldn't' is used to give advice against doing something unhealthy."}, {"question": "Google Docs is a ___ application.", "options": ["system-only", "web-based", "hardware", "firmware"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Google Docs runs directly in web browsers via the internet."}, {"question": "What is spyware?", "options": ["An antivirus software", "Software that secretly gathers user information", "A type of operating system", "A tool to create websites"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Spyware secretly tracks user activities and collects personal data."}, {"question": "System software example is ___.", "options": ["Photoshop", "Microsoft Word", "Operating System (e.g., Windows)", "Google Chrome"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Operating systems are the primary examples of system software."}, {"question": "Students ___ bring a dictionary to the exam. It is not allowed.", "options": ["don't have to", "should", "can", "mustn't"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'Mustn't' indicates strict prohibition."}, {"question": "What is hacking?", "options": ["Playing online video games", "Gaining unauthorized access to data in a system", "Connecting a printer", "Writing a report in Word"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Hacking refers to exploiting weaknesses in computer systems or networks."}, {"question": "What does malware do?", "options": ["Speeds up internet connection", "Harms or exploits any programmable device or network", "Protects passwords", "Cleans hardware"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Malware is malicious software created to exploit or compromise systems."}, {"question": "What is a Project Pitch?", "options": ["A technical manual", "A bug report", "A code review", "A presentation to persuade stakeholders to support a project"], "correct    _index": 3, "explanation": "A pitch presents ideas concisely to secure buy-in or funding."}, {"question": "What is ransomware?", "options": ["Free open-source software", "A hardware firewall", "An email provider", "Malware that blocks access to data until a ransom is paid"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ransomware encrypts victim files and demands payment for decryption."}, {"question": "What can AI do?", "options": ["Analyze data and make predictions", "Manufacture steel manually", "Clean water directly", "Replace physical electricity"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "AI excels at processing data, recognizing patterns, and making predictions."}, {"question": "What does K.I.S.S. mean?", "options": ["Key Input System Software", "Know It Save System", "Keep Information Safe & Secure", "Keep It Simple, Stupid"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "K.I.S.S. is a design principle stating systems work best if kept simple."}, {"question": "Good UX means easy ___.", "options": ["usability and navigation", "printing", "coding", "hardware repair"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Good User Experience (UX) provides intuitive usability and seamless navigation."}, {"question": "When do you write an Incident Report?", "options": ["Before starting a new project", "When applying for a job", "Every morning at work", "After an unexpected event or failure occurs"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Incident reports document operational issues, breaches, or safety events."}, {"question": "User Interface (UI) means how software ___.", "options": ["looks and interacts with users", "cools the CPU", "stores raw power", "compiles code"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "UI focuses on visual elements and user interaction design."}, {"question": "Children ___ listen to their paren