}jљхSяя  "Cheksiz"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "в€«1^+в€ћ 1/x dx = lim(bв†’в€ћ) [ln|x|]1^b = lim(bв†’в€ћ) (ln(b) - ln(1)) = в€ћ - 0 = в€ћ. Demak, integral uzoqlashuvchi."}, {"question": "Xosmas integralni aniqlashda qaysi usul asosiy hisoblanadi?", "options": ["Limitga o'tish", "Nyuton-Leybnits formulasi", "Bo'laklab integrallash", "O'zgaruvchini almashtirish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integralni aniqlashda asosiy usul integrallash chegaralarini chekli qilib, so'ngra limitga o'tishdir."}, {"question": "в€«1^3 2x dx integralning qiymati nimaga teng?", "options": ["4", "6", "10", "8"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "в€«1^3 2x dx = [x^2]1^3 = 3^2 - 1^2 = 9 - 1 = 8."}, {"question": "Chegarasi cheksiz boвЂlgan integral qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Limit orqali", "Boshlang'ich funksiya orqali", "Yig'indi orqali", "Differensiallash orqali"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Chegarasi cheksiz bo'lgan xosmas integral limit orqali aniqlanadi, masalan, в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx = lim(bв†’в€ћ) в€«a^b f(x)dx."}, {"question": "ОЈ cn * x^n darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi qaysi formula orqali aniqlanadi?", "options": ["R = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |cn+1 / cn|", "R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) (cn)^(1/n)", "R = lim(nв†’в€ћ) (cn)^(1/n)", "R = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |cn / cn+1|"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi R = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |cn / cn+1| yoki R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) |cn|^(1/n) formulalari orqali aniqlanadi."}, {"question": "Agar funksiya nuqtada aniqlanmagan boвЂlsa, bu nuqta qanday ataladi?", "options": ["Ekstremum nuqtasi", "Uzilish nuqtasi", "Kritik nuqta", "Uzluksizlik nuqtasi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Agar funksiya biror nuqtada aniqlanmagan bo'lsa yoki uning limiti funksiya qiymatiga teng bo'lmasa, bu nuqta uzilish nuqtasi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya limiti qanday belgilanadi?", "options": ["lim(xв†’a) f(x)", "lim(xв†’в€ћ) f(x,y)", "lim(yв†’b) f(x,y)", "lim((x,y)в†’(a,b)) f(x,y)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya limiti lim((x,y)в†’(a,b)) f(x,y) ko'rinishida belgilanadi."}, {"question": "Agar qatorning umumiy hadi an = 1/n boвЂlsa, uning dastlabki 3 ta hadini yozing.", "options": ["1, 1/2, 1/3", "1, 1/3, 1/9", "1, 1/4, 1/9", "1, 2, 3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n=1 da a1 = 1/1 = 1; n=2 da a2 = 1/2; n=3 da a3 = 1/3."}, {"question": "I-tur xosmas integralning asosiy belgisi nimada?", "options": ["Integrallash oralig'i cheksiz", "Integralning qiymati nolga teng", "Integral ostidagi funksiya uzilishga ega", "Integralning qiymati chekli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "I-tur xosmas integralning asosiy belgisi integrallash oralig'ining cheksiz bo'lishidir (masalan, [a, в€ћ) yoki (-в€ћ, b])."}, {"question": "Qachon xosmas integral uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Agar uning qiymati chekli songa teng bo'lsa", "Agar integrallash chegaralari chekli bo'lsa", "Agar integral ostidagi funksiya uzluksiz bo'lsa", "Agar uning limiti cheksizlikka intilsa yoki mavjud bo'lmasa"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Xosmas integral, agar uning limiti cheksizlikka intilsa yoki mavjud bo'lmasa, uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "BoвЂlaklab integrallashda asosiy tanlov nimaga bogвЂliq?", "options": ["Funksiyaning uzluksizligiga", "u va dv ni shunday tanlashga bog'liqki, в€«vdu integral в€«udv ga nisbatan soddaroq bo'lsin", "Integral ostidagi funksiyaning murakkabligiga", "Integrallash chegaralariga"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Bo'laklab integrallashda u va dv ni tanlashda asosiy maqsad в€«vdu integralni hisoblashni osonlashtirishdir."}, {"question": "Qismiy yigвЂindi Sn qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Qatorning umumiy hadi", "Qatorning dastlabki n ta hadining yig'indisi", "Qatorning limiti", "Qatorning barcha hadlari yig'indisi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Qismiy yig'indi Sn deb qatorning dastlabki n ta hadining yig'indisiga aytiladi: Sn = a1 + a2 + ... + an."}, {"question": "в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx xosmas integral absolyut yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar:", "options": ["в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)|dx uzoq    lashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)|dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Xosmas integral в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx absolyut yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)|dx integral yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa."}, {"question": "Har bir musbat hadidan keyin manfiy had kelsa va har bir manfiy hadidan keyin musbat had kelsa, bu qatorga........ deyiladi.", "options": ["Ishora almashinuvchi qator", "Manfiy hadli qator", "Geometrik qator", "Musbat hadli qator"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Hadlari ishorasini navbatma-navbat o'zgartirib keladigan qator ishora almashinuvchi qator deyiladi."}, {"question": "Qachon integral I -tur xosmas integral deyiladi?", "options": ["Agar integral ostidagi funksiya uzilishga ega bo'lsa", "Agar integrallash chegaralaridan kamida bittasi cheksiz bo'lsa", "Agar integralni hisoblash uchun bo'laklab integrallash usuli qo'llanilsa", "Agar integralning qiymati nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "I-tur xosmas integral, agar integrallash chegaralaridan kamida bittasi cheksiz (В±в€ћ) bo'lsa, deyiladi."}, {"question": "в€«0^ПЂ cos(x) dx integralni toping.", "options": ["2", "-1", "1", "0"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "в€«0^ПЂ cos(x) dx = [sin(x)]0^ПЂ = sin(ПЂ) - sin(0) = 0 - 0 = 0."}, {"question": "e^x qatori nima sababdan qulay?", "options": ["U faqat juft darajalarni o'z ichiga oladi", "Uning yaqinlashish radiusi chekli", "Uning hosilasi va integrali o'ziga teng", "U faqat toq darajalarni o'z ichiga oladi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "e^x funksiyasining hosilasi ham, integrali ham o'ziga teng bo'lganligi sababli, uning qatori bilan ishlash juda qulay."}, {"question": "Yaqinlashuvchi qator uchun zaruriy shart qanday?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = в€ћ", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an mavjud emas", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 1"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Agar qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, uning umumiy hadi nolga intilishi shart: lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0. Bu zaruriy shart, ammo yetarli emas."}, {"question": "вЂњFunksiyani darajali qatorga yoyishвЂќ deganda nima tushuniladi?", "options": ["Funksiyaning limitini hisoblash", "Funksiyaning integralini topish", "Funksiyaning hosilasini topish", "Funksiyani cheksiz ko'p hadli ko'phad shaklida ifodalash"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiyani darajali qatorga yoyish deganda, uni cheksiz ko'p hadli ko'phad shaklida (ya'ni, ОЈ an * (x-x0)^n ko'rinishida) ifodalash tushuniladi."}, {"question": "в€«-в€ћ^+в€ћ f(x) dx integral qachon yaqinlashuvchi boвЂladi?", "options": ["Har doim", "Agar f(x) juft funksiya bo'lsa", "Agar в€«-в€ћ^c f(x) dx va в€«c^+в€ћ f(x) dx ikkalasi ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Agar f(x) toq funksiya bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "в€«-в€ћ^+в€ћ f(x) dx integral, agar в€«-в€ћ^c f(x) dx va в€«c^+в€ћ f(x) dx (bu yerda c ixtiyoriy son) ikkalasi ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Agar z = x^2 + y boвЂlsa, z'x nimaga teng?", "options": ["2x", "x^2", "y", "2x + 1"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x^2 + y funksiyasining x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi (y ni o'zgarmas deb hisoblab) z'x = 2x ga teng."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 + x boвЂlsa, f(1,2) ni toping.", "options": ["5", "6", "8", "7"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "f(1,2) = 1^2 + 2^2 + 1 = 1 + 4 + 1 = 6."}, {"question": "Funksional qatorning umumiy koвЂrinishi toвЂgвЂri berilgan javobni toping", "options": ["a1 + a2 + ... + an", "f1(x) + f2(x) + ... + fn(x) + ...", "f(x) = ОЈ an * x^n", "в€« f(x)dx"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksional qatorning umumiy ko'rinishi f1(x) + f2(x) + ... + fn(x) + ... yoki ОЈ fn(x) dir."}, {"question": "Aniq integral tushunchasi nimaga asoslanib kiritiladi?", "options": ["Riemann yig'indisi limiti", "Hosila tushunchasi", "Boshlang'i