ct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(5) = 5 + s(4) = 5 + 10 = 15."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={1,8,9}; int *p=a; *(p+0)=6; cout<<a[0];", "options": ["1", "6", "8", "9"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+0)' 'a[0]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[0]' ning qiymatini 6 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[0]' ning yangi qiymati 6 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=4; int *p=&a; *p+=6; cout<<a;", "options": ["4", "6", "10", "0"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=6' 'a' ning qiymatini 6 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 4+6=10 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={2,4,6,8}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+2);", "options": ["2", "6", "4", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' massivning uchinchi elementiga (indeks 2) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[2] = 6."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(6);", "options": ["6", "15", "28", "21"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(6) = 6 + s(5) = 6 + 15 = 21."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["2", "0", "12", "10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["9", "10", "8", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"algoritm\" satrida 8 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? int x=2, y=6; int *p=&x; p=&y; *p=9; cout<<x<<\" \"<<y;", "options": ["2 6", "2 9", "9 9", "9 6"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Dastlab 'p' 'x' ga ishora qiladi, keyin 'y' ga ishora qilish uchun o'zgartiriladi. '*p=9' 'y' ning qiy  #matini 9 ga o'zgartiradi, 'x' esa o'zgarmaydi. Natijada '2 9' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Fibonachchi usulidagi rekursiv f(6) qiymatini toping: int f(int n){ if(n<=1) return n; return f(n-1)+f(n-2); }", "options": ["5", "8", "21", "13"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Fibonachchi ketma-ketligi: f(0)=0, f(1)=1, f(2)=1, f(3)=2, f(4)=3, f(5)=5, f(6)=8. Demak, f(6) = 8."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=5; } int a=3; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["3", "5", "0", "8"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 3+5=8 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Kitob\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "4", "6", "7"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Kitob\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Koddagi asosiy muammoni toping: int *p=new int(7); delete p; cout<<*p;", "options": ["Xotira sizishi", "Sintaksis xatosi", "Bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat (Use-after-free)", "Natija noto'g'ri"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'delete p' qatori 'p' ishora qilgan xotirani bo'shatadi. Keyin 'cout<<*p' bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat qilishga urinadi, bu 'use-after-free' xatosi bo'lib, aniqlanmagan xatti-harakatga olib keladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int x){ return x*x; } cout<<f(f(2));", "options": ["4", "16", "2", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ichki funksiya chaqiruvi birinchi bajariladi: f(2) = 2*2 = 4. Keyin tashqi funksiya chaqiriladi: f(4) = 4*4 = 16. Natijada 16 chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(7);", "options": ["5040", "7", "49", "720"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(7) = 7! = 7 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 3 * 2 * 1 = 5040."}, {"question": "Quyidagi kod bajarilganda ekranga nima chiqadi? void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; cout << n << \" \"; p(n-1); } p(3);", "options": ["3 2 1 ", "1 2 3 ", "1 ", "3 "], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi va har bir chaqiruvda n ning joriy qiymatini chop etadi, so'ngra n-1 bilan o'zini chaqiradi. Natijada '3 2 1 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(4);", "options": ["4", "7", "12", "10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(4) = 4 + s(3) = 4 + (3 + s(2)) = 4 + 3 + (2 + s(1)) = 4 + 3 + 2 + 1 = 10."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(8);", "options": ["36", "8", "45", "28"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(8) = 8 + s(7) = 8 + 28 = 36."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Dastur\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "7", "6", "8"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Dastur\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"informatika\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["10", "13", "12", "11"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"informatika\" satrida 11 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"data\"; strcat(a,\"base\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["data", "data base", "base", "database"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"data\" va \"base\" birikib \"database\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,6,7}; int *p=a; *(p+2)=12; cout<<a[2];", "options": ["6", "12", "5", "7"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' 'a[2]' ga teng. Bu qator     'a[2]' ning qiymatini 12 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[2]' ning yangi qiymati 12 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"salom\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "7", "4", "6"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"salom\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(4);", "options": ["1 ", "4 ", "4 3 2 1 ", "1 2 3 4 "], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 4 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["1", "0", "8", "9"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[5]={1,3,5,7,9}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+3);", "options": ["3", "5", "1", "7"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+3)' massivning to'rtinchi elementiga (indeks 3) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[3] = 7."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"Dastur\"; strcat(a,\"lash\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["Dastur", "Dastur lash", "lash", "Dasturlash"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"Dastur\" va \"lash\" birikib \"Dasturlash\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strchr(s,'r');", "options": ["algoritm", "oritm", "m", "r"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'algoritm' satrida 'r' belgisi 'oritm' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"cplus\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "4", "6", "7"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"cplus\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=7; int *p=&a; *p+=5; cout<<a;", "options": ["12", "0", "7", "5"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=5' 'a' ning qiymatini 5 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 7+5=12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,9,12}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["12", "5", "0", "9"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi elementiga (indeks 1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 9."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"web\"; strcat(a,\"site\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["web site", "site", "web", "website"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"web\" va \"site\" birikib \"website\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(3);", "options": ["1 ", "3 2 1 ", "1 2 3 ", "3 "], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["6", "8", "10", "12"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) = 6 + g(202) = 6 + (2 + g(20)) = 6 + 2 + (0 + g(2)) = 6 + 2 + 0 + 2 = 10."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"test\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["4", "3", "5", "6"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"test\" satrida 4 ta belgi bor."}]}j›‚
   ј ј                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Ѓ”,X Q‚Ёq_3b248404da7e46efa924e3a0efdcae36A{"variant": "A", "quizzes": [{"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(10);", "options": ["10", "55", "66", "45"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(10) = 10 + s(9) = 10 + 45 = 55."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={10,20,30,40}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["10", "30", "20", "40"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi elementiga (indeks 1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 20."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(8);", "options": ["40320", "8", "5040", "64"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(8) = 8! = 8 * 7! = 8 * 5040 = 40320."}, {"question": "p(a,b) funksiyasi a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) qiymatini toping: int p(int a,int b){ if(b==0) return 1; return a*p(a,b-1); }", "options": ["18", "216", "36", "12"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) = 6^2 = 36."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strchr(s,'n');", "options": ["nana", "na", "banana", "a"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'banana' satrida 'n' belgisi 'nana' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["2", "0", "12", "10"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10+2=12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["8", "1", "9", "0"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1+8=9 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "8", "6", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"banana\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=4; } int a=7; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["4", "11", "0", "     &ptions": ["10", "7", "9", "8"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"algoritm\" satrida 8 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(4);", "options": ["4 ", "1 2 3 4 ", "1 ", "4 3 2 1 "], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 4 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int x){ return x*x; } cout<<f(f(2));", "options": ["2", "8", "4", "16"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ichki funksiya chaqiruvi birinchi bajariladi: f(2) = 2*2 = 4. Keyin tashqi funksiya chaqiriladi: f(4) = 4*4 = 16. Natijada 16 chiqadi."}, {"question": "p(a,b) funksiyasi a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(2,5) qiymatini toping: int p(int a,int b){ if(b==0) return 1; return a*p(a,b-1); }", "options": ["32", "16", "64", "10"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(2,5) = 2^5 = 32."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "1", "8", "9"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=4; int *p=&a; *p+=6; cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "6", "10", "4"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=6' 'a' ning qiymatini 6 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 4+6=10 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(5);", "options": ["10", "5", "20", "15"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(5) = 5 + s(4) = 5 + 10 = 15."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,9,12}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["0", "5", "12", "9"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi elementiga (indeks 1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 9."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["8", "1", "9", "0"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1+8=9 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Fibonachchi usulidagi rekursiv f(6) qiymatini toping: int f(int n){ if(n<=1) return n; return f(n-1)+f(n-2); }", "options": ["13", "21", "5", "8"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Fibonachchi ketma-ketligi: f(0)=0, f(1)=1, f(2)=1, f(3)=2, f(4)=3, f(5)=5, f(6)=8. Demak, f(6) = 8."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"informatika\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["10", "12", "11", "13"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"informatika\" satrida 11 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Fibonachchi usulidagi rekursiv f(5) qiymatini toping: int f(int n){ if(n<=1) return n; return f(n-1)+f(n-2); }", "options": ["5", "13", "3", "8"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Fibonachchi ketma-ketligi: f(0)=0, f(1)=1, f(2)=1, f(3)=2, f(4)=3, f(5)=5. Demak, f(5) = 5."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(9);", "options": ["45", "36", "9", "55"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(9) = 9 + s(8) = 9 + 36 = 45."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(6);", "options": ["28", "15", "6", "21"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(6) = 6 + s(5) =   '6 + 15 = 21."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"Dastur\"; strcat(a,\"lash\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["Dasturlash", "Dastur", "lash", "Dastur lash"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"Dastur\" va \"lash\" birikib \"Dasturlash\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(10);", "options": ["45", "66", "55", "10"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(10) = 10 + s(9) = 10 + 45 = 55."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(7);", "options": ["36", "21", "7", "28"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(7) = 7 + s(6) = 7 + 21 = 28."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Kitob\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "6", "4", "7"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Kitob\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[5]={1,3,5,7,9}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+3);", "options": ["7", "3", "1", "5"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+3)' massivning to'rtinchi elementiga (indeks 3) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[3] = 7."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(999) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["18", "9", "27", "36"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(999) = 9 + g(99) = 9 + (9 + g(9)) = 9 + 9 + 9 = 27."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strchr(s,'r');", "options": ["oritm", "algoritm", "m", "r"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'algoritm' satrida 'r' belgisi 'oritm' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=10; int *p=&a; *p+=-3; cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "3", "10", "7"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=-3' 'a' ning qiymatini -3 ga oshiradi (ya'ni 3 ga kamaytiradi). Shuning uchun 'a' 10-3=7 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"cplus\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["4", "6", "7", "5"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"cplus\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(8);", "options": ["8", "64", "5040", "40320"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(8) = 8! = 8 * 7! = 8 * 5040 = 40320."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={2,4,6,8}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+2);", "options": ["8", "6", "2", "4"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' massivning uchinchi elementiga (indeks 2) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[2] = 6."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"salom\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "6", "7", "4"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"salom\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"AI\"; strcat(a,\"Lab\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["Lab", "AI", "AILab", "AI Lab"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"AI\" va \"Lab\" birikib \"AILab\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={10,20,30,40}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["20", "40", "30", "10"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi  ( elementiga (indeks 1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 20."}, {"question": "Koddagi asosiy xatoni toping: int *p; *p=25; cout<<*p;", "options": ["Ko'rsatkich initsializatsiya qilinmagan", "Sintaksis xatosi", "Xotira yetishmovchiligi", "Natija noto'g'ri"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Asosiy xato shundaki, 'p' ko'rsatkich e'lon qilingan, ammo hech qanday manzilga ishora qilish uchun initsializatsiya qilinmagan. Initsializatsiya qilinmagan ko'rsatkichni dereferensiya qilish (ya'ni '*p=25') aniqlanmagan xatti-harakatga olib keladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["2", "12", "10", "0"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10+2=12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"info\"; strcat(a,\"matika\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["info matika", "info", "matika", "informatika"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"info\" va \"matika\" birikib \"informatika\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,6,7}; int *p=a; *(p+2)=12; cout<<a[2];", "options": ["6", "5", "7", "12"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' 'a[2]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[2]' ning qiymatini 12 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[2]' ning yangi qiymati 12 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={2,3,4}; int *p=a; *(p+1)=10; cout<<a[1];", "options": ["3", "10", "2", "4"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' 'a[1]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[1]' ning qiymatini 10 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[1]' ning yangi qiymati 10 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(8);", "options": ["36", "28", "45", "8"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(8) = 8 + s(7) = 8 + 28 = 36."}, {"question": "Quyidagi kod bajarilganda ekranga nima chiqadi? void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; cout << n << \" \"; p(n-1); } p(3);", "options": ["1 2 3 ", "3 ", "3 2 1 ", "1 "], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi va har bir chaqiruvda n ning joriy qiymatini chop etadi, so'ngra n-1 bilan o'zini chaqiradi. Natijada '3 2 1 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"web\"; strcat(a,\"site\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["web site", "website", "site", "web"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"web\" va \"site\" birikib \"website\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(4);", "options": ["4", "12", "10", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(4) = 4 + s(3) = 4 + (3 + s(2)) = 4 + 3 + (2 + s(1)) = 4 + 3 + 2 + 1 = 10."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"dasturlash\"; cout<<strchr(s,'l');", "options": ["sh", "dasturlash", "l", "lash"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'dasturlash' satrida 'l' belgisi 'lash' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=5; } int a=3; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "5", "8", "3"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 3+5=8 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=7; int *p=&a; *p+=5; cout<<a;", "options": ["7", "12", "5", "0"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=5' 'a' ning qiymatini 5 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 7+5    =12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"test\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["4", "6", "3", "5"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"test\" satrida 4 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(7);", "options": ["720", "49", "5040", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(7) = 7! = 7 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 3 * 2 * 1 = 5040."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? int x=3, y=8; int *p=&x; p=&y; *p=10; cout<<x<<\" \"<<y;", "options": ["3 8", "10 10", "10 8", "3 10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Dastlab 'p' 'x' ga ishora qiladi, keyin 'y' ga ishora qilish uchun o'zgartiriladi. '*p=10' 'y' ning qiymatini 10 ga o'zgartiradi, 'x' esa o'zgarmaydi. Natijada '3 10' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={1,8,9}; int *p=a; *(p+0)=6; cout<<a[0];", "options": ["9", "1", "6", "8"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+0)' 'a[0]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[0]' ning qiymatini 6 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[0]' ning yangi qiymati 6 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagi kod bajarilganda ekranga nima chiqadi? void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; cout << n << \" \"; p(n-1); } p(4);", "options": ["1 2 3 4 ", "4 3 2 1 ", "1 ", "4 "], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi va har bir chaqiruvda n ning joriy qiymatini chop etadi, so'ngra n-1 bilan o'zini chaqiradi. Natijada '4 3 2 1 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=4; } int a=7; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["11", "0", "4", "7"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 7+4=11 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strchr(s,'n');", "options": ["na", "nana", "banana", "a"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'banana' satrida 'n' belgisi 'nana' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Koddagi asosiy muammoni toping: int *p=new int(7); delete p; cout<<*p;", "options": ["Bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat (Use-after-free)", "Xotira sizishi", "Sintaksis xatosi", "Natija noto'g'ri"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'delete p' qatori 'p' ishora qilgan xotirani bo'shatadi. Keyin 'cout<<*p' bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat qilishga urinadi, bu 'use-after-free' xatosi bo'lib, aniqlanmagan xatti-harakatga olib keladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=5; } int a=3; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["8", "5", "0", "3"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 3 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? int x=2, y=6; int *p=&x; p=&y; *p=9; cout<<x<<\" \"<<y;", "options": ["2 9", "9 6", "2 6", "9 9"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dastlab 'p' 'x' ga ishora qiladi, keyin 'y' ga ishora qilish uchun o'zgartiriladi. '*p=9' 'y' ning qiymatini 9 ga o'zgartiradi, 'x' esa o'zgarmaydi. Natijada '2 9' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"data\"; strcat(a,\"base\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["database", "base", "data base", "data"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"data\" va \"base\" birikib \"database\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["6", "12", "8", "10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) = 6 + g(202) = 6 + (2 + g(20)) = 6 + 2 + (0 + g(2)) = 6 + 2 + 0 + 2 = 10."}]}j›‚
   ј ј                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Ѓ”,Y Q‚Ёq_3b248404da7e46efa924e3a0efdcae36B{"variant": "B", "quizzes": [{"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(3);", "options": ["1 2 3 ", "1 ", "3 2 1 ", "3 "], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={3,6,9,12}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+2);", "options": ["3", "12", "6", "9"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' massivning uchinchi elementiga (indeks 2) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[2] = 9."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Dastur\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "6", "7", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Dastur\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "p(a,b) funksiyasi a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) qiymatini toping: int p(int a,int b){ if(b==0) return 1; return a*p(a,b-1); }", "options": ["216", "12", "36", "18"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) = 6^2 = 36."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(472) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["4", "7", "24", "13"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(472) = 2 + g(47) = 2 + (7 + g(4)) = 2 + 7 + 4 = 13."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["8", "6", "5", "7"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"banana\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["10", "0", "12", "2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=4; } int a=7; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["4", "7", "0", "11"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 7 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "o  %  +", "4", "6"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=6' 'a' ning qiymatini 6 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 4+6=10 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Koddagi asosiy muammoni toping: int *p=new int(7); delete p; cout<<*p;", "options": ["Sintaksis xatosi", "Bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat (Use-after-free)", "Xotira sizishi", "Natija noto'g'ri"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'delete p' qatori 'p' ishora qilgan xotirani bo'shatadi. Keyin 'cout<<*p' bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat qilishga urinadi, bu 'use-after-free' xatosi bo'lib, aniqlanmagan xatti-harakatga olib keladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(10);", "options": ["66", "55", "10", "45"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(10) = 10 + s(9) = 10 + 45 = 55."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"dasturlash\"; cout<<strchr(s,'l');", "options": ["l", "sh", "dasturlash", "lash"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'dasturlash' satrida 'l' belgisi 'lash' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Kitob\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["5", "6", "4", "7"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Kitob\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=10; int *p=&a; *p+=-3; cout<<a;", "options": ["3", "7", "10", "0"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=-3' 'a' ning qiymatini -3 ga oshiradi (ya'ni 3 ga kamaytiradi). Shuning uchun 'a' 10-3=7 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"test\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["4", "5", "6", "3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"test\" satrida 4 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(472) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["13", "4", "7", "24"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(472) = 2 + g(47) = 2 + (7 + g(4)) = 2 + 7 + 4 = 13."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={10,20,30,40}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["20", "10", "40", "30"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi elementiga (indeks 1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 20."}, {"question": "Quyidagi kod bajarilganda ekranga nima chiqadi? void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; cout << n << \" \"; p(n-1); } p(3);", "options": ["3 2 1 ", "3 ", "1 ", "1 2 3 "], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi va har bir chaqiruvda n ning joriy qiymatini chop etadi, so'ngra n-1 bilan o'zini chaqiradi. Natijada '3 2 1 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(6);", "options": ["6", "21", "28", "15"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(6) = 6 + s(5) = 6 + 15 = 21."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=7; int *p=&a; *p+=5; cout<<a;", "options": ["12", "0", "7", "5"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=5' 'a' ning qiymatini 5 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 7+5=12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={3,6,9,12}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+2);", "options": ["6", "3", "9", "12"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' massivning uchinchi elementiga (indeks 2) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[2] = 9."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=4; } int a=7; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["4",  , "0", "11", "7"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 7 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(4);", "options": ["1 ", "1 2 3 4 ", "4 ", "4 3 2 1 "], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 4 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=4; } int a=7; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["7", "4", "0", "11"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 7+4=11 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(3);", "options": ["3 ", "1 ", "1 2 3 ", "3 2 1 "], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int x){ return x*x; } cout<<f(f(2));", "options": ["8", "16", "2", "4"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ichki funksiya chaqiruvi birinchi bajariladi: f(2) = 2*2 = 4. Keyin tashqi funksiya chaqiriladi: f(4) = 4*4 = 16. Natijada 16 chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strchr(s,'r');", "options": ["oritm", "r", "algoritm", "m"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'algoritm' satrida 'r' belgisi 'oritm' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=5; } int a=3; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["3", "0", "5", "8"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 3 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(5);", "options": ["20", "15", "5", "10"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(5) = 5 + s(4) = 5 + 10 = 15."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={2,4,6,8}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+2);", "options": ["6", "4", "8", "2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' massivning uchinchi elementiga (indeks 2) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[2] = 6."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=5; } int a=3; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["3", "5", "8", "0"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 3+5=8 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(7);", "options": ["21", "7", "28", "36"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(7) = 7 + s(6) = 7 + 21 = 28."}, {"question": "Koddagi asosiy xatoni toping: int *p; *p=25; cout<<*p;", "options": ["Ko'rsatkich initsializatsiya qilinmagan", "Sintaksis xatosi", "Xotira yetishmovchiligi", "Natija noto'g'ri"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Asosiy xato shundaki, 'p' ko'rsatkich e'lon qilingan, ammo hech qanday manzilga ishora qilish uchun initsializatsiya qilinmagan. Initsializatsiya qilinmagan ko'rsatkichni dereferensiya qilish (ya'ni '*p=25') aniqlanmagan xatti-harakatga olib keladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagi kod bajarilganda ekranga nima chiqadi? void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; cout << n << \" \"; p(n-1); } p(4);", "options": ["1 ", "4 3 2 1 ", "1 2 3 4 ", "4 "], "correct_index": 1, "explanat  -ion": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi va har bir chaqiruvda n ning joriy qiymatini chop etadi, so'ngra n-1 bilan o'zini chaqiradi. Natijada '4 3 2 1 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "p(a,b) funksiyasi a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(2,5) qiymatini toping: int p(int a,int b){ if(b==0) return 1; return a*p(a,b-1); }", "options": ["10", "64", "32", "16"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(2,5) = 2^5 = 32."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? int x=2, y=6; int *p=&x; p=&y; *p=9; cout<<x<<\" \"<<y;", "options": ["9 6", "2 9", "9 9", "2 6"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Dastlab 'p' 'x' ga ishora qiladi, keyin 'y' ga ishora qilish uchun o'zgartiriladi. '*p=9' 'y' ning qiymatini 9 ga o'zgartiradi, 'x' esa o'zgarmaydi. Natijada '2 9' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"data\"; strcat(a,\"base\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["data", "data base", "database", "base"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"data\" va \"base\" birikib \"database\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={1,8,9}; int *p=a; *(p+0)=6; cout<<a[0];", "options": ["9", "6", "1", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+0)' 'a[0]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[0]' ning qiymatini 6 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[0]' ning yangi qiymati 6 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Fibonachchi usulidagi rekursiv f(5) qiymatini toping: int f(int n){ if(n<=1) return n; return f(n-1)+f(n-2); }", "options": ["3", "5", "13", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Fibonachchi ketma-ketligi: f(0)=0, f(1)=1, f(2)=1, f(3)=2, f(4)=3, f(5)=5. Demak, f(5) = 5."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(4);", "options": ["7", "4", "12", "10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(4) = 4 + s(3) = 4 + (3 + s(2)) = 4 + 3 + (2 + s(1)) = 4 + 3 + 2 + 1 = 10."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(9);", "options": ["9", "45", "55", "36"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(9) = 9 + s(8) = 9 + 36 = 45."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"web\"; strcat(a,\"site\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["web", "site", "website", "web site"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"web\" va \"site\" birikib \"website\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(999) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["36", "9", "18", "27"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(999) = 9 + g(99) = 9 + (9 + g(9)) = 9 + 9 + 9 = 27."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Dastur\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["8", "6", "7", "5"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Dastur\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"cplus\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["6", "5", "7", "4"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"cplus\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["7", "8", "10", "9"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"algoritm\" satrida 8 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "p(a,b) funksiyasi a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) qiymatini toping: int p(int a,int b){ if(b==0) return 1; return a*p(a,b-1); }", "options": ["216", "36", "12", "18"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) = 6^2 = 36."},     {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"info\"; strcat(a,\"matika\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["info", "info matika", "matika", "informatika"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"info\" va \"matika\" birikib \"informatika\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(8);", "options": ["36", "28", "8", "45"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(8) = 8 + s(7) = 8 + 28 = 36."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["8", "1", "9", "0"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(8);", "options": ["64", "8", "40320", "5040"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(8) = 8! = 8 * 7! = 8 * 5040 = 40320."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={2,3,4}; int *p=a; *(p+1)=10; cout<<a[1];", "options": ["10", "4", "3", "2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' 'a[1]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[1]' ning qiymatini 10 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[1]' ning yangi qiymati 10 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "10", "2", "12"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10+2=12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"Dastur\"; strcat(a,\"lash\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["lash", "Dastur", "Dasturlash", "Dastur lash"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"Dastur\" va \"lash\" birikib \"Dasturlash\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["9", "1", "8", "0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1+8=9 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"AI\"; strcat(a,\"Lab\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["AI", "AI Lab", "AILab", "Lab"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"AI\" va \"Lab\" birikib \"AILab\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Fibonachchi usulidagi rekursiv f(6) qiymatini toping: int f(int n){ if(n<=1) return n; return f(n-1)+f(n-2); }", "options": ["13", "5", "21", "8"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Fibonachchi ketma-ketligi: f(0)=0, f(1)=1, f(2)=1, f(3)=2, f(4)=3, f(5)=5, f(6)=8. Demak, f(6) = 8."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["8", "7", "5", "6"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"banana\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,6,7}; int *p=a; *(p+2)=12; cout<<a[2];", "options": ["5", "6", "12", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' 'a[2]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[2]' ning qiymatini 12 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[2]' ning yangi qiymati 12 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? int x=3, y=8; int *p=&x; p=&y; *p=10; cout<<x<<\" \"<<y;", "options": ["3 8", "10 8", "10 10", "3 10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Dastlab 'p' 'x' ga ishora qiladi, keyin 'y' ga ishora qilish uchun o'zgartiriladi. '*p=10' 'y' ning qiymatini 10 ga o'zgartiradi, 'x' esa o'zgarmaydi. Natijada '3 10' chiqadi."}]}j›‚
   ј ј                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Ѓ”,Z Q‚Ёq_3b248404da7e46efa924e3a0efdcae36C{"variant": "C", "quizzes": [{"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,9,12}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["5", "12", "9", "0"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi elementiga (indeks 1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 9."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["6", "8", "12", "10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) = 6 + g(202) = 6 + (2 + g(20)) = 6 + 2 + (0 + g(2)) = 6 + 2 + 0 + 2 = 10."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"salom\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["6", "4", "5", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"salom\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"informatika\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["12", "10", "13", "11"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"informatika\" satrida 11 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[5]={1,3,5,7,9}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+3);", "options": ["7", "3", "5", "1"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+3)' massivning to'rtinchi elementiga (indeks 3) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[3] = 7."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["12", "0", "2", "10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(7);", "options": ["720", "7", "5040", "49"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(7) = 7! = 7 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 3 * 2 * 1 = 5040."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strchr(s,'n');", "options": ["a", "banana", "nana", "na"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'banana' satrida 'n' belgisi 'nana' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=4; int *p=&a; *p+=6; cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "10  *  0 ["4", "2", "6", "8"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' massivning uchinchi elementiga (indeks 2) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[2] = 6."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(8);", "options": ["64", "8", "40320", "5040"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(8) = 8! = 8 * 7! = 8 * 5040 = 40320."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["12", "6", "10", "8"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(2026) = 6 + g(202) = 6 + (2 + g(20)) = 6 + 2 + (0 + g(2)) = 6 + 2 + 0 + 2 = 10."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(6);", "options": ["6", "15", "28", "21"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(6) = 6 + s(5) = 6 + 15 = 21."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? int x=2, y=6; int *p=&x; p=&y; *p=9; cout<<x<<\" \"<<y;", "options": ["9 9", "2 6", "9 6", "2 9"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Dastlab 'p' 'x' ga ishora qiladi, keyin 'y' ga ishora qilish uchun o'zgartiriladi. '*p=9' 'y' ning qiymatini 9 ga o'zgartiradi, 'x' esa o'zgarmaydi. Natijada '2 9' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={2,3,4}; int *p=a; *(p+1)=10; cout<<a[1];", "options": ["3", "10", "4", "2"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' 'a[1]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[1]' ning qiymatini 10 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[1]' ning yangi qiymati 10 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(7);", "options": ["7", "21", "28", "36"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(7) = 7 + s(6) = 7 + 21 = 28."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int n){ if(n==0) return 1; return n*f(n-1); } cout << f(7);", "options": ["5040", "49", "720", "7"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Berilgan funksiya n faktorialini hisoblaydi. f(7) = 7! = 7 * 6 * 5 * 4 * 3 * 2 * 1 = 5040."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=4; } int a=7; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["11", "0", "4", "7"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 7 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Kitob\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["4", "5", "6", "7"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Kitob\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Fibonachchi usulidagi rekursiv f(5) qiymatini toping: int f(int n){ if(n<=1) return n; return f(n-1)+f(n-2); }", "options": ["3", "8", "5", "13"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Fibonachchi ketma-ketligi: f(0)=0, f(1)=1, f(2)=1, f(3)=2, f(4)=3, f(5)=5. Demak, f(5) = 5."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(9);", "options": ["55", "9", "45", "36"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(9) = 9 + s(8) = 9 + 36 = 45."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=4; int *p=&a; *p+=6; cout<<a;", "options": ["4", "10", "0", "6"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=6' 'a' ning qiymatini 6 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 4+6=10 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,9,12}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["12", "5", "9", "0"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi elementiga (indeks 1  1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 9."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[5]={1,3,5,7,9}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+3);", "options": ["7", "1", "3", "5"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+3)' massivning to'rtinchi elementiga (indeks 3) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[3] = 7."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"salom\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["6", "4", "5", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"salom\" satrida 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=4; } int a=7; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "11", "7", "4"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 7+4=11 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"data\"; strcat(a,\"base\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["database", "data base", "base", "data"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"data\" va \"base\" birikib \"database\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "p(a,b) funksiyasi a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(2,5) qiymatini toping: int p(int a,int b){ if(b==0) return 1; return a*p(a,b-1); }", "options": ["16", "32", "10", "64"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(2,5) = 2^5 = 32."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={1,8,9}; int *p=a; *(p+0)=6; cout<<a[0];", "options": ["9", "6", "1", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+0)' 'a[0]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[0]' ning qiymatini 6 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[0]' ning yangi qiymati 6 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"informatika\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["13", "11", "12", "10"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"informatika\" satrida 11 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["8", "5", "6", "7"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"banana\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(3);", "options": ["3 2 1 ", "1 2 3 ", "1 ", "3 "], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(472) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["7", "24", "13", "4"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(472) = 2 + g(47) = 2 + (7 + g(4)) = 2 + 7 + 4 = 13."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? int x=3, y=8; int *p=&x; p=&y; *p=10; cout<<x<<\" \"<<y;", "options": ["10 8", "3 10", "10 10", "3 8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Dastlab 'p' 'x' ga ishora qiladi, keyin 'y' ga ishora qilish uchun o'zgartiriladi. '*p=10' 'y' ning qiymatini 10 ga o'zgartiradi, 'x' esa o'zgarmaydi. Natijada '3 10' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"info\"; strcat(a,\"matika\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["matika", "informatika", "info", "info matika"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"info\" va \"matika\" birikib \"informatika\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"banana\"; cout<<strchr(s,'n');", "options": ["na", "banana", "a", "nana"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'banana' satrida 'n' belgisi 'nana' dan boshlanadi."}, {"questi  2on": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"AI\"; strcat(a,\"Lab\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["AILab", "AI Lab", "Lab", "AI"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"AI\" va \"Lab\" birikib \"AILab\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=10; int *p=&a; *p+=-3; cout<<a;", "options": ["3", "7", "0", "10"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=-3' 'a' ning qiymatini -3 ga oshiradi (ya'ni 3 ga kamaytiradi). Shuning uchun 'a' 10-3=7 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["9", "7", "8", "10"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"algoritm\" satrida 8 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"Dastur\"; strcat(a,\"lash\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["lash", "Dasturlash", "Dastur", "Dastur lash"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"Dastur\" va \"lash\" birikib \"Dasturlash\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[3]={5,6,7}; int *p=a; *(p+2)=12; cout<<a[2];", "options": ["7", "6", "5", "12"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "'p' massivning boshiga ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' 'a[2]' ga teng. Bu qator 'a[2]' ning qiymatini 12 ga o'zgartiradi. Shuning uchun 'a[2]' ning yangi qiymati 12 chop etiladi."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"dasturlash\"; cout<<strchr(s,'l');", "options": ["l", "lash", "dasturlash", "sh"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'dasturlash' satrida 'l' belgisi 'lash' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["1", "9", "0", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1+8=9 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagi kod bajarilganda ekranga nima chiqadi? void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; cout << n << \" \"; p(n-1); } p(4);", "options": ["1 2 3 4 ", "1 ", "4 3 2 1 ", "4 "], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi va har bir chaqiruvda n ning joriy qiymatini chop etadi, so'ngra n-1 bilan o'zini chaqiradi. Natijada '4 3 2 1 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Fibonachchi usulidagi rekursiv f(6) qiymatini toping: int f(int n){ if(n<=1) return n; return f(n-1)+f(n-2); }", "options": ["13", "21", "5", "8"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Fibonachchi ketma-ketligi: f(0)=0, f(1)=1, f(2)=1, f(3)=2, f(4)=3, f(5)=5, f(6)=8. Demak, f(6) = 8."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=5; } int a=3; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["3", "5", "0", "8"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 3 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(10);", "options": ["45", "66", "10", "55"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(10) = 10 + s(9) = 10 + 45 = 55."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=8; } int a=1; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["1", "9", "8", "0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 1 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"cplus\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["6", "7", "5", "4"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"cplus\" satrid    a 5 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod ekranga nima chiqaradi? char s[]=\"algoritm\"; cout<<strchr(s,'r');", "options": ["r", "algoritm", "oritm", "m"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strchr() funksiyasi berilgan belgining satrdagi birinchi uchragan joyidan boshlab qolgan qismini qaytaradi. 'algoritm' satrida 'r' belgisi 'oritm' dan boshlanadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"Dastur\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["8", "6", "5", "7"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"Dastur\" satrida 6 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["2", "0", "12", "10"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni qiymat bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qilmaydi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10 bo'lib qoladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; p(n-1); cout << n << \" \"; } p(4);", "options": ["4 3 2 1 ", "4 ", "1 ", "1 2 3 4 "], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi, lekin n ning qiymatini rekursiv chaqiruv tugagandan so'ng chop etadi. Natijada '1 2 3 4 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char a[30]=\"web\"; strcat(a,\"site\"); cout<<a;", "options": ["website", "web", "web site", "site"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "strcat() funksiyasi ikkinchi satrni birinchi satr oxiriga qo'shadi. \"web\" va \"site\" birikib \"website\" bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int f(int x){ return x*x; } cout<<f(f(2));", "options": ["2", "8", "4", "16"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ichki funksiya chaqiruvi birinchi bajariladi: f(2) = 2*2 = 4. Keyin tashqi funksiya chaqiriladi: f(4) = 4*4 = 16. Natijada 16 chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={10,20,30,40}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+1);", "options": ["30", "40", "20", "10"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+1)' massivning ikkinchi elementiga (indeks 1) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[1] = 20."}, {"question": "Koddagi asosiy xatoni toping: int *p; *p=25; cout<<*p;", "options": ["Sintaksis xatosi", "Ko'rsatkich initsializatsiya qilinmagan", "Natija noto'g'ri", "Xotira yetishmovchiligi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Asosiy xato shundaki, 'p' ko'rsatkich e'lon qilingan, ammo hech qanday manzilga ishora qilish uchun initsializatsiya qilinmagan. Initsializatsiya qilinmagan ko'rsatkichni dereferensiya qilish (ya'ni '*p=25') aniqlanmagan xatti-harakatga olib keladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=5; } int a=3; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["8", "3", "0", "5"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 3+5=8 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(8);", "options": ["28", "36", "45", "8"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(8) = 8 + s(7) = 8 + 28 = 36."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: void f(int &x){ x+=2; } int a=10; f(a); cout<<a;", "options": ["0", "2", "10", "12"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya 'x' ni havola bo'yicha qabul qiladi. Funksiya ichidagi 'x' ga kiritilgan o'zgarishlar 'a' o'zgaruvchisiga ta'sir qiladi. Shuning uchun 'a' ning qiymati 10+2=12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Koddagi asosiy muammoni toping: int *p=new int(7); delete p; cout<<*p;", "options": ["Natija noto'g'ri", "Xotira sizishi", "Bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat (Use-after-free)", "Sintaksis xatosi"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'delete p' qatori 'p' ishora qilgan xotirani bo'shatadi. Keyin 'cout<<*p' bo'shatilgan xotiraga murojaat qilishga urinadi, bu 'use-after-free' xatosi bo'lib, aniqlanmagan xatti-harakatga olib keladi."}]}j›‚
   ј ј                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Ѓ”,[ Q‚Ёq_3b248404da7e46efa924e3a0efdcae36D{"variant": "D", "quizzes": [{"question": "g(n) son raqamlari yigвЂindisini hisoblaydi. g(999) natijasini toping: int g(int n){ if(n<10) return n; return n%10 + g(n/10); }", "options": ["9", "36", "27", "18"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya son raqamlari yig'indisini hisoblaydi. g(999) = 9 + g(99) = 9 + (9 + g(9)) = 9 + 9 + 9 = 27."}, {"question": "Quyidagi kod bajarilganda ekranga nima chiqadi? void p(int n){ if(n==0) return; cout << n << \" \"; p(n-1); } p(3);", "options": ["3 2 1 ", "3 ", "1 2 3 ", "1 "], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiya rekursiv tarzda chaqiriladi va har bir chaqiruvda n ning joriy qiymatini chop etadi, so'ngra n-1 bilan o'zini chaqiradi. Natijada '3 2 1 ' chiqadi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={3,6,9,12}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+2);", "options": ["9", "12", "3", "6"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'p' ko'rsatkich massivning boshiga (a[0]) ishora qiladi. '*(p+2)' massivning uchinchi elementiga (indeks 2) ishora qiladi, ya'ni a[2] = 9."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a=7; int *p=&a; *p+=5; cout<<a;", "options": ["12", "0", "7", "5"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ko'rsatkich 'p' 'a' o'zgaruvchisining manzilini saqlaydi. '*p+=5' 'a' ning qiymatini 5 ga oshiradi. Shuning uchun 'a' 7+5=12 bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: char s[]=\"test\"; cout<<strlen(s);", "options": ["3", "5", "4", "6"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "strlen() funksiyasi satrning uzunligini (null terminatorni hisobga olmagan holda) qaytaradi. \"test\" satrida 4 ta belgi bor."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(5);", "options": ["5", "20", "15", "10"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(5) = 5 + s(4) = 5 + 10 = 15."}, {"question": "Rekursiv funksiya natijasini toping: int s(int n){ if(n==1) return 1; return n+s(n-1); } cout << s(4);", "options": ["12", "10", "7", "4"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiya 1 dan n gacha bo'lgan sonlar yig'indisini hisoblaydi. s(4) = 4 + s(3) = 4 + (3 + s(2)) = 4 + 3 + (2 + s(1)) = 4 + 3 + 2 + 1 = 10."}, {"question": "p(a,b) funksiyasi a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) qiymatini toping: int p(int a,int b){ if(b==0) return 1; return a*p(a,b-1); }", "options": ["18", "12", "216", "36"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Funksiya a ning b-darajasini hisoblaydi. p(6,2) = 6^2 = 36."}, {"question": "Kod natijasini toping: int a[4]={2,4,6,8}; int *p=a; cout<<*(p+2);", "options":  /  5n": "What is a virus?", "options": ["A hardware component", "A computer program", "A network protocol", "A type of malware that replicates itself"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Computer viruses are self-replicating malicious programs that attach to other programs and spread."}, {"question": "What can you listen to on Spotify?", "options": ["Video games", "Music and podcasts", "E-books", "Movies"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Spotify is an audio streaming platform offering a wide range of music and podcasts."}, {"question": "Who writes code?", "options": ["Testers", "Designers", "Programmers", "Managers"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Programmers (or developers) are responsible for writing, testing, and maintaining software code."}, {"question": "What is a startup?", "options": ["A newly established business", "A large corporation", "A government agency", "A non-profit organization"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "A startup is a newly established business, often technology-driven, with the aim of rapid growth."}, {"question": "What is a 'Milestone'?", "options": ["A significant point in a project", "A daily meeting", "A project budget", "A small task"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "A milestone marks a key achievement or a significant stage in a project's timeline."}, {"question": "Who designs app look?", "options": ["Project managers", "Developers", "Testers", "UI/UX designers"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "UI/UX designers focus on the visual appearance (UI) and user experience (UX) of an application."}, {"question": "You ___ smoke in the hospital. It's strictly forbidden.", "options": ["don't have to", "shouldn't", "couldn't", "mustn't"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "This indicates a strict prohibition due to rules."}, {"question": "What is a CV?", "options": ["A job interview", "A document summarizing your qualifications and experience", "A type of computer", "A project plan"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "A CV (Curriculum Vitae) is a document used for job applications, outlining a person's education, skills, and experience."}, {"question": "What is VR?", "options": ["Video Recording", "Voice Recognition", "Visual Rendering", "Virtual Reality"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "VR stands for Virtual Reality, which creates simulated environments."}, {"question": "What platform is used for movies?", "options": ["Zoom", "Spotify", "Netflix", "Instagram"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Netflix is a popular streaming service primarily known for its vast library of movies and TV shows."}, {"question": "What does malware do?", "options": ["Protects data", "Harms computer systems", "Connects to the internet", "Speeds up computers"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Malware is software designed to cause damage, disrupt operations, or gain unauthorized access to computer systems."}, {"question": "What is a 'Summary'?", "options": ["A brief overview of main points", "A list of all facts", "A conclusion", "A detailed analysis"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "A summary condenses information to its essential points, providing a brief overview."}, {"question": "User Interface (UI) means how software ___.", "options": ["is coded", "functions", "looks", "stores data"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "UI focuses on the visual elements and interactive parts of a software that users see and interact with."}, {"question": "What can you do in VR?", "options": ["Play games and explore virtual worlds", "Send emails", "Make phone calls", "Write documents"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "VR allows users to interact with and explore simulated environments, often for gaming or educational purposes."}, {"question": "Why is cybersecurity important?", "options": ["To protect data and privacy", "To connect to the internet", "To make computers faster", "To create new software"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "It's crucial for safeguarding sensitive information and maintaining system integrity in the digital world."}, {"question": "In a report, what is a 'Bloc  6ker'?", "options": ["A type of security software", "A person who blocks access", "A section of a report", "Something that stops progress"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "A blocker is an impediment or issue that prevents a task or project from moving forward."}, {"question": "What is hacking?", "options": ["Fixing computer hardware", "Gaining unauthorized access to a computer system", "Designing websites", "Writing computer programs"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Hacking involves exploiting vulnerabilities to access computer systems or networks without permission."}, {"question": "You ___ pay to enter the park. It is completely free.", "options": ["don't have to", "mustn't", "couldn't", "shouldn't"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "This indicates a lack of necessity or obligation."}, {"question": "You ___ eat so much fast food. It's not healthy.", "options": ["shouldn't", "don't have to", "mustn't", "couldn't"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "This is advice against an unhealthy habit."}, {"question": "What does a firewall do?", "options": ["Blocks unauthorized access to a network", "Speeds up internet connection", "Stores data", "Creates backups"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "A firewall acts as a barrier between a trusted internal network and untrusted external networks, controlling traffic."}, {"question": "What is Artificial Intelligence?", "options": ["A computer game", "A type of robot", "A new programming language", "Machines that think like humans"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "AI involves machines performing tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as learning and problem-solving."}, {"question": "Which of these is a Voice Assistant?", "options": ["Microsoft Word", "Siri", "Photoshop", "Google Chrome"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Siri is Apple's virtual assistant that uses voice recognition to perform tasks."}, {"question": "What is a Progress Report for?", "options": ["To update on project status", "To ask for more resources", "To start a new project", "To finish a project"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "A progress report informs stakeholders about the current state, achievements, and challenges of a project."}, {"question": "What can hackers do?", "options": ["Fix computers", "Build websites", "Steal data and disrupt systems", "Write code"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Hackers gain unauthorized access to systems, often with malicious intent to steal data or cause disruption."}, {"question": "Microsoft Word is ___ software.", "options": ["system", "utility", "application", "driver"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Microsoft Word is an application software used for specific tasks like word processing."}, {"question": "What is telemedicine?", "options": ["A medical device", "Healthcare services delivered remotely", "A hospital department", "A new type of medicine"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Telemedicine uses technology to provide healthcare services from a distance, such as virtual consultations."}, {"question": "What do startups focus on?", "options": ["Large market share", "Maintaining existing products", "Innovation and rapid growth", "Stable profits"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Startups are typically new companies focused on developing unique products or services and scaling quickly."}, {"question": "What is spyware?", "options": ["A type of operating system", "A tool for system optimization", "Software that secretly collects information", "A network monitoring device"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Spyware is software that secretly monitors and collects information about a user's computer activity without their knowledge."}, {"question": "What is ransomware?", "options": ["A type of antivirus", "A secure messaging app", "A tool for data recovery", "Malware that encrypts your files and demands money"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ransomware is malicious software that encrypts a victim's files and demands a ransom payment to restore access."}, {"question": "What are hard skills?", "options": ["  7Teamwork abilities", "Communication skills", "Teachable and measurable abilities", "Personal qualities"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Hard skills are specific, quantifiable abilities that can be taught and measured, such as programming or data analysis."}, {"question": "He has a bad cold. He ___ stay in bed today.", "options": ["might", "must", "has to", "should"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "This is advice for someone who is unwell."}, {"question": "Google Drive is a type of cloud ___.", "options": ["network", "storage", "hardware", "software"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Google Drive allows users to store files and data in the cloud, accessible from anywhere."}, {"question": "What is a Project Pitch?", "options": ["A brief presentation to sell an idea", "A document for budget approval", "A meeting to assign tasks", "A detailed project plan"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "A project pitch is a concise summary or presentation designed to convince others of a project's value and gain support."}, {"question": "AI can recognize:", "options": ["Emotions", "Sounds", "Colors", "Faces and speech"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "AI excels at pattern recognition, including visual data like faces and auditory data like speech."}, {"question": "What do you wear in VR?", "options": ["A VR headset", "Special gloves", "A full suit", "3D glasses"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "A VR headset is worn to provide the immersive visual and auditory experience of virtual reality."}, {"question": "What are 'Visual Aids'?", "options": ["Images, charts, or graphs", "Sound effects", "Physical models", "Written notes"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Visual aids are tools like images, charts, and graphs used to enhance presentations and convey information visually."}, {"question": "Do we ___ wear a uniform at your school?", "options": ["have to", "must", "can", "should"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "This is the correct structure for asking about an obligation or necessity."}, {"question": "What are two very polite words to use in emails?", "options": ["ASAP and FYI", "Hey and Yo", "Please and Thank you", "Cheers and Bye"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "'Please' and 'Thank you' are fundamental words for showing politeness and respect in communication."}, {"question": "Who are 'Non-technical' people?", "options": ["People who work in sales", "People who don't use computers", "People without specialized technical knowledge", "People who are not engineers"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Non-technical people typically lack deep understanding of technical details or specialized technical skills."}, {"question": "System software example is ___.", "options": ["Windows", "Photoshop", "Google Chrome", "Microsoft Word"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Windows is an operating system, which is a type of system software."}, {"question": "What can AI do?", "options": ["Drive cars manually", "Build houses", "Cook food", "Learn and solve problems"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "AI is designed to process information, learn from it, and make decisions or solve problems."}, {"question": "What do PC games use?", "options": ["VR headsets", "Touchscreens", "Game controllers", "Computers, keyboards, and mice"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "PC games are typically played on personal computers with standard peripherals such as keyboards and mice."}, {"question": "What is teamwork?", "options": ["Working together to achieve a common goal", "Working alone", "Managing a project", "Competing with others"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teamwork involves the collaborative effort of a group to achieve a common objective."}, {"question": "Remote workers often use a ___ .", "options": ["Pager", "Fax machine", "VPN", "Typewriter"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "A VPN (Virtual Private Network) provides a secure connection for remote workers to access company networks."}, {"question": "Why use antivirus?", "options": ["To protect against viruses and malware", "To browse the internet     safely", "To store files", "To speed up your computer"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Antivirus software scans for, detects, and removes malicious software like viruses and other malware."}, {"question": "What does cybersecurity protect?", "options": ["Financial investments", "Digital data and systems", "Human health", "Physical buildings"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Cybersecurity is about protecting information and systems from unauthorized access or damage."}, {"question": "What does AI learn from?", "options": ["Data", "The internet", "Books", "Human teachers"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "AI systems learn patterns and make predictions based on large datasets they are trained on."}, {"question": "You ___ visit the museum while you are in Paris. It's fantastic!", "options": ["should", "must", "might", "have to"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "This is a strong recommendation or suggestion."}, {"question": "Software is a computer ___.", "options": ["device", "user", "program", "hardware"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Software refers to the programs and operating information used by a computer."}, {"question": "What is entertainment technology?", "options": ["Technology for work", "Technology for education", "Technology for leisure and fun", "Technology for communication"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Entertainment technology encompasses devices and software used for amusement and leisure activities."}, {"question": "What does K.I.S.S. mean?", "options": ["Keep It Simple, Stupid", "Kindly Inform Senior Staff", "Keep It Safe and Secure", "Know Important System Secrets"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "K.I.S.S. is a design principle that advocates for simplicity in design and avoiding unnecessary complexity."}, {"question": "Students ___ bring a dictionary to the exam. It is not allowed.", "options": ["mustn't", "couldn't", "shouldn't", "don't have to"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "This indicates a strict prohibition."}, {"question": "What is a strong password?", "options": ["Long and complex", "Your name", "A single word", "Easy to remember"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Strong passwords use a mix of uppercase, lowercase, numbers, and symbols, and are lengthy to make them difficult to guess."}, {"question": "Good UX means easy ___.", "options": ["to code", "to sell", "to install", "to use"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "UX (User Experience) is about making software pleasant and easy for the user to interact with."}, {"question": "Which sign-off is informal?", "options": ["Sincerely", "Cheers", "Best regards", "Regards"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "'Cheers' is a casual and informal way to end an email or conversation."}, {"question": "What is Git used for?", "options": ["Graphic design", "Data storage", "Project management", "Version control"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Git is a distributed version control system used for tracking changes in source code during software development."}, {"question": "What is E-sports?", "options": ["Competitive video gaming", "Sports played online", "Electronic sports equipment", "A type of video game"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "E-sports refers to organized, competitive video gaming, often with professional players and teams."}, {"question": "What does 'Proofread' mean?", "options": ["To read and correct errors", "To write a draft", "To summarize a document", "To send an email"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Proofreading is the process of reading text to identify and correct errors in grammar, spelling, and punctuation."}, {"question": "Microsoft Azure is a cloud ___.", "options": ["application", "operating system", "device", "platform"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Microsoft Azure is a comprehensive cloud computing platform offering various services."}, {"question": "Google Docs is a ___ application.", "options": ["system", "utility", "cloud-based", "desktop"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Google Docs operates online, making it a cloud-based application."}]}j›Ы
    r  r                                                                                                        Ѓћv\ Q‚Ѕq_ba53919ce2674fcd93aa6293a5ef7f53A{"variant": "A", "quizzes": [{"question": "Where can you play mobile games?", "options": ["On gaming consoles", "On smartphones and tablets", "On PCs", "On smart TVs"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Mobile games are specifically designed to be played on portable devices like smartphones and tablets."}, {"question": "What do freelancers sell?", "options": ["Real estate", "Physical products", "Their skills and services", "Stocks"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Freelancers work independently, offering their specialized skills and services to clients on a project basis."}, {"question": "In the UK, drivers ___ drive on the left side of the road.", "options": ["might", "can", "should", "must"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "This is a legal obligation in the UK."}, {"question": "What is data?", "options": ["A network connection", "A programming language", "Information processed or stored by a computer", "A type of computer"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Data refers to raw facts and figures that can be processed by computers."}, {"question": "I ___ wake up early on weekdays to catch the bus.", "options": ["must", "can", "should", "have to"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "This expresses an external obligation or necessity."}, {"question": "Example of programming language?", "options": ["Google Chrome", "Photoshop", "Microsoft Word", "Python"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Python is a widely used high-level programming language."}, {"question": "Who tests software?", "options": ["Users", "Testers", "Developers", "Designers"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Testers (or QA engineers) are responsible for ensuring software quality and identifying bugs."}, {"question": "What is streaming?", "options": ["Sending emails", "Watching or listening to media online in real-time", "Browsing websites", "Downloading files"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Streaming allows consumption of media content over the internet without fully downloading it first."}, {"question": "What are controllers used for?", "options": ["Browsing the internet", "Making calls", "Typing text", "Interacting with games"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Controllers provide input for gaming and interacting with virtual environments."}, {"question": "What is a 'Chart'?", "options": ["A list of tasks", "A graphical representation of data", "A meeting agenda", "A type of document"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "A chart displays data in a visual format for easier understanding and analysis."}, {"question": "When do you write an Incident Report?", "options": ["To summarize daily tasks", "Before starting a project", "After an unexpected event or accident", "To request vacation"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Incident reports are documented after an unusual or adverse event to record details and aid in analysis."}, {"question": "What is a Technical Demo?", "options": ["A meeting to discuss technical issues", "A document explaining technical specifications", "A training session for new users", "A demonstration of a product's features"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "A technical demo showcases how a product or system works, often highlighting its key features and functionalities."}, {"question": "What is phishing?", "options": ["A method of coding", "A type of computer game", "Tricking people into giving personal information", "A way to browse the internet"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Phishing uses deceptive emails or websites to trick users into revealing sensitive data like passwords or credit card numbers."}, {"question": "What are soft skills?", "options": ["Programming languages", "Data analysis", "Technical knowledge", "Personal attributes and interpersonal skills"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Soft skills are personal attributes that