"Funksiyaning birinchi tartibli hosilasidan olingan hosila"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ikkinchi tartibli hosila deb funksiyaning birinchi tartibli hosilasidan yana bir marta olingan hosilaga aytiladi."}, {"question": "Teylor qatori yordamida taqribiy hisoblashning asosiy gвЂoyasi nimada?", "options": ["Funksiyaning limitini topish", "Murakkab funksiyani ko'phad orqali taqribiy ifodalash", "Funksiyani hosila orqali ifodalash", "Funksiyani integral orqali ifodalash"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Teylor qatori murakkab funksiyalarni ma'lum bir nuqta atrofida oddiy ko'phadlar yordamida taqribiy hisoblash imkonini beradi."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning [a, b] kesmadagi oвЂrtacha qiymati qaysi formula bilan aniqlanadi?", "options": ["f_o'rtacha = f'(c)", "f_o'rtacha = (f(a) + f(b))/2", "f_o'rtacha = (1/(b-a)) в€«a^b f(x)dx", "f_o'rtacha = в€«a^b f(x)dx"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Funksiyaning [a, b] kesmadagi o'rtacha qiymati (1/(b-a)) в€«a^b f(x)dx formulasi bilan aniqlanadi."}, {"question": "Xosmas integral shartli yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar:", "options": ["Uning qiymati nolga teng bo'lsa", "U uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "U absolyut yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "U yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, lekin absolyut yaqinlashuvchi bo'lmasa"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Xosmas integral shartli yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar u yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, lekin absolyut yaqinlashuvchi bo'lmasa."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 + x boвЂlsa, f(1,2) ni toping.", "options": ["8", "7", "5", "6"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "f(1,2) = 1^2 + 2^2 + 1 = 1 + 4 + 1 = 6."}, {"question": "Qismiy yigвЂindi Sn qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Qatorning dastlabki n ta hadining yig'indisi", "Qatorning umumiy hadi", "Qatorning barcha hadlari yig'indisi", "Qatorning limiti"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qismiy yig'indi Sn deb qatorning dastlabki n ta hadining yig'indisiga aytiladi: Sn = a1 + a2 + ... + an."}, {"question": "Qachon integral I -tur xosmas 