teng. Bu nolga teng emas, shuning uchun qator uzoqlashuvchi. Zaruriy shartni tekshirish eng qulay."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning toвЂla differensiali qaysi harf bilan belgilanadi?", "options": ["О”z", "dz", "dy", "dx"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Funksiyaning to'la differensiali dz bilan belgilanadi."}, {"question": "в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx xosmas integral absolyut yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar:", "options": ["в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)|dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)|dx uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx absolyut yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)|dx integral yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa."}, {"question": "z = f(x, y) funksiyasida faqat x oвЂzgarganda funksiya qanday orttirma oladi?", "options": ["y bo'yicha xususiy orttirma", "x bo'yicha xususiy orttirma", "Nol orttirma", "To'la orttirma"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Faqat x o'zgarganda (y o'zgarmas bo'lganda) funksiya x bo'yicha xususiy orttirma oladi, О”x z = f(x+О”x, y) - f(x, y)."}, {"question": "Teylor qatori nima?", "options": ["Funksiyani bir nuqta atrofida darajali qatorga yoyish", "Funksiyaning cheksiz yig'indisi", "Funksiyaning integralini hisoblash usuli", "Funksiyaning hosilalarini hisoblash usuli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teylor qatori funksiyani bir nuqta (x0) atrofida uning hosilalari yordamida cheksiz darajali qatorga yoyishdir."}, {"question": "ToвЂla differensial formulasini koвЂrsating.", "options": ["dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx", "dz = dx + dy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiyaning to'la differensiali dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy formula bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya odatda qanday koвЂrinishda yoziladi?", "options": ["f(x, y, z)", "f(x)", "y = f(x)", "z = f(x, y)"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya odatda z = f(x, y) ko'rinishida yoziladi, bu yerda x va y mustaqil o'zga  [  ebazalari uchun optimallashtirilgan bo'lib, disk I/O operatsiyalarini minimallashtiradi, BST esa odatda operativ xotirada ishlaydi."
