damida hisoblashni yengillashtiradi."}, {"question": "в€«0^2 dx integralni toping.", "options": ["2", "0", "x", "2x"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«0^2 dx = [x]_0^2 = 2 - 0 = 2."}, {"question": "в€«0^ПЂ cos(x) dx integralni toping.", "options": ["0", "1", "-1", "ПЂ"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«0^ПЂ cos(x) dx = [sin(x)]_0^ПЂ = sin(ПЂ) - sin(0) = 0 - 0 = 0."}, {"question": "в€«1^3 2x dx integralni toping.", "options": ["8", "4", "6", "2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«1^3 2x dx = [x^2]_1^3 = 3^2 - 1^2 = 9 - 1 = 8."}, {"question": "Qachon integral xosmas integral deyiladi?", "options": ["Integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya uzilishga ega bo'lsa", "Yuqoridagi ikkala holatda ham", "Integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Integral, agar integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lsa yoki integral ostidagi funksiya oralig'ida uzilishga ega bo'lsa, xosmas integral deyiladi."}, {"question": "Qachon integral I-tur xosmas integral deyiladi?", "options": ["Integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya uzilishga ega bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa", "Integrallash oralig'i chekli bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lsa (masalan, [a, +в€ћ), (-в€ћ, b] yoki (-в€ћ, +в€ћ)), integral I-tur xosmas integral deyiladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagi qaysi holatda xosmas integral yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Chekli limitga ega bo'lsa", "Cheksiz limitga ega bo'lsa", "Limit mavjud bo'lmasa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral, agar uning limiti chekli songa teng bo'lsa, yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Chegarasi cheksiz boвЂlgan integral qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Limit orqali", "Nyuton-Leybnits formulasi orqali", "Bo'laklab integrallash orqali", "O'zgaruvchini almashtirish orqali"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Chegarasi cheksiz bo'lgan integral limit orqali aniqlanadi, masalan, в€«a^в€ћ f(x)dx = lim(bв†’в€ћ) в€«  ‡a^b f(x)dx."}, {"question": "Qachon xosmas integral uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Chekli limitga ega bo'lsa", "Cheksiz limitga ega bo'lsa yoki limit mavjud bo'lmasa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya uzluksiz bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Xosmas integral, agar uning limiti cheksiz bo'lsa yoki mavjud bo'lmasa, uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Xosmas integralni aniqlashda qaysi usul asosiy hisoblanadi?", "options": ["Limitga o'tish", "Nyuton-Leybnits formulasi", "Bo'laklab integrallash", "O'zgaruvchini almashtirish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integralni aniqlashda asosiy usul limitga o'tishdir, chunki u cheksiz chegaralarni yoki uzilish nuqtalarini chekli chegaralar bilan almashtirishga imkon beradi."}, {"question": "в€«-в€ћ^+в€ћ f(x) dx integral qachon yaqinlashuvchi boвЂladi?", "options": ["Agar в€«-в€ћ^c f(x)dx va в€«c^+в€ћ f(x)dx ikkalasi ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Agar в€«-в€ћ^c f(x)dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Agar в€«c^+в€ћ f(x)dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Har doim"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«-в€ћ^+в€ћ f(x) dx integral, agar u ikki qismga ajratilganda (masalan, в€«-в€ћ^c f(x)dx + в€«c^+в€ћ f(x)dx) har ikkala qism ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, yaqinlashuvchi bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Xosmas integralning uzoqlashuvchi boвЂlishi nimani anglatadi?", "options": ["Integralning qiymati chekli son", "Integralning qiymati cheksiz yoki mavjud emas", "Integralning qiymati nolga teng", "Integralning qiymati manfiy"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Xosmas integralning uzoqlashuvchi bo'lishi uning qiymati cheksiz ekanligini yoki limit mavjud emasligini anglatadi."}, {"question": "в€«1^+в€ћ 1/x^2 dx integralni hisoblang.", "options": ["1", "0", "2", "в€ћ"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«1^+в€ћ 1/x^2 dx = lim(bв†’в€ћ) [-1/x]_1^b = lim(bв†’в€ћ) (-1/b - (-1/1)) = 0 + 1 = 1."}, {"question": "в€«1^+в€ћ 1/x dx integralni hisoblang.", "options": ["в€ћ", "1", "0", "ln(x)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«1^+в€ћ 1/x dx = lim(bв†’в€ћ) [ln|x|]_1^b = lim(bв†’в€ћ) (ln(b) - ln(1)) = в€ћ - 0 = в€ћ. Bu integral uzoqlashuvchi."}, {"question": "Qachon integral I-tur xosmas integral deyiladi?", "options": ["Integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya uzilishga ega bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa", "Integrallash oralig'i chekli bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lsa (masalan, [a, +в€ћ), (-в€ћ, b] yoki (-в€ћ, +в€ћ)), integral I-tur xosmas integral deyiladi."}, {"question": "Qachon integral II-tur xosmas integral deyiladi?", "options": ["Integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya integrallash oralig'ida uzilishga ega bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa", "Integrallash oralig'i chekli bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Agar integral ostidagi funksiya integrallash oralig'ining biror nuqtasida (yoki chegarasida) cheksiz uzilishga ega bo'lsa, integral II-tur xosmas integral deyiladi."}, {"question": "Xosmas integral yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar:", "options": ["Uning limiti chekli songa teng bo'lsa", "Uning limiti cheksiz bo'lsa", "Uning limiti mavjud bo'lmasa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral, agar uning limiti chekli songa teng bo'lsa, yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "в€«a^в€ћ f(x) dx xosmas integral absolyut yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar:", "options": ["в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)| dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ f(x) dx yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ f(x) dx uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)| dx uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral в€«a^в€ћ f(x) dx absolyut yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar в€«a^в€ћ |f(x)| dx integral yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa."}, {"question": "Xosmas integral shartli yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar:", "options": ["U o'zi yaqinlashuvchi, lekin absolyut yaqinlashuvchi bo'lmasa", "U absolyut yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "U uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Uning limiti n  €olga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral shartli yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi, agar u o'zi yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, lekin uning moduli bo'yicha olingan integral uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa (ya'ni, absolyut yaqinlashuvchi bo'lmasa)."}, {"question": "Xosmas integral tushunchasi nimani umumlashtiradi?", "options": ["Aniq integral tushunchasini", "Hosilani hisoblashni", "Differensial tenglamalarni", "Qatorlarning yig'indisini"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral tushunchasi aniq integral tushunchasini integrallash oralig'i cheksiz bo'lgan yoki integral ostidagi funksiya uzilishga ega bo'lgan holatlarga umumlashtiradi."}, {"question": "I-tur xosmas integralning asosiy belgisi nimada?", "options": ["Integrallash oralig'ining cheksizligi", "Integral ostidagi funksiyaning uzilishga ega bo'lishi", "Integral ostidagi funksiyaning nolga teng bo'lishi", "Integrallash oralig'ining chekliligi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "I-tur xosmas integralning asosiy belgisi integrallash oralig'ining cheksiz bo'lishidir."}, {"question": "II-tur xosmas integralning asosiy belgisi nimada?", "options": ["Integrallash oralig'ining cheksizligi", "Integral ostidagi funksiyaning integrallash oralig'ida uzilishga ega bo'lishi", "Integral ostidagi funksiyaning nolga teng bo'lishi", "Integrallash oralig'ining chekliligi"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "II-tur xosmas integralning asosiy belgisi integral ostidagi funksiyaning integrallash oralig'ida uzilishga ega bo'lishidir."}, {"question": "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi xosmas integral nimani anglatadi?", "options": ["Uning moduli bo'yicha olingan integral ham yaqinlashuvchi", "Uning moduli bo'yicha olingan integral uzoqlashuvchi", "Uning qiymati nolga teng", "Uning qiymati cheksiz"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi xosmas integral, uning moduli bo'yicha olingan integral ham yaqinlashuvchi ekanligini anglatadi."}, {"question": "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi xosmas integral qaysi holatda yuzaga keladi?", "options": ["Integral o'zi yaqinlashuvchi, lekin uning moduli bo'yicha integral uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Integral o'zi va uning moduli bo'yicha integral ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Integral uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Integralning qiymati nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi xosmas integral, integralning o'zi yaqinlashuvchi bo'lib, lekin uning moduli bo'yicha olingan integral uzoqlashuvchi bo'lgan holatda yuzaga keladi."}, {"question": "Sonli qator deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Haqiqiy sonlar ketma-ketligining yig'indisiga", "Funksiyalar ketma-ketligiga", "Differensial tenglamalar yechimiga", "Integrallarning yig'indisiga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Sonli qator deb haqiqiy sonlar ketma-ketligining cheksiz yig'indisiga aytiladi: a1 + a2 + a3 + ..."}, {"question": "Qismiy yigвЂindi Sn qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Qatorning dastlabki n ta hadining yig'indisi", "Qatorning barcha hadlarining yig'indisi", "Qatorning umumiy hadi", "Qatorning limiti"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qismiy yig'indi Sn qatorning dastlabki n ta hadining yig'indisi sifatida aniqlanadi: Sn = a1 + a2 + ... + an."}, {"question": "Qator qachon yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Agar uning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa", "Agar uning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi cheksiz limitga ega bo'lsa", "Agar uning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi limitga ega bo'lmasa", "Agar uning umumiy hadi nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qator, agar uning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa, yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Qator qachon uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Agar uning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa", "Agar uning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi cheksiz limitga ega bo'lsa yoki limit mavjud bo'lmasa", "Agar uning umumiy hadi nolga teng bo'lsa", "Agar uning barcha hadlari musbat bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 1, "explanation": "Qator, agar uning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi cheksiz limitga e  ‰ga bo'lsa yoki limit mavjud bo'lmasa, uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Yaqinlashuvchi qator uchun zaruriy shart qanday?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = L в‰  0", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = в€ћ", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) Sn = L"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, uning umumiy hadining limiti nolga teng bo'lishi shart: lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0. Bu faqat zaruriy shart, yetarli emas."}, {"question": "Agar qatorning umumiy hadi an = (n^2 + 1) / (n^3) boвЂlsa, uning dastlabki 3 ta hadini yozing.", "options": ["2/1, 5/8, 10/27", "1/1, 2/8, 3/27", "2/1, 3/8, 4/27", "1, 1/2, 1/3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n=1: (1^2+1)/(1^3) = 2/1 = 2. n=2: (2^2+1)/(2^3) = 5/8. n=3: (3^2+1)/(3^3) = 10/27. Demak, 2, 5/8, 10/27."}, {"question": "Agar qatorning umumiy hadi an = (n^3 - 1) / n boвЂlsa, uning dastlabki 3 ta hadini yozing.", "options": ["0, 7/2, 26/3", "1, 2, 3", "0, 3, 8", "1, 7/2, 26/3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n=1: (1^3-1)/1 = 0/1 = 0. n=2: (2^3-1)/2 = 7/2. n=3: (3^3-1)/3 = 26/3. Demak, 0, 7/2, 26/3."}, {"question": "Agar qatorning umumiy hadi an = 3^n boвЂlsa, uning dastlabki 4 ta hadini yozing.", "options": ["3, 9, 27, 81", "1, 3, 9, 27", "3, 6, 9, 12", "1, 2, 3, 4"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n=1: 3^1 = 3. n=2: 3^2 = 9. n=3: 3^3 = 27. n=4: 3^4 = 81. Demak, 3, 9, 27, 81."}, {"question": "Agar ОЈan va ОЈbn yaqinlashuvchi boвЂlsa, ОЈ(an + bn) qanday?", "options": ["Yaqinlashuvchi", "Uzoqlashuvchi", "Ba'zan yaqinlashuvchi, ba'zan uzoqlashuvchi", "Aniqlab bo'lmaydi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar ikkita qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, ularning yig'indisi ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Qatorning umumiy hadini yozing: 1/3 + 2/9 + 4/27 + 8/81 + вЂ¦", "options": ["(2^(n-1))/(3^n)", "n/(3^n)", "1/(3^n)", "2^n/(3^n)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Suratda 2 ning darajalari (2^0, 2^1, 2^2, ...), maxrajda 3 ning darajalari (3^1, 3^2, 3^3, ...) joylashgan. Demak, umumiy had (2^(n-1))/(3^n) bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Musbat hadli qator deb nimaga deyiladi?", "options": ["Barcha hadlari musbat bo'lgan qatorga", "Barcha hadlari manfiy bo'lgan qatorga", "Hadlari ishorasini almashtirib keladigan qatorga", "Hadlari nolga teng bo'lgan qatorga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Musbat hadli qator deb barcha hadlari musbat bo'lgan qatorga aytiladi (an > 0)."}, {"question": "Taqqoslash alomati qaysi shartda qoвЂllaniladi?", "options": ["Musbat hadli qatorlar uchun", "Ishorasi o'zgaruvchi qatorlar uchun", "Darajali qatorlar uchun", "Funksional qatorlar uchun"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Taqqoslash alomati musbat hadli qatorlarning yaqinlashishini yoki uzoqlashishini tekshirish uchun qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri Dalamber alomati formulasi?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an| = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n) = L", "в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dalamber alomati (nisbat alomati) lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an| = L formulasi bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri Koshining ildiz alomati formulasi?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n) = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an| = L", "в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Koshining ildiz alomati lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n) = L formulasi bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri Umumlashgan taqqoslash alomati formulasi?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an/bn) = L (0 < L < в€ћ)", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an| = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n) = L", "в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Umumlashgan taqqoslash alomati (limitli taqqoslash alomati) lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an/bn) = L (0 < L < в€ћ) formulasi bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "Integral alomatning mazmuni:", "options": ["Agar f(x) musbat, kamayuvchi va uzluksiz bo'lsa, ОЈan va в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx bir vaqtda yaqinlashadi yoki uzoqlashadi", "Qatorning umumiy hadi nolga intilishi", "Qatorning hadlari nisbati limiti", "Qatorning hadlaridan n-chi ildiz limiti"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Integral alomatga  Љ ko'ra, agar f(x) musbat, kamayuvchi va uzluksiz funksiya bo'lsa, u holda ОЈan qator va в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx xosmas integral bir vaqtda yaqinlashadi yoki uzoqlashadi."}, {"question": "Har bir musbat hadidan keyin manfiy had kelsa va har bir manfiy hadidan keyin musbat had kelsa, bu qatorga........ deyiladi.", "options": ["Ishorasi almashinuvchi qator", "Musbat hadli qator", "Darajali qator", "Funksional qator"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Har bir musbat hadidan keyin manfiy had, har bir manfiy hadidan keyin musbat had keladigan qator ishorasi almashinuvchi qator deyiladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagi qator: ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) 3^n / n! qaysi alomat yordamida yaqinlashuvchilikka tekshiriladi?", "options": ["Dalamber alomati", "Koshining ildiz alomati", "Taqqoslash alomati", "Integral alomat"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Faktorial (n!) ishtirok etgan qatorlarni Dalamber alomati (nisbat alomati) yordamida tekshirish qulaydir."}, {"question": "Umumiy hadi an = (n^2 - 1) / n^4 boвЂlgan qatorni qaysi alomat yordamida yaqinlashuvchilikka tekshirish qulay?", "options": ["Taqqoslash alomati", "Dalamber alomati", "Koshining ildiz alomati", "Integral alomat"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu turdagi ratsional funksiyali qatorlarni taqqoslash alomati (yoki limitli taqqoslash alomati) yordamida tekshirish qulay, masalan, 1/n^2 bilan taqqoslash mumkin."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) 5^n / n! qatorni yaqinlashishga tekshiring.", "options": ["Yaqinlashuvchi", "Uzoqlashuvchi", "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi", "Aniqlab bo'lmaydi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu qator Dalamber alomati bo'yicha yaqinlashuvchi. lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an| = lim(nв†’в€ћ) (5^(n+1)/(n+1)!) / (5^n/n!) = lim(nв†’в€ћ) 5/(n+1) = 0 < 1. Demak, qator yaqinlashuvchi."}, {"question": "Funksional qator deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Hadlari funksiyalar bo'lgan qatorga", "Hadlari sonlar bo'lgan qatorga", "Hadlari differensial tenglamalar bo'lgan qatorga", "Hadlari integrallar bo'lgan qatorga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksional qator deb hadlari funksiyalar bo'lgan qatorga aytiladi: u1(x) + u2(x) + ... + un(x) + ..."}, {"question": "Funksional qatorning umumiy koвЂrinishi toвЂgвЂri berilgan javobni toping", "options": ["ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) un(x)", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an", "в€«f(x)dx", "f'(x)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksional qatorning umumiy ko'rinishi ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) un(x) shaklida bo'ladi, bu yerda un(x) funksiyalar ketma-ketligi."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an(x - x0)^n qator xususiy holda x0 = 0 boвЂlsa qanday koвЂrinishda boвЂladi?", "options": ["ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an x^n", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) (x - x0)^n", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) x^n"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar x0 = 0 bo'lsa, ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an(x - x0)^n qator ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an x^n ko'rinishini oladi, bu Makloren qatorining umumiy shakli."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) an x^n darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi qaysi formula orqali aniqlanadi?", "options": ["R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an|", "R = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an|", "R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n)", "Barcha javoblar to'g'ri"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "Darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi Dalamber alomati (R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an|) yoki Koshining ildiz alomati (R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n)) orqali aniqlanadi. Shuning uchun barcha javoblar to'g'ri."}, {"question": "Uzluksiz funksiyalarning [a, b] kesmada kuchaytirilgan funksional qatorining yigвЂindisi ham bu kesmada ____________ boвЂladi.", "options": ["Uzluksiz", "Differensiallanuvchi", "Integrallanuvchi", "Chekli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Uzluksiz funksiyalarning bir tekis yaqinlashuvchi funksional qatorining yig'indisi ham bu kesmada uzluksiz bo'ladi."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) fn(x) Funksional qatorning yaqinlashish sohasi deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lgan barcha x nuqtalar to'plami", "Qator uzoqlashuvchi bo'lgan barcha x nuqtalar to'plami", "Qatorning umumiy hadi nolga teng bo'lgan nuqtalar", "Qatorning yig'indisi nolga teng bo'lgan nuqtalar"], "correct_index":   ‹0, "explanation": "Funksional qatorning yaqinlashish sohasi deb qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lgan barcha x nuqtalar to'plamiga aytiladi."}, {"question": "Agar lim(kв†’в€ћ) Sk(x) = S(x) chekli limit mavjud boвЂlsa, u holda ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) fn(x) funksional qatorga nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Yaqinlashuvchi", "Uzoqlashuvchi", "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi", "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar funksional qatorning qismiy yig'indilari ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa, u yaqinlashuvchi funksional qator deyiladi."}, {"question": "Agar qator faqat juft yoki faqat toq darajalarni oвЂz ichiga olsa yoki darajalari karrali boвЂlsa, va h.k., u holda yaqinlashish oraligвЂi qaysi alomatlardan foydalanib topiladi.", "options": ["Dalamber yoki Koshi alomatlari", "Taqqoslash alomati", "Integral alomat", "Leybnits alomati"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Darajali qatorlarning yaqinlashish oralig'ini topishda Dalamber yoki Koshi alomatlari universal hisoblanadi, hatto darajalar tartibi o'zgargan holatlarda ham."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) x^n / n qatorni x = 1 da tekshiring. Qaysi javob toвЂgвЂri?", "options": ["Uzoqlashuvchi", "Yaqinlashuvchi", "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi", "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "x = 1 bo'lganda qator ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) 1/n ko'rinishini oladi, bu garmonik qator bo'lib, u uzoqlashuvchidir."}, {"question": "Agar lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an| = 2 boвЂlsa, darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi nechaga teng?", "options": ["1/2", "2", "1", "0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dalamber alomatiga ko'ra, yaqinlashish radiusi R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an+1/an| formulasi bilan topiladi. Demak, R = 1/2."}, {"question": "Teylor qatori nima?", "options": ["Funksiyani bir nuqta atrofida darajali qatorga yoyish", "Funksiyani cheksiz yig'indi shaklida ifodalash", "Funksiyaning hosilalarini hisoblash usuli", "Funksiyaning integralini hisoblash usuli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teylor qatori funksiyani biror nuqta (x0) atrofida cheksiz darajali qatorga yoyish usulidir."}, {"question": "Makloren qatori nima?", "options": ["Teylor qatorining x0 = 0 dagi xususiy holi", "Funksiyaning hosilalarini hisoblash usuli", "Funksiyaning integralini hisoblash usuli", "Funksiyani cheksiz yig'indi shaklida ifodalash"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Makloren qatori Teylor qatorining x0 = 0 bo'lgan xususiy holidir."}, {"question": "вЂњFunksiyani darajali qatorga yoyishвЂќ deganda nima tushuniladi?", "options": ["Funksiyani cheksiz ko'phad shaklida ifodalash", "Funksiyaning hosilasini topish", "Funksiyaning integralini topish", "Funksiyaning grafigini chizish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyani darajali qatorga yoyish deganda, uni cheksiz ko'phad shaklida (ya'ni, x ning darajalari yig'indisi ko'rinishida) ifodalash tushuniladi."}, {"question": "e^x funksiyaning Makloren qatori qaysi?", "options": ["ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n / n!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n) / (2n)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "e^x funksiyasining Makloren qatori ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n / n! formulasi bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "sin x funksiyaning Makloren qatori qaysi?", "options": ["ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n / n!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n) / (2n)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)!"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "sin x funksiyasining Makloren qatori ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)! formulasi bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "Agar Teylor qatorida x0 = 0 deb olinsa, funksiyaning x ning darajalari boвЂyicha qaysi qatorni hosil qilamiz?", "options": ["Makloren qatorini", "Fur'ye qatorini", "Garmonik qatorni", "Geometrik qatorni"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teylor qatorida x0 = 0 deb olinsa, Makloren qatori hosil bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Teylor qatori yordamida taqribiy hisoblashning asosiy gвЂoyasi nimada?", "options": ["Murakkab funksiyalarni ko'phadlar bilan almashtirish", "Funksiyaning aniq qiymatini topish", "Funksiyaning hosilasini topish", "F  Њunksiyaning integralini topish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teylor qatori yordamida taqribiy hisoblashning asosiy g'oyasi murakkab funksiyalarni ularning ko'phad yaqinlashishlari bilan almashtirishdir, bu esa hisoblashlarni soddalashtiradi."}, {"question": "Makloren qatori qaysi formula asosida yoziladi?", "options": ["f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (f^(n)(0) / n!) x^n", "f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (f^(n)(x0) / n!) (x - x0)^n", "f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) an x^n", "f(x) = f(0) + f'(0)x"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Makloren qatori f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (f^(n)(0) / n!) x^n formulasi asosida yoziladi."}, {"question": "e^x qatori nima sababdan qulay?", "options": ["Uning hosilasi va integrali o'ziga tengligi sababli", "Uning hadlari juda tez kamaygani sababli", "Uning yaqinlashish radiusi cheksizligi sababli", "Barcha javoblar to'g'ri"], "correct_index": 3, "explanation": "e^x qatori hosilasi va integrali o'ziga tengligi, hadlari tez kamayishi va yaqinlashish radiusi cheksizligi sababli hisoblashlarda juda qulaydir."}, {"question": "Qaysi funksiya uchun birinchi va ikkinchi tartibli hosilasining 0 dagi qiymati bir xil?", "options": ["e^x", "sin x", "cos x", "ln(1+x)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "e^x funksiyasining barcha tartibli hosilalari e^x ga teng, shuning uchun x=0 da ularning qiymati e^0 = 1 ga teng bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya qanday taвЂ™riflanadi?", "options": ["Har bir (x, y) juftiga bitta z qiymatini mos qo'yuvchi qoida", "Har bir x ga bitta y qiymatini mos qo'yuvchi qoida", "Har bir z ga bitta (x, y) juftini mos qo'yuvchi qoida", "Har bir x ga bitta z qiymatini mos qo'yuvchi qoida"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya har bir (x, y) tartiblangan juftiga yagona z qiymatini mos qo'yuvchi qoida sifatida ta'riflanadi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya odatda qanday koвЂrinishda yoziladi?", "options": ["z = f(x, y)", "y = f(x)", "f(x, y) = 0", "x = f(y, z)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya odatda z = f(x, y) ko'rinishida yoziladi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiyaning aniqlanish sohasi nima?", "options": ["Funksiya aniqlangan (x, y) nuqtalar to'plami", "Funksiyaning qiymatlari to'plami", "Funksiyaning hosilalari to'plami", "Funksiyaning integrallari to'plami"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiyaning aniqlanish sohasi funksiya ma'noga ega bo'lgan barcha (x, y) nuqtalar to'plamidir."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya limiti qanday belgilanadi?", "options": ["lim((x,y)в†’(x0,y0)) f(x,y)", "lim(xв†’x0) f(x)", "lim(yв†’y0) f(y)", "f(x0, y0)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya limiti lim((x,y)в†’(x0,y0)) f(x,y) ko'rinishida belgilanadi."}, {"question": "Agar funksiya nuqtada aniqlanmagan boвЂlsa, bu nuqta qanday ataladi?", "options": ["Uzilish nuqtasi", "Ekstremum nuqtasi", "Statsionar nuqta", "Aniqlanish sohasi nuqtasi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar funksiya biror nuqtada aniqlanmagan bo'lsa, bu nuqta funksiyaning uzilish nuqtasi bo'lishi mumkin."}, {"question": "Uch oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya qanday yoziladi?", "options": ["u = f(x, y, z)", "z = f(x, y)", "y = f(x)", "f(x, y, z) = 0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Uch o'zgaruvchili funksiya u = f(x, y, z) ko'rinishida yoziladi."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 boвЂlsa, f(1,2) ni toping.", "options": ["5", "3", "1", "4"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "f(1,2) = 1^2 + 2^2 = 1 + 4 = 5."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = 2x + y boвЂlsa, f(1,3) ni toping.", "options": ["5", "4", "7", "6"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "f(1,3) = 2*(1) + 3 = 2 + 3 = 5."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 + xy boвЂlsa, f(1,2) ni toping.", "options": ["7", "5", "6", "8"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "f(1,2) = 1^2 + 2^2 + 1*2 = 1 + 4 + 2 = 7."}, {"question": "Uch oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya qaysi fazoda aniqlanadi?", "options": ["R^3 fazoda", "R^2 fazoda", "R^1 fazoda", "Kompleks fazoda"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Uch o'zgaruvchili funksiya  Ќ uch o'lchovli fazoda (R^3) aniqlanadi."}, {"question": "Xususiy hosila hisoblanayotgan oвЂzgaruvchidan boshqa barcha oвЂzgaruvchilar nima deb qaraladi?", "options": ["O'zgarmas sonlar", "Nolga teng", "Cheksiz", "Boshqa funksiyalar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xususiy hosila hisoblanayotganda, hosila olinayotgan o'zgaruvchidan boshqa barcha o'zgaruvchilar o'zgarmas sonlar deb qaraladi."}, {"question": "z = f(x, y) funksiyasida faqat x oвЂzgarganda funksiya qanday orttirma oladi?", "options": ["Xususiy orttirma", "To'la orttirma", "Differensial", "Hosilaning orttirmasi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Faqat bitta o'zgaruvchi o'zgarganda funksiya xususiy orttirma oladi."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning toвЂla differensiali qaysi harf bilan belgilanadi?", "options": ["dz", "dx", "dy", "df"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyaning to'la differensiali odatda dz (agar funksiya z=f(x,y) bo'lsa) yoki df bilan belgilanadi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiyaning nechta birinchi tartibli xususiy hosilasi bor?", "options": ["2 ta", "1 ta", "3 ta", "4 ta"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiyaning x va y bo'yicha ikkita birinchi tartibli xususiy hosilasi bor."}, {"question": "z''xy va z''yx hosilalar nima deb ataladi?", "options": ["Aralash ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosilalar", "Birinchi tartibli xususiy hosilalar", "To'la differensiallar", "Yuqori tartibli hosilalar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z''xy va z''yx hosilalar aralash ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosilalar deb ataladi."}, {"question": "ToвЂla differensial formulasini koвЂrsating.", "options": ["dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = dx + dy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiyaning to'la differensiali dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy formulasi bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "Ikkinchi tartibli hosila deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Birinchi tartibli hosiladan olingan hosila", "Funksiyaning o'zidan olingan hosila", "Funksiyaning integralidan olingan hosila", "Funksiyaning differensialidan olingan hosila"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikkinchi tartibli hosila deb funksiyaning birinchi tartibli hosilasidan olingan hosilaga aytiladi."}, {"question": "Agar z = x^2 + y boвЂlsa, в€‚z/в€‚x nimaga teng?", "options": ["2x", "y", "x^2", "1"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x^2 + y funksiyasining x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi в€‚z/в€‚x = 2x ga teng (y o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "Agar z = x + y^3 boвЂlsa, в€‚z/в€‚y nimaga teng?", "options": ["3y^2", "1", "x", "y^3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x + y^3 funksiyasining y bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi в€‚z/в€‚y = 3y^2 ga teng (x o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "z = x + y + c funksiyaning x boвЂyicha hosilasi nimaga teng?", "options": ["1", "y + c", "x + c", "0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x + y + c funksiyasining x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 1 ga teng (y va c o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "Funksiyada faqat x oвЂzgarganda olingan в€†x z = f(x + в€†x, y) в€’ f(x, y) ayirma nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Xususiy orttirma", "To'la orttirma", "Differensial", "Hosilaning orttirmasi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu ayirma funksiyaning x bo'yicha xususiy orttirmasi deyiladi."}, {"question": "f funksiyaning x boвЂyicha xususiy hosilasi qanday belgilanadi?", "options": ["в€‚f/в€‚x", "df/dx", "f'(x)", "f_x"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "f funksiyaning x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi в€‚f/в€‚x yoki f_x' kabi belgilanadi."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq differensial qaysi harf bilan belgilanadi?", "options": ["dz", "dx", "dy", "dF"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "To'liq differensial odatda dz (agar funksiya z=f(x,y) bo'lsa) yoki dF bilan belgilanadi."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq differensialni hisoblash formulasini koвЂrsating:", "options": ["dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = dx + dy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiyaning to'l  Ћiq differensiali dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy formulasi bilan beriladi."}, {"question": "в€‚^2z/в€‚x^2 koвЂrinishidagi hosila nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosila", "Birinchi tartibli xususiy hosila", "Aralash hosila", "To'la differensial"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu belgilash z funksiyasining x bo'yicha ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosilasini bildiradi."}, {"question": "F(x, y) = 0 koвЂrinishida berilgan funksiya nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Oshkormas funksiya", "Oshkor funksiya", "Bir o'zgaruvchili funksiya", "Ko'p o'zgaruvchili funksiya"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "F(x, y) = 0 ko'rinishida berilgan funksiya oshkormas funksiya deyiladi, chunki y x orqali oshkor ko'rinishda ifodalanmagan."}, {"question": "z = 5x + 8y funksiya uchun в€‚z/в€‚x ni toping", "options": ["5", "8", "5x", "8y"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = 5x + 8y funksiyasining x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 5 ga teng (8y o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "z = x^2 + 7y funksiya uchun в€‚z/в€‚y ni toping", "options": ["7", "2x", "x^2", "7y"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x^2 + 7y funksiyasining y bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 7 ga teng (x^2 o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "z = 10 funksiyaning x boвЂyicha xususiy hosilasi в€‚z/в€‚x nimaga teng?", "options": ["0", "10", "x", "1"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "O'zgarmas sonning xususiy hosilasi nolga teng."}, {"question": "z = x^2 boвЂlsa, ikkinchi tartibli в€‚^2z/в€‚x^2 tartibli hosilani toping:", "options": ["2", "2x", "0", "x^2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Birinchi tartibli hosila в€‚z/в€‚x = 2x. Ikkinchi tartibli hosila в€‚^2z/в€‚x^2 = в€‚(2x)/в€‚x = 2."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning maksimum va minimum nuqtalari umumiy qanday nomlanadi?", "options": ["Ekstremum nuqtalari", "Statsionar nuqtalar", "Kritik nuqtalar", "Uzilish nuqtalari"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyaning maksimum va minimum nuqtalari umumiy ekstremum nuqtalari deb ataladi."}, {"question": "Ekstremumga tekshirishda в€† = AC в€’ B^2 < 0 boвЂlsa, xulosa qanday boвЂladi?", "options": ["Ekstremum yo'q (egarlanish nuqtasi)", "Maksimum", "Minimum", "Aniqlab bo'lmaydi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar в€† = AC - B^2 < 0 bo'lsa, statsionar nuqtada ekstremum yo'q, bu egarlanish nuqtasi bo'ladi."}, {"question": "OвЂzgaruvchilari orasida П†(x, y) = 0 bogвЂlanish tenglamasi berilgan ekstremum nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Shartli ekstremum", "Absolyut ekstremum", "Lokal ekstremum", "Global ekstremum"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "O'zgaruvchilari orasida bog'lanish tenglamasi (shart) mavjud bo'lgan ekstremum shartli ekstremum deyiladi."}, {"question": "Shartli ekstremumni topishda qaysi funksiya yordamida hisoblashlar olib boriladi?", "options": ["Lagranj funksiyasi", "Maqsad funksiyasi", "Cheklov funksiyasi", "Hosilalar funksiyasi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Shartli ekstremumni topishda Lagranj ko'paytuvchilari usuli va Lagranj funksiyasi qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning yopiq sohadagi eng katta va eng kichik qiymatlari qayerda qidiriladi?", "options": ["Soha ichidagi kritik nuqtalarda va soha chegarasida", "Faqat soha ichidagi kritik nuqtalarda", "Faqat soha chegarasida", "Soha tashqarisida"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyaning yopiq sohadagi eng katta va eng kichik qiymatlari soha ichidagi kritik nuqtalarda va soha chegarasida qidiriladi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili z = f(x, y) funksiyaning P0(x0, y0) nuqtadagi qiymati uning atrofidagi boshqa nuqtalardagi qiymatlaridan katta boвЂlsa, bu nuqta nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Lokal maksimum", "Lokal minimum", "Egarlanish nuqtasi", "Kritik nuqta"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar funksiyaning qiymati P0 nuqtada uning atrofidagi barcha nuqtalardagi qiymatlardan katta bo'lsa, bu nuqta lokal maksimum deyiladi."}, {"question": "z = x^2 + y^2 funksiyaning statsionar nuqtasini toping (hosilalarni nolga tenglab topasiz).", "options": ["(0,0)", "(1,0)", "(0,1)", "(1,1)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€‚z/в€‚x =   Џ2x = 0 => x = 0. в€‚z/в€‚y = 2y = 0 => y = 0. Demak, statsionar nuqta (0,0)."}, {"question": "Agar ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiyada ekstremumni topish jarayonida A = 2, B = 0, C = 2 boвЂlsa, в€† = AC в€’ B^2 qiymatini hisoblang.", "options": ["4", "0", "2", "-4"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€† = AC - B^2 = (2)(2) - (0)^2 = 4 - 0 = 4."}, {"question": "О¦(x, y, О») = f(x, y) + О»П†(x, y) Lagranj funksiyasidan О» boвЂyicha hosila oling.", "options": ["П†(x, y)", "f(x, y)", "1", "0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Lagranj funksiyasidan О» bo'yicha hosila olinganda cheklov funksiyasi П†(x, y) hosil bo'ladi: в€‚О¦/в€‚О» = П†(x, y)."}, {"question": "z = x + y funksiyaning x boвЂyicha ikkinchi tartibli hosilasi в€‚^2z/в€‚x^2 nimaga teng?", "options": ["0", "1", "x", "y"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Birinchi tartibli hosila в€‚z/в€‚x = 1. Ikkinchi tartibli hosila в€‚^2z/в€‚x^2 = в€‚(1)/в€‚x = 0."}, {"question": "Hayotda вЂњOptimallashtirishвЂќ nima uchun kerak?", "options": ["Resurslardan samarali foydalanish va eng yaxshi natijaga erishish uchun", "Muammolarni murakkablashtirish uchun", "Faqat nazariy masalalarni yechish uchun", "Hech qanday amaliy ahamiyatga ega emas"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Optimallashtirish resurslardan (vaqt, pul, materiallar) samarali foydalanib, eng yaxshi (maksimal foyda, minimal xarajat) natijaga erishish uchun kerak."}, {"question": "вЂњMaqsad funksiyasiвЂќ deganda nimani tushunasiz?", "options": ["Optimallashtirilishi kerak bo'lgan funksiya (maksimal yoki minimal)", "Cheklovlarni ifodalovchi funksiya", "Noma'lum o'zgaruvchilar funksiyasi", "Yechimlar to'plamini ifodalovchi funksiya"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Maqsad funksiyasi optimallashtirish masalasida maksimal yoki minimal qiymati topilishi kerak bo'lgan funksiyadir."}, {"question": "Matematik modeldagi вЂњCheklovlarвЂќ nima?", "options": ["Resurslar, vaqt, imkoniyatlar kabi cheklovlarni ifodalovchi tengsizliklar yoki tengliklar", "Maqsad funksiyasining qiymatlari", "Noma'lum o'zgaruvchilarning qiymatlari", "Modelning yechimi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Matematik modeldagi cheklovlar resurslar, vaqt, imkoniyatlar kabi cheklovlarni ifodalovchi tengsizliklar yoki tengliklardir."}, {"question": "Model tuzishda вЂњSoddalikвЂќ tamoyili nima uchun kerak?", "options": ["Modelni tushunish va yechishni osonlashtirish uchun", "Modelni murakkablashtirish uchun", "Modelning aniqligini oshirish uchun", "Modelni haqiqatga yaqinlashtirish uchun"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Soddalik tamoyili modelni tushunish, tahlil qilish va yechishni osonlashtirish uchun kerak, shu bilan birga uning asosiy xususiyatlarini saqlab qolish muhim."}, {"question": "Nomanfiylik sharti (x в‰Ґ 0) nimani bildiradi?", "options": ["O'zgaruvchilarning qiymatlari manfiy bo'lmasligi kerakligini", "O'zgaruvchilarning qiymatlari nolga teng bo'lishi kerakligini", "O'zgaruvchilarning qiymatlari musbat bo'lishi kerakligini", "O'zgaruvchilarning qiymatlari cheksiz bo'lishi kerakligini"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Nomanfiylik sharti o'zgaruvchilarning qiymatlari manfiy bo'lmasligi (ya'ni, nolga teng yoki musbat bo'lishi) kerakligini bildiradi, bu ko'pincha real hayotdagi miqdorlar (masalan, mahsulot miqdori) uchun qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "Maqsad funksiyasi вЂњmaxвЂќ boвЂlsa, nima izlanadi?", "options": ["Eng katta qiymat", "Eng kichik qiymat", "Nolga teng qiymat", "Cheksiz qiymat"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Maqsad funksiyasi 'max' bo'lsa, uning eng katta (maksimal) qiymati izlanadi."}, {"question": "Modellashtirishning birinchi bosqichi nima?", "options": ["Muammoni aniqlash va tushunish", "Matematik modelni yechish", "Natijalarni tahlil qilish", "Modelni tekshirish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Modellashtirishning birinchi va eng muhim bosqichi muammoni aniq tushunish va uni shakllantirishdir."}, {"question": "Bitta mahsulotdan 5000 soвЂm foyda qolsa, x ta mahsulotdan qancha foyda qoladi?", "options": ["5000x", "5000 + x", "5000 / x", "x / 5000"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ag  ђar bitta mahsulotdan 5000 so'm foyda bo'lsa, x ta mahsulotdan 5000 * x so'm foyda qoladi."}, {"question": "Muzqaymoq 20 soвЂm, pulingiz 100 soвЂm. ToвЂgвЂri tengsizlikni toping.", "options": ["20x в‰¤ 100", "20x в‰Ґ 100", "20x = 100", "x в‰¤ 20"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar x muzqaymoq soni bo'lsa, umumiy xarajat 20x bo'ladi va bu pulingizdan oshmasligi kerak, ya'ni 20x в‰¤ 100."}, {"question": "Fermerning 10 ga yeri bor. BugвЂdoy (x1) va sholi (x2) uchun cheklov:", "options": ["x1 + x2 в‰¤ 10", "x1 + x2 в‰Ґ 10", "x1 * x2 в‰¤ 10", "x1 = x2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bug'doy va sholi ekiladigan umumiy yer maydoni 10 gektardan oshmasligi kerak, shuning uchun x1 + x2 в‰¤ 10."}, {"question": "Chiziqli dasturlash nima?", "options": ["Chiziqli maqsad funksiyasini chiziqli cheklovlar ostida optimallashtirish usuli", "Chiziqli bo'lmagan funksiyalarni optimallashtirish usuli", "Differensial tenglamalarni yechish usuli", "Integral hisoblash usuli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Chiziqli dasturlash - bu chiziqli maqsad funksiyasini chiziqli tengsizliklar yoki tengliklar (cheklovlar) ostida maksimal yoki minimal qiymatini topish usuli."}, {"question": "Chiziqli dasturlash masalasining asosiy maqsadi nima?", "options": ["Maqsad funksiyasining ekstremumini topish", "Cheklovlarni aniqlash", "Noma'lum o'zgaruvchilarni topish", "Grafik chizish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Chiziqli dasturlash masalasining asosiy maqsadi berilgan cheklovlar ostida maqsad funksiyasining maksimal yoki minimal qiymatini topishdir."}, {"question": "Chiziqli dasturlash masalasining matematik modelida x1, x2 в‰Ґ 0 sharti nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Nomanfiylik sharti", "Cheklov sharti", "Maqsad sharti", "Optimal shart"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "x1, x2 в‰Ґ 0 sharti noma'lum o'zgaruvchilarning manfiy bo'lmasligi kerakligini bildiruvchi noma'fiylik sharti deyiladi."}, {"question": "Chiziqli dasturlash masalasida cheklangan resurslar (masalan: un, vaqt, pul) qanday ifodalanadi?", "options": ["Tengsizliklar orqali", "Tengliklar orqali", "Maqsad funksiyasi orqali", "Noma'lum o'zgaruvchilar orqali"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Cheklangan resurslar odatda tengsizliklar orqali ifodalanadi, masalan, 'resurs miqdori в‰¤ mavjud resurs' ko'rinishida."}, {"question": "Grafik usul odatda nechta oвЂzgaruvchi boвЂlganda qoвЂllaniladi?", "options": ["2 ta", "3 ta", "1 ta", "4 ta va undan ko'p"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Grafik usul odatda ikki o'zgaruvchili chiziqli dasturlash masalalarini yechishda qo'llaniladi, chunki uni 2D tekislikda tasvirlash mumkin."}, {"question": "Agar masalada foydani koвЂpaytirish soвЂralsa, maqsad funksiyasi nimaga intiladi?", "options": ["Maksimumga", "Minimumga", "Nolga", "Cheksizlikka"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Foydani ko'paytirish masalasida maqsad funksiyasi maksimal qiymatga intiladi."}, {"question": "Agar masalada xarajatlarni kamaytirish soвЂralsa, maqsad funksiyasi nimaga intiladi?", "options": ["Minimumga", "Maksimumga", "Nolga", "Cheksizlikka"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xarajatlarni kamaytirish masalasida maqsad funksiyasi minimal qiymatga intiladi."}, {"question": "Talabaning vaqti: 5 soat boвЂsh vaqt bor. Kitob oвЂqish (x1) va video koвЂ™rish (x2) uchun jami vaqt cheklovi qanday yoziladi?", "options": ["x1 + x2 в‰¤ 5", "x1 + x2 в‰Ґ 5", "x1 * x2 в‰¤ 5", "x1 = x2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Kitob o'qish va video ko'rishga sarflangan umumiy vaqt 5 soatdan oshmasligi kerak, shuning uchun x1 + x2 в‰¤ 5."}, {"question": "Tikuvchilik korxonasi: 12 metr matodan koвЂylak (x1) uchun 3 metr, shim (x2) uchun 2 metr sarflansa, mato cheklovi qaysi javobda toвЂgвЂri?", "options": ["3x1 + 2x2 в‰¤ 12", "3x1 + 2x2 в‰Ґ 12", "x1 + x2 в‰¤ 12", "3x1 = 2x2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ko'ylak va shim uchun sarflangan umumiy mato miqdori 12 metrdan oshmasligi kerak: 3x1 + 2x2 в‰¤ 12."}, {"question": "Vitaminlar: Kuniga kamida 10 birlik vitamin olish kerak. Olma (x1) 2 birlik, banan (x2) 5 birlik vitamin bersa, вЂњkamidaвЂќ     sharti qaysi belgi bilan yoziladi?", "options": ["2x1 + 5x2 в‰Ґ 10", "2x1 + 5x2 в‰¤ 10", "x1 + x2 = 10", "2x1 = 5x2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "'Kamida' sharti katta yoki teng (в‰Ґ) belgisini anglatadi. Demak, 2x1 + 5x2 в‰Ґ 10."}, {"question": "Ikki karrali integralning geometrik maвЂ™nosi nimani bildiradi?", "options": ["Sirt ostidagi hajm", "Egri chiziq ostidagi yuza", "Sirtning uzunligi", "Sirtning yuzasi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki karrali integralning geometrik ma'nosi funksiya grafigi (sirt) ostidagi va integrallash sohasi ustidagi hajmni bildiradi."}, {"question": "Agar ikki karrali integralda integral ostidagi funksiya 1 ga teng boвЂlsa, u nimani hisoblaydi?", "options": ["Integrallash sohasining yuzasini", "Integrallash sohasining hajmini", "Integrallash sohasining perimetrini", "Integrallash sohasining og'irlik markazini"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar integral ostidagi 