vdu", "в€«udv = u'v - в€«v'u", "в€«udv = uv / в€«vdu"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bo'laklab integrallash formulasi в€«udv = uv - в€«vdu ko'rinishida bo'ladi va ikki funksiya ko'paytmasining integralini hisoblashda ishlatiladi."}, {"question": "BoвЂlaklab integrallashda asosiy tanlov nimaga bogвЂliq?", "options": ["u va dv ni to'g'ri tanlashga", "Integrallash chegaralariga", "Funksiyaning uzluksizligiga", "Natijaning musbat bo'lishiga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bo'laklab integrallash usulida u va dv ni to'g'ri tanlash integralni soddalashtirish uchun muhimdir."}, {"question": "Aniq integralning amaliy qoвЂllanilishiga qaysi misol toвЂgвЂri?", "options": ["Yuzani hisoblash", "Hosilani topish", "Funksiyaning limitini aniqlash", "Qatorlarning yaqinlashuvchiligini tekshirish"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Aniq integral yuzani, hajmni, ishni va boshqa fizik kattaliklarni hisoblashda keng qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "в€«1^3 x^2 dx integralning qiymati nimaga teng?", "options": ["26/3", "8", "13/3", "28/3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«1^3 x^2 dx = [x^3/3]_1^3 = (3^3/3) - (1^3/3) = 27/3 - 1/3 = 26/3."}, {"question": "в€«0^2 x^2 dx integralning qiymati nimaga teng?", "options": ["8/3", "4", "2", "16/3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«0^2 x^2 dx = [x^3/3]_0^2 = (2^3/3) - (0^3/3) = 8/3."}, {"question": "OвЂrta qiymat haqidagi teorema qaysi shart bajarilganda qoвЂllaniladi?", "options": ["Funksiya kesmada uzluksiz bo'lsa", "Funksiya kesmada differensiallanuvchi bo'lsa", "Funksiya kesmada monoton bo'lsa", "Funksiya kesmada nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "O'rta qiymat haqidagi teorema funksiya berilgan kesmada uzluksiz bo'lganda qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning [a, b] kesmadagi oвЂrtacha qiymati qaysi formula bilan aniqlanadi?", "options": ["(1/(b-a)) в€«a^b f(x)dx", "в€«a^b f(x)dx", "f(b) - f(a)", "f'(c)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyaning [a, b] kesmadagi o'rtacha qiymati (1/(b-a)) в€«a^b f(x)dx formulasi bilan aniqlanadi."}, {"question": "Nyuton-Leybnits formulasi qaysi ifoda bilan beriladi?", "options": ["в€«a^b f(x)dx = F(b) - F(a)", "в€«a^b f(x)dx = F(a) - F(b)", "в€«a^b f(x)dx = f'(x)", "в€«a^b f(x)dx = F(b) + F(a)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Nyuton-Leybnits formulasi aniq integralni boshlang'ich funksiya orqali hisoblash usulini beradi."}, {"question": "Agar funksiya [a, b] da ishorasini oвЂzgartirsa, yuzani topish uchun qaysi integral ishlatiladi?", "options": ["в€«a^b |f(x)|dx", "в€«a^b f(x)dx", "в€«a^b f'(x)dx", "в€«a^b (f(x))^2 dx"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar funksiya ishorasini o'zgartirsa, yuzani topish uchun funksiyaning modulidan integral olinadi: в€«a^b |f(x)|dx."}, {"question": "Agar y = f(x) в‰Ґ 0 boвЂlsa, [a, b] kesmadagi yuzani hisoblash formulasi qaysi?", "options": ["S = в€«a^b f(x)dx", "S = в€«a^b |f(x)|dx", "S = f(b) - f(a)", "S = в€«a^b f'(x)dx"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar funksiya musbat bo'lsa, yuzani hisoblash uchun S = в€«a^b f(x)dx formulasi ishlatiladi."}, {"question": "Ikki egri chiziq orasidagi yuzani topish formulasi qaysi?", "options": ["S = в€«a^b (f(x) - g(x))dx, agar f(x) в‰Ґ g(x)", "S = в€«a^b f(x)dx + в€«a^b g(x)dx", "S = в€«a^b f(x)g(x)dx", "S = в€«a^b (f(x) + g(x))dx"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki egri chiziq orasidagi yuzani topish u  <chun yuqori funksiyadan quyi funksiya ayirilib integral olinadi."}, {"question": "NyutonвЂ“Leybnits formulasi amaliy jihatdan nimani yengillashtiradi?", "options": ["Aniq integralni hisoblashni", "Hosilani topishni", "Limitlarni hisoblashni", "Qatorlarning yig'indisini topishni"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Nyuton-Leybnits formulasi aniq integralni boshlang'ich funksiya orqali hisoblashni sezilarli darajada soddalashtiradi."}, {"question": "в€«0^2 x dx integralni toping.", "options": ["2", "4", "0", "1"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«0^2 x dx = [x^2/2]_0^2 = (2^2/2) - (0^2/2) = 4/2 = 2."}, {"question": "в€«0^ПЂ cos(x) dx integralni toping.", "options": ["0", "1", "-1", "2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«0^ПЂ cos(x) dx = [sin(x)]_0^ПЂ = sin(ПЂ) - sin(0) = 0 - 0 = 0."}, {"question": "в€«1^3 2x dx integralni toping.", "options": ["8", "4", "2", "10"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "в€«1^3 2x dx = [x^2]_1^3 = 3^2 - 1^2 = 9 - 1 = 8."}, {"question": "Qachon integral xosmas integral deyiladi?", "options": ["Integrallash chegaralaridan kamida bittasi cheksiz bo'lsa yoki integral ostidagi funksiya integrallash oralig'ida uzilishga ega bo'lsa", "Integrallash chegaralari chekli bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya uzluksiz bo'lsa", "Integralning qiymati nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral chegaralari cheksiz bo'lgan yoki integral ostidagi funksiya uzilishga ega bo'lgan integrallarga aytiladi."}, {"question": "Qachon integral I-tur xosmas integral deyiladi?", "options": ["Integrallash chegaralaridan kamida bittasi cheksiz bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya integrallash oralig'ida uzilishga ega bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya uzluksiz bo'lsa", "Integralning qiymati chekli bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "I-tur xosmas integral integrallash chegaralaridan kamida bittasi cheksiz bo'lgan integraldir."}, {"question": "Quyidagi qaysi holatda xosmas integral yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Agar limit chekli son bo'lsa", "Agar limit cheksizlikka intilsa", "Agar limit mavjud bo'lmasa", "Agar integral ostidagi funksiya nolga teng bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xosmas integral, agar uning limiti chekli son bo'lsa, yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Chegarasi cheksiz boвЂlgan integral qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Limit orqali", "Hosilani topish orqali", "Boshlang'ich funksiyani topish orqali", "Bo'laklab integrallash orqali"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Chegarasi cheksiz bo'lgan integral limit orqali aniqlanadi, ya'ni cheksiz chegarani chekli o'zgaruvc