lashuvchi xosmas integral, integralning o'zi va uning moduli integrali ham yaqinlashuvchi ekanligini anglatadi."}, {"question": "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi xosmas integral qaysi holatda yuzaga keladi?", "options": ["Integralning o'zi yaqinlashuvchi, lekin moduli integrali uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Integralning o'zi va uning moduli integrali ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Integralning o'zi uzoqlashuvchi bo'lsa", "Integral ostidagi funksiya musbat bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi xosmas integral, integralning o'zi yaqinlashuvchi bo'lib, uning moduli integrali uzoqlashuvchi bo'lgan holatda yuzaga keladi."}, {"question": "Sonli qator deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["a1 + a2 + a3 + ... ko'rinishidagi cheksiz yig'indiga", "Funksiyalar ketma-ketligiga", "Sonlar ketma-ketligiga", "Chekli yig'indiga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Sonli qator - bu a1 + a2 + a3 + ... ko'rinishidagi cheksiz yig'indi."}, {"question": "Qismiy yigвЂindi Sn qanday aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Sn = a1 + a2 + ... + an", "Sn = a1 + a2 + ... + a(n-1)", "Sn = an", "Sn = lim(nв†’в€ћ) an"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qismiy yig'indi Sn qatorning dastlabki n ta hadining yig'indisi sifatida aniqlanadi."}, {"question": "Qator qachon yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Agar uning qismiy yig'indilar ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa", "Agar uning qismiy yig'indilar ketma-ketligi cheksizlikka intilsa", "Agar uning umumiy hadi nolga intilsa", "Agar uning umumiy hadi nolga intilmasa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qator, agar uning qismiy yig'indilar ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa, yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Qator qachon uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi?", "options": ["Agar uning qismiy yig'indilar ketma-ketligi cheksizlikka intilsa yoki limiti mavjud bo'lmasa", "Agar uning qismiy yig'indilar ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa", "Agar uning umumiy hadi nolga intilsa", "Agar uning umumiy hadi nolga intilmasa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qator, agar uning qismiy yig'indilar ketma-ketligi cheksizlikka intilsa yoki limiti mavjud bo'lmasa, uzoqlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Yaqinlashuvchi qator uchun zaruriy shart qanday?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an в‰  0", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) Sn = L (chekli)", "an > 0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, uning umumiy hadi nolga intilishi shart (lekin bu yetarli shart emas)."}, {"question": "Agar qatorning umumiy hadi an = n^2 / (n+1) boвЂlsa, uning dastlabki 3 ta hadini yozing.", "options": ["1/2, 4/3, 9/4", "1/2, 2/3, 3/4", "1, 2, 3", "1/2, 4/3, 3"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n=1: 1^2/(1+1) = 1/2; n=2: 2^2/(2+1) = 4/3; n=3: 3^2/(3+1) = 9/4."}, {"question": "Agar qatorning umumiy hadi an = n^3 / (n+1) boвЂlsa, uning dastlabki 3 ta hadini yozing.", "options": ["1/2, 8/3, 27/4", "1/2, 2/3, 3/4", "1, 8, 27", "1/2, 4/3, 9/4"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n=1: 1^3/(1+1) = 1/2; n=2: 2^3/(2+1) = 8/3; n=3: 3^3/(3+1) = 27/4."}, {"question": "Agar qatorning umumiy hadi an = 3^n boвЂlsa, uning dastlabki 4 ta hadini yozing.", "options": ["3, 9, 27, 81", "1, 3, 9, 27", "3, 6, 9, 12", "1, 2, 3, 4"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "n=1: 3^1=3; n=2: 3^2=9; n=3: 3^3=27; n=4: 3^4=81."}, {"question": "Agar ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an va ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) bn yaqinlashuvchi boвЂlsa, ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) (an + bn) qanday?", "options": ["Yaqinlashuvchi", "Uzoqlashuvchi", "Ba'zan yaqinlashuvchi, ba'zan uzoqlashuvchi", "Nolga teng"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar ikkita qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lsa, ularning yig'indisi ham yaqinlashuvchi bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Qatorning umumiy had  ?ini yozing: 1/3 + 2/9 + 3/27 + 4/81 + вЂ¦", "options": ["an = n / 3^n", "an = n / (n+2)", "an = 1 / 3^n", "an = n / (3n)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Qatorning har bir hadi n-chi raqamga va 3 ning n-chi darajasiga bo'lingan."}, {"question": "Musbat hadli qator deb nimaga deyiladi?", "options": ["Barcha hadlari musbat bo'lgan qatorga", "Barcha hadlari manfiy bo'lgan qatorga", "Hadlari ishorasini o'zgartiradigan qatorga", "Hadlari nolga teng bo'lgan qatorga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Musbat hadli qator - bu barcha hadlari musbat bo'lgan qator."}, {"question": "Taqqoslash alomati qaysi shartda qoвЂllaniladi?", "options": ["Agar 0 в‰¤ an в‰¤ bn bo'lsa", "Agar an = bn bo'lsa", "Agar an > bn bo'lsa", "Agar an < 0 bo'lsa"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Taqqoslash alomati, agar bir qatorning hadlari boshqa qatorning hadlaridan kichik yoki teng bo'lsa, qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri Dalamber alomati formulasi?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n) = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0", "в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dalamber alomati qatorning yaqinlashuvchiligini tekshirish uchun ketma-ket hadlar nisbatining limitini ishlatadi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri Koshining ildiz alomati formulasi?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n) = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) an = 0", "в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Koshining ildiz alomati qatorning yaqinlashuvchiligini tekshirish uchun hadning n-chi ildizining limitini ishlatadi."}, {"question": "Quyidagilardan qaysi biri Umumlashgan taqqoslash alomati formulasi?", "options": ["lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an/bn) = L (0 < L < в€ћ)", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n) = L", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| = L", "в€«1^в€ћ f(x)dx"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Umumlashgan taqqoslash alomati ikki qator hadlari nisbatining chekli va noldan farqli limitini tekshiradi."}, {"question": "Integral alomatning mazmuni:", "options": ["Agar f(x) musbat, kamayuvchi va uzluksiz bo'lsa, ОЈan va в€«f(x)dx birgalikda yaqinlashadi yoki uzoqlashadi", "Qatorning umumiy hadi nolga intilishi", "Hadlar nisbatining limiti", "Hadlarning n-chi ildizining limiti"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Integral alomat musbat hadli qatorning yaqinlashuvchiligini tegishli xosmas integral bilan taqqoslash orqali aniqlaydi."}, {"question": "Har bir musbat hadidan keyin manfiy had kelsa va har bir manfiy hadidan keyin musbat had kelsa, bu qatorga........ deyiladi.", "options": ["Ishora almashinuvchi qator", "Musbat hadli qator", "Geometrik qator", "Arifmetik qator"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu turdagi qator ishora almashinuvchi qator deb ataladi."}, {"question": "Quyidagi qator: ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) 3^n / n! qanday qator?", "options": ["Yaqinlashuvchi", "Uzoqlashuvchi", "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi", "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dalamber alomati bo'yicha: lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |(3^(n+1)/(n+1)!) / (3^n/n!)| = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |3/(n+1)| = 0 < 1. Demak, yaqinlashuvchi."}, {"question": "Umumiy hadi an = (n^2 - 1) / n^3 boвЂlgan qatorni qaysi alomat yordamida yaqinlashuvchilikka tekshirish qulay?", "options": ["Taqqoslash alomati", "Dalamber alomati", "Koshining ildiz alomati", "Integral alomat"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu qatorni taqqoslash alomati yordamida tekshirish qulay, chunki an в‰€ 1/n ga o'xshaydi, bu esa uzoqlashuvchi garmonik qator."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) 5^n / n! qatorni yaqinlashishga tekshiring.", "options": ["Yaqinlashuvchi", "Uzoqlashuvchi", "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi", "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Dalamber alomati bo'yicha: lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |(5^(n+1)/(n+1)!) / (5^n/n!)| = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |5/(n+1)| = 0 < 1. Demak, yaqinlashuvchi."}, {"question": "Funksional qator deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Hadlari funksiyalar bo'lgan qatorga", "Hadlari sonlar bo'lgan qatorga", "Chekli yig'indiga", "Funksiyalar ketma-ketligiga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation":  @ "Funksional qator - bu hadlari funksiyalar bo'lgan cheksiz yig'indi."}, {"question": "Funksional qatorning umumiy koвЂrinishi toвЂgвЂri berilgan javobni toping", "options": ["ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) fn(x)", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an", "f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) an(x-x0)^n", "lim(nв†’в€ћ) fn(x)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksional qatorning umumiy ko'rinishi ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) fn(x) shaklida bo'ladi."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an (x - x0)^n qator xususiy holda x0 = 0 boвЂlsa qanday koвЂrinishda boвЂladi?", "options": ["ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an x^n", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an x", "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) x^n"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar x0 = 0 bo'lsa, qator ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) an x^n ko'rinishini oladi, bu Makloren qatori deb ham ataladi."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) an x^n darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi qaysi formula orqali aniqlanadi?", "options": ["R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an|", "R = lim(nв†’в€ћ) |an/a(n+1)|", "R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n)", "R = lim(nв†’в€ћ) (an)^(1/n)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi Dalamber alomati yordamida R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| formulasi orqali aniqlanadi."}, {"question": "Uzluksiz funksiyalarning [a, b] kesmada kuchaytirilgan funksional qatorining yigвЂindisi ham bu kesmada ____________ boвЂladi.", "options": ["Uzluksiz", "Differensiallanuvchi", "Integrallanuvchi", "Monoton"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Uzluksiz funksiyalarning tekis yaqinlashuvchi funksional qatorining yig'indisi ham uzluksiz bo'ladi."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) fn(x) Funksional qatorning yaqinlashish sohasi deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lgan barcha x qiymatlari to'plamiga", "Qator uzoqlashuvchi bo'lgan barcha x qiymatlari to'plamiga", "Qatorning umumiy hadi nolga teng bo'lgan nuqtalarga", "Qatorning yig'indisi nolga teng bo'lgan nuqtalarga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Yaqinlashish sohasi - bu qator yaqinlashuvchi bo'lgan barcha x qiymatlari to'plami."}, {"question": "Agar lim(kв†’в€ћ) Sk(x) = S(x) chekli limit mavjud boвЂlsa, u holda ОЈ(k=1 to в€ћ) fk(x) funksional qatorga nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Yaqinlashuvchi", "Uzoqlashuvchi", "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi", "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar funksional qatorning qismiy yig'indilar ketma-ketligi chekli limitga ega bo'lsa, u yaqinlashuvchi deyiladi."}, {"question": "Agar qator faqat juft yoki faqat toq darajalarni oвЂz ichiga olsa yoki darajalari karrali boвЂlsa, va h.k., u holda yaqinlashish oraligвЂi qaysi alomatlardan foydalanib topiladi.", "options": ["Dalamber yoki Koshi alomatlari", "Integral alomat", "Taqqoslash alomati", "Leibniz alomati"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Darajali qatorlarning yaqinlashish oralig'ini topishda Dalamber yoki Koshi alomatlari keng qo'llaniladi."}, {"question": "ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) x^n / n qatorni x = 1 da tekshiring. Qaysi javob toвЂgвЂri?", "options": ["Uzoqlashuvchi", "Yaqinlashuvchi", "Shartli yaqinlashuvchi", "Absolyut yaqinlashuvchi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "x = 1 bo'lganda qator ОЈ(n=1 to в€ћ) 1/n ko'rinishini oladi, bu esa garmonik qator bo'lib, uzoqlashuvchidir."}, {"question": "Agar lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| = 2 boвЂlsa, darajali qatorning yaqinlashish radiusi nechaga teng?", "options": ["1/2", "2", "1", "0"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Yaqinlashish radiusi R = 1 / lim(nв†’в€ћ) |a(n+1)/an| formulasi bilan aniqlanadi. Demak, R = 1/2."}, {"question": "Teylor qatori nima?", "options": ["Funksiyani bir nuqta atrofida darajali qatorga yoyish", "Funksiyani cheksiz yig'indi ko'rinishida ifodalash", "Funksiyaning hosilalarini hisoblash usuli", "Funksiyaning integralini topish usuli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teylor qatori funksiyani ma'lum bir nuqta atrofida cheksiz darajali qatorga yoyish usulidir."}, {"question": "Makloren qatori nima?", "options": ["Teylor qatorining x0 = 0 bo'lgan xususiy holi", "Funksiyani cheksiz yig'indi ko'rinishida ifodalash", "Funksiyaning hosilalarini hisoblash usuli", "Funksiyaning integralini t  Aopish usuli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Makloren qatori Teylor qatorining x0 = 0 bo'lgan xususiy holidir."}, {"question": "вЂњFunksiyani darajali qatorga yoyishвЂќ deganda nima tushuniladi?", "options": ["Funksiyani cheksiz darajali ko'phad ko'rinishida ifodalash", "Funksiyaning hosilalarini topish", "Funksiyaning integralini hisoblash", "Funksiyaning limitini aniqlash"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyani darajali qatorga yoyish - bu funksiyani cheksiz darajali ko'phad ko'rinishida ifodalashdir."}, {"question": "e^x funksiyaning Makloren qatori qaysi?", "options": ["ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n / n!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n) / (2n)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "e^x funksiyasining Makloren qatori ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n / n! dir."}, {"question": "sin x funksiyaning Makloren qatori qaysi?", "options": ["ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^n / n!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n) / (2n)!", "ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)!"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "sin x funksiyasining Makloren qatori ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (-1)^n x^(2n+1) / (2n+1)! dir."}, {"question": "Agar Teylor qatorida x0 = 0 deb olinsa, funksiyaning x ning darajalari boвЂyicha qaysi qatorni hosil qilamiz?", "options": ["Makloren qatorini", "Fur'ye qatorini", "Geometrik qatorni", "Arifmetik qatorni"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teylor qatorida x0 = 0 deb olinsa, Makloren qatori hosil bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Teylor qatori yordamida taqribiy hisoblashning asosiy gвЂoyasi nimada?", "options": ["Murakkab funksiyalarni ko'phadlar bilan almashtirish", "Funksiyaning aniq qiymatini topish", "Funksiyaning hosilalarini topish", "Funksiyaning integralini hisoblash"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Teylor qatori murakkab funksiyalarni osonroq hisoblanadigan ko'phadlar bilan taqribiy almashtirish imkonini beradi."}, {"question": "Makloren qatori qaysi formula asosida yoziladi?", "options": ["f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (f^(n)(0) / n!) x^n", "f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (f^(n)(x0) / n!) (x-x0)^n", "f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) an x^n", "f(x) = f(0) + f'(0)x + f''(0)x^2/2!"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Makloren qatori f(x) = ОЈ(n=0 to в€ћ) (f^(n)(0) / n!) x^n formulasi asosida yoziladi."}, {"question": "e^x qatori nima sababdan qulay?", "options": ["Uning hosilasi va integrali o'ziga tengligi sababli", "Uning hadlari juda tez kamayishi sababli", "Uning yaqinlashish radiusi cheksizligi sababli", "Uning faqat musbat hadlari borligi sababli"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "e^x funksiyasining hosilasi va integrali o'ziga teng bo'lganligi sababli, uning Makloren qatorini hisoblash juda qulay."}, {"question": "Qaysi funksiya uchun birinchi va ikkinchi tartibli hosilasining 0 dagi qiymati bir xil?", "options": ["e^x", "sin x", "cos x", "ln(1+x)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "e^x funksiyasining barcha tartibli hosilalari e^x ga teng, shuning uchun x=0 da ularning qiymati e^0 = 1 ga teng bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya qanday taвЂ™riflanadi?", "options": ["Har bir (x, y) juftiga bitta z qiymatini mos qo'yuvchi qoida", "Har bir x ga bitta y qiymatini mos qo'yuvchi qoida", "Uch o'zgaruvchili funksiya", "Bir o'zgaruvchili funksiya"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya har bir (x, y) juftiga bitta z qiymatini mos qo'yuvchi qoida sifatida ta'riflanadi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya odatda qanday koвЂrinishda yoziladi?", "options": ["z = f(x, y)", "y = f(x)", "f(x, y, z)", "x = f(y)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya odatda z = f(x, y) ko'rinishida yoziladi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiyaning aniqlanish sohasi nima?", "options": ["Funksiya aniqlangan (x, y) nuqtalar to'plami", "Funksiyaning qiymatlari to'plami", "Funksiyaning hosilalari to'plami", "Funksiyaning integrallari to'plami"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Aniqlanish sohasi - bu funksiya aniqlangan barcha (x, y) nuqtalar to'plami."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funk  Bsiya limiti qanday belgilanadi?", "options": ["lim((x,y)в†’(x0,y0)) f(x,y)", "lim(xв†’x0) f(x)", "lim(yв†’y0) f(y)", "f(x0, y0)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiya limiti lim((x,y)в†’(x0,y0)) f(x,y) ko'rinishida belgilanadi."}, {"question": "Agar funksiya nuqtada aniqlanmagan boвЂlsa, bu nuqta qanday ataladi?", "options": ["Uzilish nuqtasi", "Ekstremum nuqtasi", "Statsionar nuqta", "Kritik nuqta"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar funksiya bir nuqtada aniqlanmagan bo'lsa, bu nuqta uzilish nuqtasi deb ataladi."}, {"question": "Uch oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya qanday yoziladi?", "options": ["u = f(x, y, z)", "z = f(x, y)", "y = f(x)", "f(x, y)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Uch o'zgaruvchili funksiya u = f(x, y, z) ko'rinishida yoziladi."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 boвЂlsa, f(1,2) ni toping.", "options": ["5", "3", "1", "4"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "f(1,2) = 1^2 + 2^2 = 1 + 4 = 5."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = 2x + y boвЂlsa, f(1,3) ni toping.", "options": ["5", "4", "6", "7"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "f(1,3) = 2*1 + 3 = 2 + 3 = 5."}, {"question": "Agar f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 + xy boвЂlsa, f(1,2) ni toping.", "options": ["7", "5", "6", "8"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "f(1,2) = 1^2 + 2^2 + 1*2 = 1 + 4 + 2 = 7."}, {"question": "Uch oвЂzgaruvchili funksiya qaysi fazoda aniqlanadi?", "options": ["Uch o'lchovli fazoda (R^3)", "Ikki o'lchovli fazoda (R^2)", "Bir o'lchovli fazoda (R)", "To'rt o'lchovli fazoda (R^4)"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Uch o'zgaruvchili funksiya uch o'lchovli fazoda (R^3) aniqlanadi."}, {"question": "Xususiy hosila hisoblanayotgan oвЂzgaruvchidan boshqa barcha oвЂzgaruvchilar nima deb qaraladi?", "options": ["O'zgarmaslar", "Funksiyalar", "Nollar", "Cheksizlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Xususiy hosila hisoblanayotganda, boshqa o'zgaruvchilar o'zgarmas deb qaraladi."}, {"question": "z = f(x, y) funksiyasida faqat x oвЂzgarganda funksiya qanday orttirma oladi?", "options": ["в€†x z = f(x + в€†x, y) - f(x, y)", "в€†y z = f(x, y + в€†y) - f(x, y)", "в€†z = f(x + в€†x, y + в€†y) - f(x, y)", "dz = (в€‚f/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚f/в€‚y)dy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Faqat x o'zgarganda funksiya в€†x z = f(x + в€†x, y) - f(x, y) orttirma oladi."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning toвЂla differensiali qaysi harf bilan belgilanadi?", "options": ["dz", "dx", "dy", "df"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyaning to'la differensiali dz yoki df bilan belgilanadi."}, {"question": "Ikki oвЂzgaruvchili funksiyaning nechta birinchi tartibli xususiy hosilasi bor?", "options": ["2 ta", "1 ta", "3 ta", "4 ta"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki o'zgaruvchili funksiyaning x va y bo'yicha ikkita birinchi tartibli xususiy hosilasi bor."}, {"question": "z''xy va z''yx hosilalar nima deb ataladi?", "options": ["Aralash ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosilalar", "Birinchi tartibli xususiy hosilalar", "To'la differensial", "Ikkinchi tartibli to'la hosilalar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu hosilalar aralash ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosilalar deb ataladi."}, {"question": "ToвЂla differensial formulasini koвЂrsating.", "options": ["dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = dx + dy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "To'la differensial formulasi dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy ko'rinishida bo'ladi."}, {"question": "Ikkinchi tartibli hosila deb nimaga aytiladi?", "options": ["Birinchi tartibli hosiladan olingan hosilaga", "Funksiyaning o'ziga", "Funksiyaning integraliga", "Funksiyaning limitiga"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikkinchi tartibli hosila - bu funksiyaning birinchi tartibli hosilasidan olingan hosila."}, {"question": "Agar z = x^2 + y boвЂlsa, z'x nimaga teng?", "options": ["2x", "1", "y", "x"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x^2 + y funksiyasining x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 2x ga teng (y o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "Agar z = x + y^3 boвЂlsa, z'y nimaga teng?", "options": ["3y^2", "1", "x", "y"], "correct_  Cindex": 0, "explanation": "z = x + y^3 funksiyasining y bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 3y^2 ga teng (x o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "z = x + y + c funksiyaning x boвЂyicha hosilasi nimaga teng?", "options": ["1", "y", "c", "x"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x + y + c funksiyasining x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 1 ga teng (y va c o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "Funksiyada faqat x oвЂzgarganda olingan в€†x z = f(x + в€†x, y) - f(x, y) ayirma nima deyiladi?", "options": ["x bo'yicha xususiy orttirma", "y bo'yicha xususiy orttirma", "To'la orttirma", "Differensial"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu ayirma x bo'yicha xususiy orttirma deb ataladi."}, {"question": "z funksiyaning x boвЂyicha xususiy hosilasi qanday belgilanadi?", "options": ["в€‚z/в€‚x", "dz/dx", "z'", "z_x"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z funksiyaning x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi в€‚z/в€‚x yoki z'_x yoki z_x bilan belgilanadi."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq differensial qaysi harf bilan belgilanadi?", "options": ["dz", "dx", "dy", "dF"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "To'liq differensial dz bilan belgilanadi."}, {"question": "ToвЂliq differensialni hisoblash formulasini koвЂrsating:", "options": ["dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx", "dz = (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy", "dz = dx + dy"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "To'liq differensial formulasi dz = (в€‚z/в€‚x)dx + (в€‚z/в€‚y)dy ko'rinishida bo'ladi."}, {"question": "в€‚^2z/в€‚x^2 koвЂrinishidagi hosila nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosila", "Birinchi tartibli xususiy hosila", "Aralash hosila", "To'la differensial"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Bu ikkinchi tartibli xususiy hosila bo'lib, z funksiyasidan x bo'yicha ikki marta hosila olinganini bildiradi."}, {"question": "F(x, y) = 0 koвЂrinishida berilgan funksiya nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Oshkormas funksiya", "Oshkor funksiya", "Bir o'zgaruvchili funksiya", "Ko'p o'zgaruvchili funksiya"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "F(x, y) = 0 ko'rinishida berilgan funksiya oshkormas funksiya deyiladi."}, {"question": "z = 5x + 8y funksiya uchun z'x ni toping", "options": ["5", "8", "5x", "8y"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = 5x + 8y funksiyasining x bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 5 ga teng (8y o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "z = x^2 + 7y funksiya uchun z'y ni toping", "options": ["7", "2x", "x^2", "7y"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z = x^2 + 7y funksiyasining y bo'yicha xususiy hosilasi 7 ga teng (x^2 o'zgarmas deb qaraladi)."}, {"question": "z = 10 funksiyaning x boвЂyicha xususiy hosilasi z'x nimaga teng?", "options": ["0", "10", "x", "y"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "O'zgarmas sonning xususiy hosilasi nolga teng."}, {"question": "z = x^2 boвЂlsa, ikkinchi tartibli z''xx tartibli hosilani toping:", "options": ["2", "2x", "0", "x"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "z'x = 2x, z''xx = 2."}, {"question": "Funksiyaning maksimum va minimum nuqtalari umumiy qanday nomlanadi?", "options": ["Ekstremum nuqtalari", "Statsionar nuqtalar", "Kritik nuqtalar", "Uzilish nuqtalari"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Funksiyaning maksimum va minimum nuqtalari ekstremum nuqtalari deb ataladi."}, {"question": "Ekstremumga tekshirishda в€† = AC - B^2 < 0 boвЂlsa, xulosa qanday boвЂladi?", "options": ["Ekstremum yo'q (egarlanish nuqtasi)", "Maksimum", "Minimum", "Aniqlab bo'lmaydi"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar в€† < 0 bo'lsa, bu nuqtada ekstremum yo'q, u egarlanish nuqtasi bo'ladi."}, {"question": "OвЂzgaruvchilari orasida П†(x, y) = 0 bogвЂlanish tenglamasi berilgan ekstremum nima deyiladi?", "options": ["Shartli ekstremum", "Absolyut ekstremum", "Lokal ekstremum", "Global ekstremum"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Cheklov sharti ostida topiladigan ekstremum shartli ekstremum deyiladi."}, {"question": "Shartli ekstremumni topishda qaysi funksiya yordamida hisoblashlar o