 = x2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Kitob o'qish va video ko'rish uchun sarflangan umumiy vaqt 5 soatdan oshmasligi kerak."}, {"question": "Tikuvchilik korxonasi: 12 metr matodan koвЂylak (x1) uchun 3 metr, shim (x2) uchun 2 metr sarflansa, mato cheklovi qaysi javobda toвЂgвЂri?", "options": ["3x1 + 2x2 в‰¤ 12", "3x1 + 2x2 в‰Ґ 12", "x1     + x2 в‰¤ 12", "3x1 = 2x2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ko'ylak va shim uchun sarflangan umumiy mato miqdori 12 metrdan oshmasligi kerak."}, {"question": "Vitaminlar: Kuniga kamida 10 birlik vitamin olish kerak. Olma (x1) 2 birlik, banan (x2) 5 birlik vitamin bersa, вЂњkamidaвЂќ sharti qaysi belgi bilan yoziladi?", "options": ["2x1 + 5x2 в‰Ґ 10", "2x1 + 5x2 в‰¤ 10", "x1 + x2 в‰Ґ 10", "2x1 = 5x2"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Kamida 10 birlik vitamin olish kerakligi в‰Ґ belgisini talab qiladi."}, {"question": "Ikki karrali integralning geometrik maвЂ™nosi nimani bildiradi?", "options": ["Sirt ostidagi hajm", "Sirtning yuzasi", "Egri chiziqning uzunligi", "Funksiyaning qiymati"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Ikki karrali integral geometrik jihatdan sirt ostidagi hajmni bildiradi."}, {"question": "Agar ikki karrali integralda integral ostidagi funksiya 1 ga teng boвЂlsa, u nimani hisoblaydi?", "options": ["Integrallash sohasining yuzasini", "Integrallash sohasining hajmini", "Integrallash sohasining perimetrini", "Integrallash sohasining og'irlik markazini"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Agar integral ostidagi funksiya 1 ga teng bo'lsa, ikki karrali integral integrallash sohasining yuzasini hisoblaydi."}, {"question": "Axborot xavfsizligida barmoq izi matematik modelini nima orqali qurish mumkin?", "options": ["Ikki karrali integral", "Bir karrali integral", "Hosilalar", "Qatorlar"], "correct_index": 0, "explanation": "Barmoq izi kabi murakkab geometrik shakllarning xususiyatlarini tahlil qilishda ikki karrali integrallar qo'llanilishi mumkin."}, {"question": "Bir jinsli plastinkaning massas